{"time": 1756682068, "type": "recv", "message_id": "796301846", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2117044384]她也没有再说什么，四周的一切陷入沉寂...如同坠入无边的黑暗中，不停下坠...失重感攫住了你"}
{"time": 1756682195, "type": "recv", "message_id": "218038919", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“怎么……回事？”*在深渊中艰难取得意识。视线无处聚焦"}
{"time": 1756682228, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1477521514", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "似乎永无尽头，蔓延到无限边际的深穴...四周只有混沌萦绕的黑暗，你除了自己的触觉之外什么都没获得，纯粹的自由落体"}
{"time": 1756682357, "type": "recv", "message_id": "813904129", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "*努力张开四肢，变成不至于乱滚的自由落体姿势，无谓地看向或许是落点的方向“这又是谁的梦……要去哪？”"}
{"time": 1756682459, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1365973483", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "视觉最先恢复，于尽头似乎捕捉到了一丝白光"}
{"time": 1756682564, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1362500254", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“……”*眯着眼睛，试着看清一点"}
