{"time": 1756687412, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1702655421", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1042723662]发黑的程度在加深，甚至感觉掐一把会出脓水\"如果...\""}
{"time": 1756687624, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1202197070", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1375118435]你以前没有听说过有什么玛文的消息，不过...你记得城内似乎有流传所谓安息的教义，他们的教主似乎叫这个名字"}
{"time": 1756687675, "type": "recv", "message_id": "612623198", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=492918383]\"...是我说的不够浅显吗？\""}
{"time": 1756687690, "type": "recv", "message_id": "430460933", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“师父她们是被谁杀的.....可以告诉我吗，西莉丝姐姐”"}
{"time": 1756687765, "type": "recv", "message_id": "337861897", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1702655421]“喔……不太妙”*皱了皱眉“虽然这里作为安眠地来说确实不错……但是我好像不能久留”"}
{"time": 1756688252, "type": "recv", "message_id": "997716459", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=337861897]\"...\"她抬起头，你看见她的笑容，\"嗯...不要留在这里哦?要温柔地待人...\"她站起身，\"腿的事，不要紧吗\""}
{"time": 1756688335, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1773573047", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=430460933]\"...又要干嘛?\""}
{"time": 1756688408, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1711345140", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=997716459]“挺要紧的，感觉再呆一会要有一部分变成尸体了”*抿了抿嘴“明明只是失去触觉，为什么……”"}
{"time": 1756688433, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1088176436", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我只想知道...仇人是谁...”"}
{"time": 1756688493, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1390454841", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1711345140]\"这样啊...\"她走到你面前，弯下腰对着你的腿伸出手，黑色渐渐退去，等到她抬起手，她掌心覆盖的地方出现一抹橘黄色的飞花形状的纹路，\"回去吧。"}
{"time": 1756688629, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1514420876", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“如果...我能继续活下去...唯一的动力也只有仇恨了吧...”"}
{"time": 1756688665, "type": "recv", "message_id": "836532009", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"这个问题，只有你自己去寻找才有意义。\"她松开手，\"而且我说过，你不能永远靠着这个理由。\"皱眉"}
{"time": 1756688674, "type": "recv", "message_id": "358938539", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1390454841]“呃……？”*意外地看着她，再仔细感受一下自己的腿部“这是……”"}
{"time": 1756688905, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2063089173", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=358938539]\"独属于我的咒文哦?\"她轻轻笑了笑，\"这样...妃花就能随时随地看见你了。\""}
{"time": 1756689017, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1548444423", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“靠着这个理由...我应该能活个十几年了吧...”"}
{"time": 1756689172, "type": "recv", "message_id": "203591800", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“可以的话我还挺在意隐私的……不过只要你不在我耳边三天两头说的话，倒是也无所谓”*歪歪头“不过为什么？”"}
{"time": 1756689201, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2103097561", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "看看手上的手链“我...一定会帮你们报仇的...”"}
{"time": 1756689205, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1693678208", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1548444423]\"不行，这样的话，你还是待着这里吧。\"她起身准备离开"}
{"time": 1756689309, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1949064678", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "拽住她不让她走"}
{"time": 1756689313, "type": "recv", "message_id": "753112850", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=203591800]\"嗯嗯..妃花只会让人深陷..不不，没什么。我不会惹伊芙讨厌的。\"她捂着嘴，\"因为...安息很让人沉醉吧？没有神可以相信...只有玛文大人...\""}
{"time": 1756689447, "type": "recv", "message_id": "677663742", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“那...为什么...为什么只有我活了下来....”"}
{"time": 1756689579, "type": "recv", "message_id": "354826357", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“也许吧，虽然，如果有外星人的话，它们会看到很神奇的景象”*想了想所有人都在梦中的画面“但是在那之前，我要给一个人带去做梦的资格”"}
{"time": 1756689885, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1706512235", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=677663742](为什么偏偏是，没有理想如同空壳的你活了下来?)"}
{"time": 1756689956, "type": "recv", "message_id": "691960225", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“总之，我该走咯”*试着蹦跶一番？"}
{"time": 1756689988, "type": "recv", "message_id": "27235803", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=691960225]\"...嗯...既然你知道自己在做梦，那?\"她对你甜甜一笑，似乎在暗示"}
{"time": 1756689993, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1434651223", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:image,file=4FCB5B0FDC8471320063AD1EE99BADA4.jpeg,sub_type=0,url=https://multimedia.nt.qq.com.cn/download?appid=1407&amp;fileid=EhQp5V-VdHsyPNLmH-n6Ortnsh7zWhjm-gIg_woo1sbbl7S2jwMyBHByb2RQgL2jAVoQlD2ElMUnNU7qHSt891B7wHoCdKs&amp;rkey=CAMSMHUPSACr4RI_jXETr5Kqtiwov9T8nDl4uK6aOE0rUvVE_99IlbG8euDqFQBtLff_kw,file_size=48486]"}
{"time": 1756690080, "type": "recv", "message_id": "128048641", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“我倒是在梦里试过咬自己什么的，一般都醒不来”*歪了歪头“不过梦里上厕所倒是……”"}
{"time": 1756690164, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1070590295", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=677663742]\"不清楚，但是重要吗？\""}
{"time": 1756690169, "type": "recv", "message_id": "33014746", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"难道你比我们更特别?\""}
{"time": 1756690225, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2129114185", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=128048641]\"只要清楚自己在做梦就好了...梦就是这样缥缈的东西呢，不是吗？\"话说出口的瞬间，周围的场景破碎，她的笑容留在你的眼底，四周重归于混沌"}
{"time": 1756690253, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1959628548", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（活着的理由）"}
