{"time": 1756797349, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1831101254", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=534343532]\"可能吧。\"她打量了一下，\"品味真差。\"你们也注意到他们在张贴着什么。"}
{"time": 1756797400, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1312708302", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1553109893]“还数得清么……这是在贴什么，通缉令？”"}
{"time": 1756797404, "type": "recv", "message_id": "691721563", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“确实，丑丑的”看看张贴的东西"}
