{"time": 1756836483, "type": "recv", "message_id": "978810731", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1383658824]\"我有说不给你交...\"她刚说一半，\"啧，比起宾森特，这边倒是更符合所谓掌权者的印象。\""}
