{"time": 1756917934, "type": "recv", "message_id": "710811252", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=956168282]\"嗯...\"她放开手，\"其实我可以强迫你。\"她的话听不出明显的倾向，更像是陈述事实。"}
{"time": 1756917983, "type": "recv", "message_id": "560890848", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=687236556]\"啊啦...不可以探究姐姐的秘密哦?\"她拍拍你的脑袋，\"这次见面很快就会结束啦，只要还记得我就可以啦。\""}
{"time": 1756918022, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1261293474", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“姐姐的名字是...我好像记不太清了”"}
{"time": 1756918070, "type": "recv", "message_id": "394268865", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=710811252]“我也可以和你拼了”*咬咬牙“我原本还以为……你没那么疯”"}
{"time": 1756918111, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1988360225", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1261293474]\"不需要记得，你只要看见我能知道...我就是你最喜欢的人，这样就好，记住哦?是最～喜～欢～\""}
{"time": 1756918200, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1220885218", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=394268865]\"玛文大人的安息，是我赖以为生的一切。\"她退开两步，微垂着双眼，\"虽然...我和他不同，但终究不能背弃安息。\""}
{"time": 1756918218, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1098750851", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(本来就不怎么疯啊，可谓是理性传教代表)"}
{"time": 1756918262, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1225688579", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“最...喜欢....不...不对...”抱着头蹲下“...露露...师父...姐姐都是我喜欢的人...我...排不出来.高低...”"}
{"time": 1756918474, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2055134254", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1225688579]\"不～一直都是我在最前面哦?\"她的指尖挑起你的下巴，\"要把我...牢牢地记住\""}
{"time": 1756918551, "type": "recv", "message_id": "649133194", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "感觉脑袋快要炸了...“我...好像有点做不到...”"}
{"time": 1756918565, "type": "recv", "message_id": "938636921", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（过个意志？）"}
{"time": 1756918569, "type": "recv", "message_id": "654444542", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1220885218]“……那是你的一切，不是其他人的，不是我的。我的一切令有人在”*即使明白这是对方的领域，也依旧试着抓出自己的匕首来"}
{"time": 1756918703, "type": "recv", "message_id": "292018432", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "余光瞥了眼手上的手链.....“我..很喜欢姐姐...但把姐姐放在露露和师父..前面...”感觉心莫名的有些痛"}
{"time": 1756918765, "type": "recv", "message_id": "116797761", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(那你过意志吧)"}
