{"time": 1756987412, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1614322993", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1859066008]“难道你就很乐意在这种地方过活？”*撇撇嘴“都是权宜”"}
{"time": 1756987573, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2026161730", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=830825494]\"开个玩笑啦。\"她挑了挑眉毛，\"僵尸倒不至于，不过那个环确实是死过一次的证明，尽管是在梦中。\""}
{"time": 1756987632, "type": "recv", "message_id": "493283392", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“这个会自然消失吗...”"}
{"time": 1756987816, "type": "recv", "message_id": "282438484", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1614322993]\"我是无所谓啦，小本买卖。\"她换了个姿势，躺在自己的椅子上，\"像你这种苦大仇深的小妹妹，当然不懂惬意是什么感觉。\""}
{"time": 1756987937, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1022035962", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "*没有否定的意思“无所谓，我也乐在其中。”*用左眼试图解析一下眼前的人“……不过这城里能人异士是不是太多了？”"}
{"time": 1756988133, "type": "recv", "message_id": "353624635", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=493283392]“不会。”她摇摇头，“这是破坏的痕迹，看一眼就会认出来...”她的表情变得严肃起来，“千万不要累计到三个，那样的话...就会变成真正的‘僵尸’，再无自己的意志...”"}
{"time": 1756988151, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1566324637", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（还有破灭之歌）"}
