{"time": 1757006343, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1138713302", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“没什么特别想做的事情,非要说的话，想去一趟学院，我和一个人有约定来着...”不知道艾璃西雅姐姐现在怎么样了"}
{"time": 1757006352, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2092335250", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=932949397]“谁？看人换衣服是什么习惯？”"}
{"time": 1757006828, "type": "recv", "message_id": "664858185", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1138713302]\"哦...?约定了什么?\"说着话的同时她在自己的纱裙上套上一套不知何时准备好的方便出行的黑色系裙装，自顾自坐到了梳妆的镜子前。"}
{"time": 1757006909, "type": "recv", "message_id": "974713978", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“本来约定是昨晚她来骑士团找我来着”"}
{"time": 1757006913, "type": "recv", "message_id": "165333592", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2092335250]\"没事没事，冲我来的。\"卡珊德拉停顿了一下，\"我会很快解决咯?\"蓝宝石胸针闪烁了一下，从你的胸口消失，那个人影也随之离开。"}
{"time": 1757006967, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1759387455", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“那个姐姐感觉总是把过错都揽到自己身上，我害怕她找不到我会多想..”"}
{"time": 1757007222, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1386310897", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=165333592]“……神神秘秘的，你的熟人是不是太多了？”"}
{"time": 1757007656, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1762123725", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1759387455]\"哦...她是那么说的吗？\"西里斯表情有些凝重，\"如果她真的去了的话...你应该找不到她\""}
{"time": 1757007691, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1961532915", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“哎？为什么....她不会出什么事了吧”"}
{"time": 1757007966, "type": "recv", "message_id": "956333132", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1386310897]当然没有人回复，但随着她离开，左眼的蓝光却没有消散的迹象，相反，甚至开始有些发烫"}
{"time": 1757008337, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1762935809", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=956333132]“呃……”*接着洗手间的水敷在眼睛上“干什么去了……”"}
{"time": 1757008486, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1843729458", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1961532915]\"我早上说的话你是一点没听?\"她伸出手用力拧着你的耳朵，\"外环和中环已经彼此封锁了对不对?\""}
{"time": 1757008593, "type": "recv", "message_id": "192258592", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“哎，疼疼疼...西莉丝姐姐，封锁的具体时间是什么时候”"}
{"time": 1757009198, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1392058894", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1762935809]似乎左眼就保持这么一个状态，微微发烫，但是总不至于烫伤。"}
{"time": 1757009234, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2096511227", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=192258592]\"你要知道我之前是什么状态，你就不至于问出这样的话了。\"她的手更用力一些，你感觉耳朵要掉了"}
{"time": 1757009263, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1931643519", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“对.. 对不起，西莉丝姐姐”"}
{"time": 1757009427, "type": "recv", "message_id": "810996904", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我还是去找找她看看吧..也许她去找我的时候还没有封锁”"}
{"time": 1757009585, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1372732802", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1392058894]“……”*快速换好衣服出门看看"}
{"time": 1757009662, "type": "recv", "message_id": "856033083", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=810996904]\"倒也不是不可以...\"她看了看天色，\"你没有翻过衣柜吗？里面有合适的衣服。\""}
{"time": 1757009701, "type": "recv", "message_id": "734483410", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“这件衣服就挺漂亮的，我很喜欢...”"}
{"time": 1757009994, "type": "recv", "message_id": "879958170", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1372732802]老板娘百无聊赖地坐在前台，甚至懒得看你，手里捧着一本时兴的时尚杂志，有一搭没一搭地翻着"}
{"time": 1757010108, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2146336184", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=734483410](描述一下?)"}
{"time": 1757010133, "type": "recv", "message_id": "953851778", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（就是昨天买的那件啊）"}
{"time": 1757010169, "type": "recv", "message_id": "669204053", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=992679143]身着一套白色的裙装，典型的欧式宫廷风格。上衣部分采用了紧身的剪裁，贴合身形。领口是精致的低领设计，边缘处用银色的丝线绣着繁复的卷草花纹。肩部有蓬松的泡泡袖，上面点缀着同色系的蕾丝花边，层层叠叠。裙身部分，裙摆宽大且呈 A 字型散开，裙摆内层还衬有白色的薄纱，同时配套了一双白色的过膝长靴，靴口处装饰着一圈蓬松的白色绒毛"}
{"time": 1757010656, "type": "recv", "message_id": "766773730", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=734483410]\"嗯...不过现在是下午哦...一般来说是进不去学院的。\""}
{"time": 1757010745, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1779793016", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“emmm，可以去找她姐姐问问，她姐姐倒是在学校外面”"}
{"time": 1757010872, "type": "recv", "message_id": "803583200", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"这样...\"她坐在镜子前为自己梳理头发，手指灵巧地扎起一侧的马尾，\"那待会就麻烦诺维拉带路了。\""}
{"time": 1757011178, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1661338795", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“嗯嗯，谢谢西莉丝姐姐”"}
{"time": 1757011459, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1945660125", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "等待西莉丝梳妆完毕，然后带她去那个法师塔"}
{"time": 1757011515, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1995767841", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=879958170]*想想看，刚刚见到的人长什么样？有印象吗？"}
{"time": 1757011634, "type": "recv", "message_id": "106257595", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1945660125]标志性的双马尾，脑袋上搭着一顶帽子，黑色的套裙没过膝盖，待着同样的黑色的手套，很适合出席一些正式的场合。"}
{"time": 1757011707, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2123364503", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“走吧，西莉丝姐姐...她姐姐叫艾尔，好像是个很厉害的法师，西莉丝姐姐认识吗”"}
{"time": 1757011728, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1396994270", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1995767841]在门外，你唯一的印象，似乎对方不矮，脑后梳着发髻的样子。\n\"哦...还算合适?\"老板娘从杂志上抬起头瞥了你一眼，\"说起来，要不要给你的左眼配一只眼罩?\""}
{"time": 1757011786, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1643908417", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“不用，我用着不算碍事”*摇摇头“刚刚是不是有什么人来过……”"}
{"time": 1757011881, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1814901848", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2123364503]\"有点印象倒是...\"西里斯起身，你们一起下楼。夕阳时分的酒店里多了一些开房的旅客，对于这里的价格，他们都没什么反应，光从着装上就能看出这些人身份的显贵，\"三年前毕业的学院天才，据说是幻术科的天才。\""}
{"time": 1757011943, "type": "recv", "message_id": "809066568", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“之前看过她的魔法，确实很神奇，但原来是幻术吗 我还以为是空间之类的”"}
{"time": 1757011983, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1556964339", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1643908417]\"没有啊。\"她垂下眼看杂志，貌似无意地开口，\"扑腾扑腾放光，在夜晚可是被当做漂亮的蛾子逮进笼子。\""}
{"time": 1757012035, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1699712356", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“……那麻烦您了，多少钱？”*提着自己先前的衣服，规规矩矩地站着"}
{"time": 1757012088, "type": "recv", "message_id": "180494076", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（你不是付过钱了么）"}
{"time": 1757012146, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1089166116", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（眼罩的钱）"}
{"time": 1757012152, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2029395923", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（好的）"}
{"time": 1757012184, "type": "recv", "message_id": "749926421", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=809066568]\"幻术...或者说精神向的天才。\"你们走进大街，和早上倒是差不多，人流多了一些，夹杂着蓝衣的制服们。"}
{"time": 1757012230, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1681141997", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "带着西莉丝姐姐去那个法师塔"}
{"time": 1757012265, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1683201126", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1699712356]\"你看着付吧？\"她只是淡淡笑了笑，伸出手对着墙壁的方向随意一指，一条白色的眼罩飞出来落在柜台上"}
{"time": 1757012371, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1244932164", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“看着付……”*低头看着那条眼罩，略有些为难“别考验我的眼光了，我自己没有那种东西”"}
{"time": 1757012396, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1897411622", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（因为你没带零钱，所以最少也是一个金币吧）"}
{"time": 1757012414, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1189326178", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（我的意思是我看不出来是不是魔法物品）"}
{"time": 1757012497, "type": "recv", "message_id": "58730645", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"...\"她的轻笑声传到你耳边，紧接着隔着杂志开口，\"在失控的现在，免费给你用一段时间吧，记得还我，连本带息。\""}
{"time": 1757012576, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1972143524", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“虽然我还是习惯明码标价一些”*叹了口气，还是拿起眼罩戴上“谢谢……还没请教女士的称呼？”"}
{"time": 1757012753, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1529005394", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"无需挂怀。\"她把杂志扔到一边，继续趴在柜台上，\"尽管这么说...非要一个称谓的话，你可以叫我诺玛。\""}
{"time": 1757012818, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2110069435", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1681141997]并不存在，至少当你抵达此处，周围密集的法师塔中空缺了一块，就好像在这里从没有人建过塔一样。"}
{"time": 1757012854, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1424943261", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“嗯……谢谢女士”*稍微驻足一会“果然有些……格格不入啊，这间屋子和这座城”"}
{"time": 1757012871, "type": "recv", "message_id": "528642958", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“？是幻术吗...她不想见我们？”"}
{"time": 1757012999, "type": "recv", "message_id": "452809036", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(我要做邪恶的事了)"}
