{"time": 1757097252, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1286979289", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“嗯，只是远远看看什么情况”"}
{"time": 1757097274, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1801221460", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=350391981]（难道不是我们一起去吗）"}
{"time": 1757097338, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2053168753", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "靠近一些你才发现，与其说是球体，不如说是金色的匣子中包裹着偏向于球体的黑色物质。只是匣子的边缘颜色太浅，导致远远看上去只看得见火光之下的黑色球。"}
{"time": 1757097427, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1146886244", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“这是……什么情况”"}
{"time": 1757097570, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1199253545", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“这些球是什么..不会是炸弹吧”"}
{"time": 1757097652, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1011279981", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1146886244]你靠得更近一些，前面已经有了一些穿着执法官衣服的人，远远地还有一些蓝制服的人正在过来。在你眼前...火光之中，走出一道人墙..."}
{"time": 1757097658, "type": "recv", "message_id": "929799030", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:image,file=B6E0C0612873AC2ED9510FB814142F1F.jpg,sub_type=0,url=https://multimedia.nt.qq.com.cn/download?appid=1407&amp;fileid=EhS0l7sC70Pk7FYrKdjSNOJ8p5adWRiZxwYg_woogKTM7aLCjwMyBHByb2RQgL2jAVoQ-4pPM6yc9ZRucmX2LhL07HoCO2Y&amp;rkey=CAISMDhpYwz0emRNdr2aTrLtF9kx58_UWWBKNDVIvGcUc_j5USO5IRm-_KmFSrWqIHjPsQ,file_size=107417]"}
{"time": 1757097763, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1436618264", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "清一色的白色西装红领带，每个人都几乎长得一模一样，很难说从哪里找到这么多相似的人...而在他们之后，一个女人踩着由人体铺成的道路徐徐走出，表情不屑，最后停在人墙之前。"}
{"time": 1757097861, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1851498608", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:image,file={D65F5CA3-597E-7B9D-2817-B9C2394D9191}.jpg,sub_type=0,url=https://gchat.qpic.cn/gchatpic_new/0/0-0-D65F5CA3597E7B9D2817B9C2394D9191/0,file_size=95500]“向本人治下的领民宣告，即刻起，便是永恒暴力的开端。”她打了个响指，周围几座未塌的法师塔从根基被拦腰斩断，不断压缩压缩...直到成为她身侧的方匣"}
{"time": 1757097901, "type": "recv", "message_id": "403594569", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“这就是最后一个泰坦吗....”"}
{"time": 1757097909, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1424361736", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“真是一个比一个疯狂”"}
{"time": 1757098271, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1594401895", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"若是尔等无惧暴力，尽管入我麾下，纵情享乐！\"她看着面前由执法官和蓝制服组成的人墙，肆意地笑，\"哪哈特娜哈特来者不拒。\"她说完就向身后走去，人墙缓缓收缩，原地只余火焰...废墟"}
{"time": 1757098365, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1287292517", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“纯纯的疯子..”捏紧拳头，有一种想揍她的冲动，但清楚的知道实力差距，还是先冷静一下吧"}
{"time": 1757098534, "type": "recv", "message_id": "849490222", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“好强的……力量，这是什么？那些塔被……压缩了……”"}
{"time": 1757098601, "type": "recv", "message_id": "238905655", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1287292517]\"...暴力吗?\"西里斯看着他们离去，\"看来舞台已经彻底构建好了...\"她的手搭在你的肩膀上，\"不要轻举妄动。\""}
{"time": 1757098646, "type": "recv", "message_id": "162922650", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“嗯...西莉丝姐姐不要太小看我了，我又不是笨蛋，不会白白送死的”"}
{"time": 1757098652, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1463630671", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=849490222]黑匣子一直悬浮在她身侧，随着她离去也一同离开，只有被拦腰斩断的塔的塔基留在原地"}
{"time": 1757098731, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2106303050", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（法师塔在学院内吗？好像不在）"}
{"time": 1757098754, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1200245042", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（中环分为学院和法师塔（）"}
{"time": 1757098807, "type": "recv", "message_id": "821703716", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "*确认那个名字很拗口的女人离开后，虽然感觉希望很渺茫，但是往前走几步推销自己“……需要医师吗？不免费的那种”"}
{"time": 1757098998, "type": "recv", "message_id": "706527506", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=821703716]你发现，现场并没有什么负伤的人，或者说...即使有，也不过是尸体，执法官和蓝制服的人墙之后...废墟中遍地残骸，鲜血洒落了一地"}
{"time": 1757099008, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1017700055", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（）"}
{"time": 1757099036, "type": "recv", "message_id": "216741267", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“那边那个人是艾洛温吗...”"}
{"time": 1757099051, "type": "recv", "message_id": "227406880", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=162922650]\"嗯...没事，我们先走吧。\"她摇摇头，回身离开，爱璃西雅有些担忧地看着法师塔那边的方向，也转过身准备离开"}
{"time": 1757099061, "type": "recv", "message_id": "740141497", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“关于收敛办事厅的事也许可以问问她？”"}
{"time": 1757099063, "type": "recv", "message_id": "499080510", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=216741267](眼睛这么尖?)"}
{"time": 1757099076, "type": "recv", "message_id": "267179320", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（她大喊了（）"}
