{"time": 1757181865, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1899302642", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“感觉我像个幽灵一样...”"}
{"time": 1757181918, "type": "recv", "message_id": "955237709", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=197585611]“我没什么头绪。对原理和原因都一无所知”*摇头“我被邀请来这里只是因为……算了，没什么”"}
{"time": 1757181977, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1504387599", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"因为什么?\"饶有兴趣，西里斯偏偏脑袋开口"}
{"time": 1757182096, "type": "recv", "message_id": "759154271", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“反正不是因为我自己。我只是个……链接”"}
{"time": 1757182381, "type": "recv", "message_id": "848823348", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“链接？”她歪头看向诺维拉，眼神询问诺维拉的意思"}
{"time": 1757182427, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1429620807", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“嗯？”有点不太懂西莉丝姐姐的意思"}
{"time": 1757182515, "type": "recv", "message_id": "298934163", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“好吧。”她收回目光，最后选择平铺直叙，“链接是什么意思？”"}
{"time": 1757182769, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1072204255", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“我的师母是洋荷…还有埃忒尔的挂名…”"}
{"time": 1757182947, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1133574289", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“我自己，除了差点把自己玩死过一次以外，想不到有什么值得学院邀请的地方”"}
{"time": 1757183024, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1457336833", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“虽然我不认识什么洋荷，但埃忒尔姐姐既然肯收你做弟子 你就肯定不是什么普通人”"}
{"time": 1757183063, "type": "recv", "message_id": "34185255", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“因为两个师母认识啊……”"}
{"time": 1757183077, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1215405702", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“那洋荷呢”"}
{"time": 1757183169, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1035258406", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“她自认是我的前辈……我猜她也是龙”"}
{"time": 1757183206, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1776803356", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“原来你是龙吗...那不是已经很特殊了么”"}
{"time": 1757183276, "type": "recv", "message_id": "318824548", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯...气场来说和普通人倒是差不多?\"西里斯打量了一下，\"末裔之类的性质?不太像是银龙或者金龙...\""}
{"time": 1757183330, "type": "recv", "message_id": "51156093", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“一部分是……这样说可以理解吗？”"}
{"time": 1757183598, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2114863728", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“不过在这学院里恐怕也排不上号吧，按非人感来说”"}
{"time": 1757183624, "type": "recv", "message_id": "668383021", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“嗯，这样倒是合理的解释。不过...仅凭这样的关系，会邀请你过来吗？”她皱着眉，“你不如解释一番，在你身上的那位吧。”"}
{"time": 1757183723, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1077830419", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“就论血统而言，或许还不如你？”她看向诺维拉，眨了眨眼"}
{"time": 1757183771, "type": "recv", "message_id": "749689332", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=668383021]“我不知道”*实话实说“谁知道她在想什么”"}
{"time": 1757183791, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1523399037", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“其实也就那样吧...我也没感觉有什么特别的能力”"}
{"time": 1757184059, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1537030094", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“好吧。”她摊摊手，“不过这里...能找到什么呢？”微微看着伊芙"}
{"time": 1757184116, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1088773480", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“我不知道，问我不如问宾森特”*摇摇头“我说不知道是真的不知道”"}
{"time": 1757184213, "type": "recv", "message_id": "791163760", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "*不过还是再看看地上的凹痕和上面的一圈画像吧"}
