{"time": 1757204313, "type": "recv", "message_id": "744967012", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“好啦...”西里斯这个时候插进来，“这种事情还是不要试了，我们等当事人给我们答案吧？”"}
{"time": 1757204331, "type": "recv", "message_id": "141864541", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=766944806]“还活着吗？”"}
