{"time": 1757261871, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2034401925", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“关于目前的事，你有什么想法吗，伊芙艾洛温”"}
{"time": 1757262089, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2057726342", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(也可以)"}
{"time": 1757262107, "type": "recv", "message_id": "566859320", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“我知道的也不比你们多。你……是来干嘛的？”"}
{"time": 1757262148, "type": "recv", "message_id": "248266344", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“师父在的骑士团被雇佣过来城防...就来了”"}
{"time": 1757262175, "type": "recv", "message_id": "49848339", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“哦，那城防的人呢？”"}
{"time": 1757262238, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1110927224", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“看起来……没那么称职”"}
{"time": 1757262248, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1229519415", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“大家都死了...不知道谁干的”已经能较为平静的说出这件事了，也许这就是成长吧"}
{"time": 1757262288, "type": "recv", "message_id": "743940675", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "至于后半句，就当作没听见吧，懒得和她这种人计较"}
{"time": 1757262342, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1853896860", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“那你知道的东西理应比我多，不该来问我”"}
{"time": 1757262371, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1018739988", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我觉得你应该比我聪明点....”"}
{"time": 1757262560, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1572670843", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1229519415]“是吗，那倒是……还算称职”*依旧波澜不惊“我只知道这事牵扯多的很，而且我一个都解决不了”"}
{"time": 1757262576, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1803537255", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我还遇见了一件很奇怪的事情，当初我走的时候明明带的是师父和我朋友的佩剑..但是当我从那个房子醒来的时候，腰上的却是自己的佩剑”"}
{"time": 1757262840, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1806079082", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1803537255]“你想说明什么？”"}
{"time": 1757262852, "type": "recv", "message_id": "814665899", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“只说这件事，可能的原因是不是太多了”"}
{"time": 1757262900, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1410008837", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“不知道，只是分享一件奇怪的事，也许和现状有关联，但我想不明白”"}
{"time": 1757262946, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1516290327", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“到了这，早就不能用常规方法思考了，没有意义”"}
{"time": 1757263018, "type": "recv", "message_id": "231908029", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“魔法的领地，只能从原因出发思考。考虑方法是想破头都想不出来的，除非你精通所有种类的魔法”"}
{"time": 1757263032, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2039125643", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“也有道理...”"}
{"time": 1757263188, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2074271467", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“哎，魔法...好讨厌”"}
{"time": 1757263354, "type": "recv", "message_id": "64864555", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1532699815]（你不是已经赢了么）"}
