{"time": 1757263413, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1416427653", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“感觉完全不知道怎么办，脑袋乱乱的”敲敲头“算了，还是先吃饭吧”"}
{"time": 1757263531, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1561735268", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“……倒是在咖啡厅碰到过两个看起来很精通魔法的二世祖”"}
{"time": 1757263541, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1549930671", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“和学院长也认识的样子”"}
{"time": 1757263563, "type": "recv", "message_id": "511838885", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“emmm，长什么样子呢，也许西莉丝姐姐也认识”"}
{"time": 1757263950, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1465960788", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“一个绿头发尖耳朵的精灵”"}
{"time": 1757263977, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1200141657", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“还有一个金色头发的人类……吧”"}
{"time": 1757264028, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1265146476", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“呃，那个人类是不是看起来有点冒冒失失的，然后好像是精灵的长辈，但很听精灵的话？”"}
{"time": 1757264157, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1693764656", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“你认识？”"}
{"time": 1757264192, "type": "recv", "message_id": "85265703", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“之前来的时候我们顺路，一起坐了半个月的马车....”"}
{"time": 1757264331, "type": "recv", "message_id": "184259961", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“那你，没想过去问问？”"}
{"time": 1757264365, "type": "recv", "message_id": "189990131", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我不知道她们也在这..她们之前说要参加密会来着，我以为她们会在学院”"}
{"time": 1757264436, "type": "recv", "message_id": "589740321", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"哦..?具体说一说?\"此刻你们漫步在前往餐馆的路上，西里斯饶有兴趣地追问"}
{"time": 1757264491, "type": "recv", "message_id": "519607941", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“现在说不定已经晚了。她说她想走就能走来着”"}
{"time": 1757264605, "type": "recv", "message_id": "536991880", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“金发姐姐叫桃乐丝，精灵姐姐叫卡诗戴尔，我和师父还有露露之前在希望镇遇到她们的，桃乐丝姐姐虽然看着是人类，但好像也会使用魔法”"}
{"time": 1757264638, "type": "recv", "message_id": "12296040", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“对了...当时镇上好像也起了类似昨天的那种大雾”"}
{"time": 1757264700, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1119184022", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"她们有没有说什么?\"这个问题大概是同时问你们两个人"}
{"time": 1757264837, "type": "recv", "message_id": "599316356", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（伊酱，希望镇听里谢娜唱歌我还记得吗）"}
{"time": 1757264859, "type": "recv", "message_id": "126844506", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“大概是，‘都是因为你的失职才会变成这样’和‘反正还没失控’云云”"}
{"time": 1757264958, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1558587232", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=599316356](过个灵感)"}
