{"time": 1757397414, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1051927722", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“谢谢诺亚了”"}
{"time": 1757397490, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1672829701", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“呃？这么快？”*直了直身子“叫人受宠若惊啊”"}
{"time": 1757398092, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1538187131", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "过了几分钟，你们听到了敲门声，出于礼貌，只敲了三下。"}
{"time": 1757398129, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1178539119", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "去把门打开“来的还挺快”"}
{"time": 1757398488, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1370431325", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "一位戴着面具，穿着红色为主色的和服，戴着白色兜帽的女子安静地站在门外"}
{"time": 1757398531, "type": "recv", "message_id": "971562993", "deleted": true, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“你就是龙芙小姐，前任管理者？”"}
