{"time": 1757470773, "type": "recv", "message_id": "702363298", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“我的意思是……有几个人”"}
{"time": 1757471184, "type": "recv", "message_id": "274156508", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"这个问题真是有趣...\"虽然这么说，不过她只是稍作打量，\"你想做什么\""}
{"time": 1757471249, "type": "recv", "message_id": "640409927", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "听不懂伊芙再说什么但先静静听着"}
{"time": 1757471467, "type": "recv", "message_id": "625970226", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“要说的话，她们应该比我本人更有目标。也许在解决这档子事尽早离开这件事上，会比我更主动”"}
{"time": 1757471501, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1386080270", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“实力也自然是……不必多说”"}
{"time": 1757471720, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1533096336", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"哦...\"她露出了有些若有所思的表情，\"原来是这样...\"随后重新坐下，\"你想要什么\""}
{"time": 1757471892, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1540087980", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "身上有其他人吗...之前她能打开那个无罪之人才能打开的门也是因为这个吗"}
{"time": 1757472030, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1916126682", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“临时的食宿，以及……虽然我是想讨个人偶”*顿了顿，在心底问问其他两人的意见“你们，怎么说？”"}
{"time": 1757472720, "type": "recv", "message_id": "398720368", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"哦～\"她翘起脚，\"不妨让你身上的人出来谈谈吧。\""}
{"time": 1757472815, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1149195516", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1916126682]\"难道我是什么商品吗？\"卡珊德拉的语气带着一些不满，\"拿姐姐我做交易，小伊芙是不是越来越胆大了？\""}
{"time": 1757473069, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1399342658", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“互惠共赢嘛，还是你打算在这边等到伊瑟尔解决所有问题？”*稍微有些心虚“还是说你的熟人已经都见完了？密会和学院里总有你感兴趣的吧”"}
{"time": 1757473745, "type": "recv", "message_id": "408702339", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“你看人偶我都不要了，食宿你们也能用得上……还是说看我去找三个泰坦依次送死你比较开心？”"}
{"time": 1757474287, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1235435012", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（事到如今，感觉完全身处解决不了的时态）"}
{"time": 1757474291, "type": "recv", "message_id": "497344394", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1916126682]龙芙略有些打量的目光落在你身上，耐人寻味，\"食宿?你缺这些?\""}
{"time": 1757474317, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2001631358", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（有两个泰坦完全见不到，第三个感觉很容易死）"}
{"time": 1757474386, "type": "recv", "message_id": "714310504", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“如果这儿还是玛纳利亚，应该不至于”"}
{"time": 1757474422, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1243008583", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（感觉黄金和法律天然不对付。如果想促成联合，要么是暴力+经济，要么是暴力+法律）"}
{"time": 1757474447, "type": "recv", "message_id": "736782921", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（毕竟说到底，暴力是手段而非目的，除非她是纳努克）"}
{"time": 1757474724, "type": "recv", "message_id": "578547643", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=408702339]\"你能确定她这里，能帮你解决事态?\"卡珊德拉的声音带着些琢磨不透的轻松，\"我是没意见啦。\""}
{"time": 1757474774, "type": "recv", "message_id": "600734967", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=714310504]\"那可真是...\"龙芙的笑来的突然，\"这种交易对我而言自然是稳赚不亏。\""}
{"time": 1757474876, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1177467786", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:image,file=7715C71CCA81374C0CB13323F630D4A3.jpg,sub_type=0,url=https://multimedia.nt.qq.com.cn/download?appid=1407&amp;fileid=EhS6dY1-UhKblvMtxzRmFqxlr2vppRjL4Asg_wooxNiHjaDNjwMyBHByb2RQgL2jAVoQAIEovbEm_fLp1R8VmXz4fHoCfR4&amp;rkey=CAMSMLKkfMiyP1tqKEMafdwVDNDnM-qmHfO3WR6OoyyzPoA5p_vSGo_njqup1AnLOz08OQ,file_size=192587]"}
{"time": 1757474877, "type": "recv", "message_id": "604843923", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(卧槽)"}
{"time": 1757475007, "type": "recv", "message_id": "486517789", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=578547643]“错了，我没打算解决。只是有机会会多留意一番。但是拉笔投资总是好的……妃花呢？怎么说？”"}
{"time": 1757475205, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1382926409", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=486517789]\"我看你是窘迫得没钱吃饭，又不想依赖参谋小姐吧。\"她的声音带着调侃，\"你这种性子以后怎么让妃花过上好日子?是不是欺负她不会说什么?\""}
{"time": 1757475289, "type": "recv", "message_id": "371865244", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"好啦，如果伊芙小姐的诉求就是这样，那...这边这位小小姐呢?\"龙芙转向诺薇拉"}
{"time": 1757475352, "type": "recv", "message_id": "698649520", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“emmm,我想知道怎么离开这里”"}
{"time": 1757475436, "type": "recv", "message_id": "963935643", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=371865244]“交换和依赖，还是前者好接受一点。”*重新开口“还没结束，当然还要看龙芙小姐想要什么”"}
{"time": 1757476001, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1651042991", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"离开？\"她点燃自己的烟斗，\"解决这里的事情...或是，找到离开的路。你可以选一个去做。\""}
{"time": 1757476465, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1508905594", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=963935643]\"既然连管理权我都可以让出去，我想要什么呢?\"她的语气似乎在说理所当然的事，\"很难实现的事情哦?\""}
{"time": 1757476781, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1966344907", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1651042991]“如果可以解决的话，当然要解决..”"}
{"time": 1757476811, "type": "recv", "message_id": "198019786", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“只要有办法...多难我都会去试试的”"}
{"time": 1757477049, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1044083797", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"我也不会拦着你对不对?\"她始终挂着若有若无的笑意，\"不过路得你自己去找。\""}
{"time": 1757477050, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1890802863", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“没有目标，交换就不成立。我喜欢投资，不喜欢欠人情”"}
{"time": 1757477552, "type": "recv", "message_id": "530269308", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“小姐把情报告诉我们，总该有所图的吧”"}
{"time": 1757477755, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1337465255", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"正东一方，抚琴鸣雷。\"龙芙放下烟斗，房间里的光线突然黯淡下来，像是夏日阴雨之前的室内，\"繁荣。\"她吐出两个字，站起身，光线再度恢复，刚刚发生的事情仿若不存在。"}
{"time": 1757477817, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1326401860", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“？”思考这里的正东是哪"}
{"time": 1757477829, "type": "recv", "message_id": "289896903", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（原来是霓虹）"}
{"time": 1757478105, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1959370205", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“……繁荣。小姐是一国之君？”*多少有些怔住，缓了会才回过神"}
{"time": 1757478450, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1267605608", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "这个问题她没有回答，而是朝门外走去，\"好啦，我的话就到这里，要是需求食宿的话，和那边的人偶交流就可以。\""}
{"time": 1757478518, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2012637022", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“……”*想了想，慢走轮不到自己说“再见，龙芙小姐”"}
{"time": 1757478547, "type": "recv", "message_id": "339495339", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "*于是也该想想大陆正东是哪"}
{"time": 1757478744, "type": "recv", "message_id": "335995776", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“姐姐再见”"}
{"time": 1757478771, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1555376940", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（你能说慢走为什么不说慢走（）"}
{"time": 1757479006, "type": "recv", "message_id": "915257275", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "她转身离开，走的时候关上了门。"}
{"time": 1757479217, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1961623759", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "大陆正东只有一个小国，坐落在一片精灵之森中，印象里国名叫美乐蒂的样子。"}
{"time": 1757479237, "type": "recv", "message_id": "153520051", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "伊芙可以过灵感"}
