{"time": 1757479614, "type": "recv", "message_id": "391479366", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "在妖精森中的人类国度，传闻中似乎背靠某位所谓的龙神存在。"}
{"time": 1757479619, "type": "recv", "message_id": "746900489", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（妖精森里为什么会有国家规模的人类（）"}
{"time": 1757479899, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1542553519", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（龙神（）"}
{"time": 1757479977, "type": "recv", "message_id": "427795721", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=391479366]但是由于身处妖精森的腹地，鲜少有人类的侍者抵达此处，所以至今都是一些传言。"}
{"time": 1757480073, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1088998463", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“传说么……”*按下不表“哎，不说人了，内外之间也没点消息交换……学院长倒也真坐的住。再拖下去，早晚要发生外交灾难的”"}
{"time": 1757480196, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1388218454", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（但是我在学院里动机真的不足）"}
{"time": 1757480404, "type": "recv", "message_id": "877429563", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“什么意思呢.....”"}
{"time": 1757480421, "type": "recv", "message_id": "475955970", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "还在思考那句话的含义，但感觉懵懵的"}
