{"time": 1757499232, "type": "recv", "message_id": "712746749", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“万一仅仅因为我的猜测....西莉丝姐姐出事的话，还是我去吧..”"}
{"time": 1757499340, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1196021722", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“你确实很懂暴力”*耸肩"}
{"time": 1757499467, "type": "recv", "message_id": "742578638", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"乖乖听话，这种情况你一个人去有什么用?\""}
{"time": 1757499697, "type": "recv", "message_id": "452288513", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“显然。实力和暴力也不是同一个东西”"}
{"time": 1757499739, "type": "recv", "message_id": "875101454", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"目前的情况，只有我过去才会是最合适的选择...\"皱皱眉，\"年龄上也是，只有我是成年人吧？\""}
{"time": 1757499821, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1867086895", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“我这算两个，其中我算半个”*耸肩“别的不说，你走了这会起火的”"}
{"time": 1757499887, "type": "recv", "message_id": "350929557", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（呵呵，想到了过河问题（）"}
