{"time": 1757620756, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1786743806", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(接下来的展开很快)"}
{"time": 1757620759, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1535911587", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "头上出现了魔族标志的角..但可能由于血脉不纯的原因，左右的颜色花纹有些许不一致，随手在衣服背后撕开两道小口，之前瘦小的翅膀从中钻了出来，同时在血的激发下，开始逐渐变大...不够..想要更多的血，捡起那把剑，扇动翅膀，朝着背后的人群飞去..鲜血，更多的鲜血"}
{"time": 1757620798, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1653912419", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "里榭娜从你的视野中消失，\"不要让我失望哦?奏绝，即是破坏之时。\""}
{"time": 1757620851, "type": "recv", "message_id": "275690457", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1827490133]\"诶...等等，怎么回事?\"妃花突然惊叫起来，与此同时，你感觉身体正在把你的意识拉回现实"}
{"time": 1757620891, "type": "recv", "message_id": "913497384", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "已经没有什么清醒的意识了，自己现在想要的只有鲜血...尤其是那群家伙的，好像很美味的样子"}
{"time": 1757620914, "type": "recv", "message_id": "248579080", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“喂什么？”*超重感传来，如同从海中超速上浮“妃花？发生了什么？”"}
{"time": 1757621130, "type": "recv", "message_id": "125099780", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"失控了...呃。\"她突然无征兆地吐出一口血，在纯白的空间殷红地刺眼，\"不要过去...快走！\"你看见金色的流光从四面八方袭来，淹没了你面前的一切。"}
{"time": 1757621147, "type": "recv", "message_id": "416530860", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=913497384](那你就，杀)"}
{"time": 1757621293, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1458448703", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "*在沙发上滕地惊醒，坐了起来，推门而出，到走廊上往北边望去“刚刚是……什么情况？”"}
{"time": 1757621328, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2017889876", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "夜晚的天色静悄悄，你注意到室内不知何时多了一个人"}
{"time": 1757621337, "type": "recv", "message_id": "530879946", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "。rd2"}
{"time": 1757621337, "type": "reply", "message_id": "530879946", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": 2875548981, "name": "小雅"}, "message": "[敖知夏]演奏出: 1D2=1"}
{"time": 1757621353, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1952636631", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（rd2是……）"}
{"time": 1757621359, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2120557833", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "她端正地坐在你面前的沙发上"}
{"time": 1757621399, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1154941833", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "很快便飞回了降落在那群人之间，毕竟之前也没跑多远...由于力量突然的增加，身体似乎有些稍微承受不住，皮肤有些轻微的裂纹，鲜红色充斥其中，有一种要炸开的感觉“血...血....”看见眼前的人们莫名有些兴奋，忍不住笑起来"}
{"time": 1757621450, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2126121291", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2120557833]“谁？”*心中多少有几个猜测"}
{"time": 1757621614, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1973106876", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "其人，戴着厚重的面具，穿着一身亮甲"}
{"time": 1757621692, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1126071766", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1154941833]\"诺诺！?\"西里斯被围在他们之中，此刻身上受了些伤，有些血腥味传到你鼻腔中。至于其他的人则是...如同见了鬼一样四散逃开"}
{"time": 1757621707, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1645953582", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"啊...这里不是马纳利亚吗？魔族...救命啊！\"之类的话"}
{"time": 1757621770, "type": "recv", "message_id": "432168847", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“你们..逃不掉...”杀戮的想法充斥在心中“全..都得...死，把你们的血给我留下....”"}
{"time": 1757621780, "type": "recv", "message_id": "690756849", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1973106876]“你是……谁？”*完全没见过的人，突兀地出现在曾被认定是安全区的房间中。很难说紧张和后怕哪个更多"}
{"time": 1757621891, "type": "recv", "message_id": "848842053", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=432168847]他们四散逃开，只有西里斯留在原地，\"...\"她摇了摇头，对着你举起手里的指挥尖棒，尽管衣服有些破损，甚至身上有许多血渍..."}
{"time": 1757621903, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1837011075", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "不知道为什么，有点想远离西莉丝...或者说逃离，本能意识想让自己避开这个人，于是开始追杀逃亡的人群"}
{"time": 1757621917, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1319905579", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=690756849]\"嗯...初次见面，听说你一直在找我。\""}
