{"time": 1757622278, "type": "recv", "message_id": "271493782", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "不想和她过多的缠斗，她看起来就不弱，而且不喜欢她的血，那个味道，闻着之后，心脏好像有点疼..."}
{"time": 1757622318, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1923241291", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "这么多人，她也不可能完全拦住自己，试图去寻找其他的目标"}
{"time": 1757622336, "type": "recv", "message_id": "4853587", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（怎么就重要之人了（）"}
{"time": 1757622370, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1107997562", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1549974459]\"不，恰恰相反，我就是你在寻找的，世俗的王。\"她伸手，摘下脸上的面具，同时身上的铠甲应声而落，手中的剑在同一时化为一柄金光闪闪的权杖。"}
{"time": 1757622405, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1678348961", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（你的意思是那个海报是女的吗？）"}
