{"time": 1757625190, "type": "recv", "message_id": "419435613", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1726687438]\"宣誓对我的忠诚。\"她看着你，\"孤为统御西北之王，世代享有此地的宣称。汝可尽享荣耀。\""}
{"time": 1757625270, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1974627028", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（西北有啥啊（）"}
{"time": 1757625292, "type": "recv", "message_id": "691709229", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2037876868]她拖着你到门边...停了下来，叹了口气，\"看来...我的路也只能走到这里了。\"门口赫然是娜哈特娜哈特的军队，这里已经被他们完全封锁。脚步声从你身后传来，娜哈特娜哈特一步一步从楼上走下"}
{"time": 1757625309, "type": "recv", "message_id": "900309176", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（当然我怀疑，之所以是西北是因为，中国文化下其他三个方向画面感有点）"}
{"time": 1757625311, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1361722609", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(我会说，剑湾)"}
