{"time": 1757626346, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1610530870", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1643290866]“我是不是该说……多谢赐座？”*没去直视她的眼睛，低着头"}
{"time": 1757626403, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1315421866", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"...\"你知道她在看着你，\"若无绝对的忠诚，有些话就不可说。\""}
{"time": 1757626429, "type": "recv", "message_id": "473368291", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"孤可以放低要求，在这一城，为我效忠。\""}
{"time": 1757626545, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1655768450", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“……”*恐怕也很难争取到更多的让步。但是……“我身上还负着另一个契约……在这城内，我的身体不完全属于我”"}
{"time": 1757626608, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1256508011", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“而您也应该懂得……只靠力量镇压，是不会有绝对的忠诚的”"}
{"time": 1757626649, "type": "recv", "message_id": "980728812", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"没关系，孤届时自会解决这个问题。\"她敲了敲权杖，\"只在这一城即可。\""}
{"time": 1757626801, "type": "recv", "message_id": "652609359", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“……”*事到如今，也难有更好的选择“……伊芙·艾络温·摩根宣誓……在马纳利亚城内，对……”"}
{"time": 1757626823, "type": "recv", "message_id": "428935257", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（这种时候要是她下个命令说不能离开马纳利亚我不就炸了（）"}
{"time": 1757626917, "type": "recv", "message_id": "97261499", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(那好像确实)"}
{"time": 1757626988, "type": "recv", "message_id": "959152103", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=652609359]\"斯塔齐 乌姆。\"她说出了名字"}
{"time": 1757627067, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1562129058", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=652609359]“对斯塔奇·乌姆，宣誓绝对忠诚”*无论如何，还是很讨厌自己脱离掌控的感觉"}
{"time": 1757627165, "type": "recv", "message_id": "641853232", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"孤接受。\"她淡淡说完，你感觉到自己和她被强行绑定在一起。"}
{"time": 1757627191, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1570443054", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "她轻轻抖了抖权杖，你的手腕上的伤口开始肉眼可见愈合。"}
{"time": 1757627327, "type": "recv", "message_id": "577134560", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“……谢主隆恩”*声音在能听清的最低限度，挠挠手上的伤口，有点痒"}
{"time": 1757627418, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1341749416", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"那么，接下来该说一些，私密的话题了。\"她一甩手，窗帘自动拉上。\"你的价值。\""}
{"time": 1757627440, "type": "recv", "message_id": "223965947", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(我想到8.起，沃日，睡了)"}
