{"time": 1757785342, "type": "recv", "message_id": "306733162", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“……”*叹了口气，把钱袋子拿出来“我全身上下就这点东西了。多了也没有。这还是我原本准备买材料的……”"}
{"time": 1757785409, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2065585215", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1963102411]她一副了然的表情，\"第二次死亡?\"手指向下，透过娜哈特的手抚过你脖子上的那圈黑线，\"我可以同意哦～\""}
{"time": 1757785472, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1552931739", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“那就这样吧...”"}
