{"time": 1757793651, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1094495484", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=791662529]\"那边?\"她摇了摇头，想来还没有收到相关的消息，\"呵呵...交代我去这个酒店四楼的倒霉房间找不存在的人，你很喜欢这种交代的。\"随着她坐下，身后悬浮的球体落到茶几上，不再发出蓝光。"}
{"time": 1757794116, "type": "recv", "message_id": "849867613", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1133825938]\"那真是...\"她的指尖停住，抬头看着你，眸中带笑，\"我这里有这么方便的事情吗～\"她对着你俏皮地炸着一边眼睛，\"那就...\"黑线突然完成合围，她也随之消失，剧烈的头痛伴随着被长期锁喉的缺氧，让你一瞬有些眼前一黑，看着眼前的娜哈特，你意识到你回来了。"}
{"time": 1757794526, "type": "recv", "message_id": "499849339", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（？）"}
{"time": 1757794854, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1939296579", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1094495484]“好嘛，这次是我不对”*摇摇头“我也没想到你来的这么快。为什么不索性和她一起来？”"}
{"time": 1757794871, "type": "recv", "message_id": "384767074", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“总不能是陛下太烦人”"}
{"time": 1757795070, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1612474115", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=384767074]\"...\"她正准备说话，被这句话卡了一下壳，\"要是她在你就完蛋了。\""}
{"time": 1757795224, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1933943834", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“说不定她其实知道。但我从不改口……几乎”"}
{"time": 1757795459, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2021328027", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“说着玩的，不过我已经习惯和上位者相处了，大部分都有点不喜欢说人话。不过问题是真的。”"}
{"time": 1757795507, "type": "recv", "message_id": "146965903", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1933943834]\"是吗？\"她拍拍手，\"陛下～陛下～你听见了吗?\"她的目光越过你看向门，带着些幸灾乐祸的笑。"}
{"time": 1757795913, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1789654577", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“……”"}
{"time": 1757795949, "type": "recv", "message_id": "39188124", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“好了，我不会收回的。烦人与圣明是不冲突的两个词。我们还是说正事吧。”"}
{"time": 1757796342, "type": "recv", "message_id": "474342401", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"诶?嘿嘿...\"眼前的人指着你突然偷笑了一下，\"骗骗你的啦。\"她过了一会才收好表情，\"也没什么可说的吧，我协助你，追查‘蜘蛛’。\""}
{"time": 1757796586, "type": "recv", "message_id": "172875062", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“哇，被骗到了。但我说人坏话从来没负担，就算面对面。好了，那你有什么蜘蛛的线索吗？”"}
{"time": 1757796725, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1046503178", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"有倒是有一点啦，嗯...说起来，你有感觉到违和感吗?\"她清了清嗓子，从自己的袖子里伸出手，点在落在桌上的球上。"}
{"time": 1757796735, "type": "recv", "message_id": "879298601", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(说起来，忘了给立绘)"}
{"time": 1757796741, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1071533553", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:image,file=BBE1EFEED532734E3510D012F0C54340.jpg,sub_type=0,url=https://multimedia.nt.qq.com.cn/download?appid=1407&amp;fileid=EhSmPHtmQOOU4hAFoePelm6WQKdDPhi6zAog_woozpmyks_WjwMyBHByb2RQgL2jAVoQ7MYxbT_tMZ14uEJEzUOot3oCYCyCAQJneg&amp;rkey=CAMSME4tAsgS_o5N155oFWAZwSFgSt5JMndoVibGNGOWdxE5exnyGHSeklWy7KBPVpdfgw,file_size=173626]"}
{"time": 1757796885, "type": "recv", "message_id": "209617899", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“嗯……突然出现的，莫名其妙的泰坦，接受度奇高的人群，都是一夜之间出现的，都和收敛办事处有关”"}
{"time": 1757797115, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1653586835", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"那个所谓的收敛办事处，对吧，是什么地方，你有什么猜测么?\"桌上的亮起蓝光"}
{"time": 1757797285, "type": "recv", "message_id": "307682388", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“没有”*摇头“我只正儿八经去过一次。而且里头的画框很……渗人”"}
{"time": 1757797345, "type": "recv", "message_id": "644530483", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“只是碰了一下，却差点要了我的魂”"}
{"time": 1757797382, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2125451725", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"那你在画框里见过什么?\"她示意你把手放在球体上，\"在脑子里想，这上面会出现当时的图案。\""}
{"time": 1757797475, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1969111489", "deleted": true, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“一个……异色眼小女孩”"}
{"time": 1757797678, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1041490549", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(说起来，你好像没真正看过?)"}
{"time": 1757797682, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1356529917", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（？）"}
{"time": 1757797876, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2045695066", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(我记得疼得在地上打滚，没看过画框里来着，你确认一下)"}
{"time": 1757797892, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1460666119", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（好像确实）"}
{"time": 1757797894, "type": "recv", "message_id": "794124835", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（没看）"}
{"time": 1757797901, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1401674043", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（艾丽西娅看到的）"}
{"time": 1757798044, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1851460432", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“……我没看见。里头那个小姑娘看见了”"}
{"time": 1757798323, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2019229535", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "球面上依然发着蓝光，没有显示出什么，\"啧...你既然去过，居然什么也不清楚?\"她看了看房门，\"那小姑娘刚刚被我喊醒，我——不小心——说了她几句，呃...\""}
{"time": 1757798354, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1089309242", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"这都怪你。\"她回过头瞪着你"}
{"time": 1757798660, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1340783905", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“我第一眼只看见漆黑的空洞。再看时就觉得头痛欲裂，伤口也火烧一般……”"}
{"time": 1757798735, "type": "recv", "message_id": "232392535", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“图案的出现似乎与我的触摸有联系，但我没有看过”*耸耸肩“但对一个显然睡熟的人问这问那，我觉得不是我的问题”"}
{"time": 1757798780, "type": "recv", "message_id": "192910585", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“那个人偶去哪了？原本在这里的”*指指那个空房间"}
{"time": 1757798793, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2091404037", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"如果是你，我真觉得无所谓。\"她又瞪你一眼，\"你活该，去问问那孩子，我肯定没机会了。\""}
{"time": 1757798811, "type": "recv", "message_id": "819668427", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=192910585]\"应该...\"她指了指爱璃西雅的房间"}
{"time": 1757798882, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1496057468", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“好吧，算我欠你的”"}
{"time": 1757799050, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1820173089", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "*敲敲爱莉希雅的门"}
{"time": 1757799115, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1732467913", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“是我，伊芙”"}
{"time": 1757799252, "type": "recv", "message_id": "64767101", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(原来鱼身体里真的有骨头和玉很像)"}
{"time": 1757799274, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1858813097", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(此事居然是现实原型吗，我一直以为是杜撰的)"}
{"time": 1757799296, "type": "recv", "message_id": "333235975", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:image,file=6C9B511CD18EA5A95D264ABA2460BD31.jpg,sub_type=0,url=https://multimedia.nt.qq.com.cn/download?appid=1407&amp;fileid=EhRdSpUl8IG59-4MD5fOP85cAXhhJBjAmgsg_wooyPDf1NjWjwMyBHByb2RQgL2jAVoQ9h-eXvlJDLht0IcYBzlSsnoCeLuCAQJneg&amp;rkey=CAISMHuv6CvotYHffJFWhGZMbUeblwazC27DDyt1DlEnmISRu66zjyyveHRkspGjccD5rQ,file_size=183616]"}
{"time": 1757799301, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1343607947", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（是有啊）"}
{"time": 1757799485, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1603682338", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1732467913]\"...\"过了一会门才打开，诺亚给你开的门，她给门拉开了一条缝，她看了一眼大厅，把你拉进门，重新把门关上。爱璃西雅坐在床上，眼睛周围有些肿。"}
{"time": 1757799626, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1980346581", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“喔……变成兔子了”*摇摇头“你还好吗？”"}
{"time": 1757799828, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1869396849", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "听到你的话，爱璃西雅抬起手揉了揉眼睛，\"...有个陌生的女孩...\"带着鼻音，\"把我摇醒，骂我不知羞，一天到晚就会.....就会...睡觉....\"诺亚走到她身旁帮她拍着背"}
{"time": 1757799880, "type": "recv", "message_id": "435025461", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"是不是...很过分啦...我又不认识...睡觉，睡觉又怎么了！\"她骤然抬头瞪了一眼门外，\"啊，绝对不是我的问题吧，神经病。\""}
{"time": 1757799980, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1812027324", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“没事，今天晚上她睡觉的时候我也这么叫她，她最好睁着眼睛睡觉……呃，确实”"}
{"time": 1757800007, "type": "recv", "message_id": "17905777", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "*有些愕然地看着她，不知道是触碰了哪个开关"}
{"time": 1757800203, "type": "recv", "message_id": "126478884", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"我...我明明好不容易...才梦见姐姐的...\"她的情绪爆发之后陷入萎靡，靠着床头，一时沉默下来"}
{"time": 1757800500, "type": "recv", "message_id": "146070214", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=126478884]“……”*叹了口气，也坐到旁边拍拍她“好吧好吧……我……能懂你的感受。嗯……再睡一觉，说不定？又能梦见一次的”"}
{"time": 1757800531, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1661822592", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "*虽然知道可遇不可求，但是……“说不定我有办法？让你再梦见一次……应该是很重要的人吧”"}
{"time": 1757800601, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1366656170", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（“你的姐姐也死了？”）"}
{"time": 1757800619, "type": "recv", "message_id": "218558720", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"...\"她抬起头看向你，带着些期待，但随后光芒熄灭，她低下头\"埃尔不想见我的...我又笨...又没用...\""}
{"time": 1757800627, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1507635412", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(好变态的话)"}
{"time": 1757800852, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1757110602", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=218558720]“可以只是你见她。而且……我觉得没有姐姐会讨厌自己的妹妹的”*无奈地拍拍她的肩膀“放轻松”"}
{"time": 1757801199, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1179187129", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯....\"深呼吸了几下，\"我想...再见埃尔....她不在的话...好孤单...不要...\"声音越来越低"}
{"time": 1757801311, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1312118227", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“放心……她不会知道你梦见她了的。哦对了，诺亚会做梦吗？”"}
{"time": 1757801498, "type": "recv", "message_id": "799494309", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "人偶摇摇头。"}
{"time": 1757801758, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1853255214", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“嗯……妃花？有稍微好些吗？这孩子需要你的帮助……”"}
{"time": 1757801889, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2114532668", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "没有回应，小腿上的印记有些黯淡。想来情况不怎么好。"}
