{"time": 1757884865, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1933129929", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=491352258]\"啊啦...\"她看着你的表情，\"没什么想说的啦?那加钱的事怎么样?\""}
{"time": 1757884893, "type": "recv", "message_id": "607465077", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“虽然我的攻击对你好像不痛不痒...那这招呢”随着确定血雾将她笼罩之后"}
{"time": 1757884901, "type": "recv", "message_id": "454030270", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=186182625]她离你的血雾有些远，被雾气笼罩的地方多少有些腐蚀的迹象"}
{"time": 1757884903, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1205472817", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1933129929]*没力气抬手，但是还有力气比个中指"}
{"time": 1757884922, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1918343297", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=454030270]（有点远就有点难受了（）"}
{"time": 1757884923, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1751335664", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(她不是直接保持了距离，看见可以腐蚀就走远了?)"}
{"time": 1757884937, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1991912751", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(要是掉衣服是不是太没面子了)"}
{"time": 1757884981, "type": "recv", "message_id": "450424545", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（但其实我一开始想的是，我疯狂用血攻击她，肯定沾的她满身是血，然后在烧，但是想了想可能没用，就转变思路，准备让她吸进去在烧（）"}
{"time": 1757885024, "type": "recv", "message_id": "744113653", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（那我觉得你不如突到她脸上来个奥特炸弹）"}
{"time": 1757885032, "type": "recv", "message_id": "711910195", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（但好像还有机会，所以我之前的攻击有没有让她浑身是血，或者哪里占有）"}
{"time": 1757885051, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1638735226", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（你知道的，她会风）"}
{"time": 1757885055, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1016775324", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=744113653]（感觉这群逼外壳都硬的离谱）"}
