{"time": 1757886712, "type": "recv", "message_id": "986652149", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1024954976]\"不想死就听我的话。\"她啧了几声，又拿出一瓶同样的试管，拔掉塞子，放在你嘴边"}
