{"time": 1757887064, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1904827506", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2146519033]蓝色的试剂下肚，大约过了一会，你感觉到身体好受了不少，至少没有头晕眼花，手臂上的出血也减慢了不少，难以想象这种大规模的伤口居然这么快会自主停血"}
{"time": 1757887082, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1927431997", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（云南白药））"}
{"time": 1757887262, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1817245897", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1904827506]*稍微有了些气力，换个舒服些的姿势，但是还没睁眼“……要去哪”"}
