{"time": 1757887588, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1933263276", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "手臂自不多说，连胸前腹部上都烧黑了部分，再加上染上的血，只能说惨不忍睹。"}
{"time": 1757887628, "type": "recv", "message_id": "632578381", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“……找，西里斯……”*想了想，偌大的中环，能相信的，好像也只剩她了"}
{"time": 1757887814, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1235661791", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"也行吧。\"她抱着你往酒店走，\"反正，有龙芙在啦。\"打了个哈欠，\"说起来，你明明也是龙，怎么弱成这样。\""}
{"time": 1757887919, "type": "recv", "message_id": "54710455", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“……本来就……不是。只有一点点……”*有些无力“所以要……变强”"}
{"time": 1757888102, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1250152362", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"无聊的理由。\"她也懒得说什么，你们回到四楼，诺维拉已经被龙芙完全锁住，那些雷霆组成的锁链还在持续地放电"}
{"time": 1757888176, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1066828922", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“龙芙小姐……”*干巴巴地开口“我想见……西里斯……”"}
