{"time": 1757959322, "type": "reply", "message_id": "1790404664", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": 2875548981, "name": "小雅"}, "message": "[张风辰]演奏出: 1D20+1={15}+1=16"}
{"time": 1757959494, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1468215084", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "你的意识沉入一片海中......随后便是...下坠...下坠...等你回过神来，周围纯白的景色已经告诉了你这是哪里...不过此刻周遭部分沾染了一些金色的流光，显然有些格格不入"}
{"time": 1757959633, "type": "recv", "message_id": "724383633", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“金色……”*金色的主人……太多了。龙芙，艾希，娜哈特，甚至加缪尔……无论是哪种，对自己的梦境来说，都是不速之客……靠近一些，伸手去触碰那金色的流光"}
{"time": 1757959656, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1458012405", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "慢慢睁开眼睛..仔细回味刚刚的感觉，舌头舔一下嘴唇...身体又忍不住的燥热起来，只能努力用意志去压制..“谢谢你，里榭娜姐姐..愿意给这样的我爱”"}
{"time": 1757959761, "type": "recv", "message_id": "567765434", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我，有什么可以帮得上里榭娜姐姐的吗..一直以来都是姐姐在帮我，我也想帮姐姐分担一下你的事情...”"}
{"time": 1757959941, "type": "recv", "message_id": "891899215", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=724383633](艾希是哪位来着)"}
{"time": 1757959948, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1485305223", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（king啊）"}
{"time": 1757959953, "type": "recv", "message_id": "463986187", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=724383633]\"不要...\"潜意识在警告，触碰前的一瞬间你条件反射收回手"}
{"time": 1757959968, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1915094635", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（oh）"}
{"time": 1757960015, "type": "recv", "message_id": "697765001", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“……”*看着自己缩回的手，试探性呼唤“妃花？你怎么样？”"}
{"time": 1757960036, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1980434112", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=567765434]\"可以哦～我上一次也说了吧？\"她挑起你的下巴，\"杀了西里斯。\"一副将笑未笑的样子"}
{"time": 1757960233, "type": "recv", "message_id": "68879243", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“....这...”有些迟疑，额头上不断有汗低下..只能微微低下头，不敢看里榭娜姐姐的眼睛“我.....”"}
{"time": 1757960247, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1648127331", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=697765001]你意识到刚刚潜意识的声音其实就是妃花的声音，只是显得很虚弱...在你的呼唤之后...你听见...身后传来了铃铛声"}
{"time": 1757960282, "type": "recv", "message_id": "191864208", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "*转过身，看看什么情况？"}
{"time": 1757960523, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1539672788", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我不是个好孩子...我做不到...”感觉到无比的羞愧...上一秒还信誓旦旦，结果下一秒就这样，有想拿翅膀戳死自己的冲动"}
{"time": 1757960529, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1748139493", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=191864208]在你身后...妃花被金色的丝线绑在地上，两串吊住手腕，一串挂住脖子，脚踝处则是拴着金色的重球...眼神有些黯淡，\"...\""}
{"time": 1757960559, "type": "recv", "message_id": "898095924", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（袜，还有sm）"}
{"time": 1757960628, "type": "recv", "message_id": "808280398", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1539672788]\"果然是滥情又色情的孩子啊。\"她的表情一点都不奇怪，\"那你觉得，人家该不该生气?该怎么做?\""}
{"time": 1757960707, "type": "recv", "message_id": "495651950", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“这……”*瞳孔缩了缩，快步走到跟前蹲下来，手指在丝线周遭犹疑。看起来像同样的物质，怎么能追到……这里？“这些是……怎么回事？是娜哈特？”"}
{"time": 1757960877, "type": "recv", "message_id": "864347697", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=495651950]\"...不要回来...\"她看向你，眼神有些空洞，\"玛文大人....不要回来...\"你注意到她的眼睛都有些无法聚焦，\"走...\""}
{"time": 1757960889, "type": "recv", "message_id": "570307794", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“生气是应该的.....姐姐你惩罚我吧....我不是乖孩子”"}
