{"time": 1758030722, "type": "recv", "message_id": "615740634", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(活了)"}
{"time": 1758030746, "type": "recv", "message_id": "275331026", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（好的）"}
{"time": 1758031036, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1574283458", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（活了吗，如活）"}
{"time": 1758032215, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1064183110", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1465203412]\"...我很难影响到这里...\"语气难掩疲劳，\"妃花被那家伙锁在这里....很难影响被支配的梦境...\"一声叹息，\"...等妃花自己...或者...\""}
{"time": 1758032253, "type": "recv", "message_id": "166012695", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1341329887]\"哦呀，你可以，为人家做事哦?\""}
{"time": 1758032363, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1179989622", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“真的吗...”想到能为姐姐做事感觉有些开心，但又想到了刚刚的事情，瞬间失落了“我也想为姐姐做事..但有些事我感觉我好难做到...”"}
{"time": 1758033130, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2076560402", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1179989622]\"哪些?\""}
{"time": 1758033199, "type": "recv", "message_id": "72602928", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“杀人之类的吧...”低头不敢看她，里榭娜姐姐听到这话肯定会很生气"}
{"time": 1758033568, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1623381748", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=72602928]\"哦～只是不戮而已，没什么啦。\"她一副无所谓的样子"}
{"time": 1758033615, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1385245529", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“真的吗..里榭娜姐姐不会觉得我很没用吗，明明是个魔人，却连这种事都做不到...”"}
{"time": 1758033716, "type": "recv", "message_id": "716645905", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1385245529]\"当然不会哦～\"她对着你伸出手，\"不杀的誓言，可是有一个家伙很喜欢的呢～\""}
{"time": 1758033881, "type": "recv", "message_id": "106582368", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "抬起头，开心的看着她“里榭娜姐姐....你真好”"}
{"time": 1758034163, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1335542951", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=106582368]\"嗯哼?\"她轻哼了一声，算是接受了你的感谢，\"那么，你要一直被锁在这里吗？\""}
{"time": 1758034238, "type": "recv", "message_id": "448226918", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“...我不知道..但是就算现在挣脱了锁链，我也应该还会被抓住吧，而且外面也好多人在抓我...好麻烦”"}
{"time": 1758034344, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2026149200", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1064183110]“这儿到底是谁的梦……怎么还不听我的了”*皱了皱眉“那样的话，我在这岂不是也很危险”"}
{"time": 1758034513, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1976647349", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=448226918]\"你想离开吗？一了百了。\""}
{"time": 1758034611, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1935267831", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我...说出来不怕你笑话..我想解决这里的事情，想让所有人从这里脱离出去..”"}
{"time": 1758035226, "type": "recv", "message_id": "864584440", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2026149200]\"这里一直都是妃花的梦境啦...\"她的声音缥缈，\"你只是误入...不过...现在这里归于...那家伙了。\""}
{"time": 1758036628, "type": "recv", "message_id": "501187466", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=864584440]“……哦”*看着金色的丝线“那什么，玛门的手笔？”"}
{"time": 1758037196, "type": "recv", "message_id": "942545331", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1935267831](为什么会这么理性)"}
{"time": 1758037283, "type": "recv", "message_id": "193358825", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（可能因为一直都这么想的吧，然后人性的险恶见的还是不够多（）"}
{"time": 1758037581, "type": "recv", "message_id": "20319274", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(只是，为什么会这么理性)"}
{"time": 1758037593, "type": "recv", "message_id": "811069025", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“虽然...大家好像都很怕我，但是假如我做的好事足够多，会不会大家就会改变对我的看法...”"}
{"time": 1758037623, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1683674507", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "(现在不是掏心窝子环节吗)"}
{"time": 1758037675, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1637411684", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=501187466]\"嗯....不要被他发现....不过或许我可以...尝试一下...\""}
{"time": 1758038091, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1605899713", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "当说出这些话时内心破坏与蹂躏的欲望不断高涨，有一种想抽说这种话自己一巴掌的冲动"}
{"time": 1758038146, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1959659162", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1605899713]随后幻想自己在外面大杀特杀血流成河的场面"}
{"time": 1758038268, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1781363045", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "但一看到手上的手链，就好像听到了师父和露露的声音“诺诺,不要这样”二人好像在悬崖边拉着自己一样，防止自己踏入彻头彻尾的深渊"}
{"time": 1758038490, "type": "recv", "message_id": "408309931", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1637411684]“既然妃花想让我走，为什么我还是会到这里来？”"}
{"time": 1758038672, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1259650330", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1781363045]\"怎么样都可以哦?\"她的声音有些媚，\"我会接受任何的你～\""}
{"time": 1758038887, "type": "recv", "message_id": "851678492", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“姐姐...”感动的看着她"}
{"time": 1758038954, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1779129157", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=408309931]“算了。那家伙什么来头？我只知道是教团首脑，应该还有别的身份吧”"}
{"time": 1758039424, "type": "recv", "message_id": "425824319", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=408309931]\"...可能...\"她的声音也越飘越远，\"我在这里也不能...久留....\"最后的话语传递到你的耳边，\"安息...灾杰....\""}
{"time": 1758039592, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1360088939", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=851678492]\"而且...\"她似是无意地开口，\"马上你就要回去了呢\""}
{"time": 1758039629, "type": "recv", "message_id": "267620087", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“回去是？”有些疑惑“姐姐要走了吗...”"}
{"time": 1758039695, "type": "recv", "message_id": "985221995", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=425824319]“我在这呆着倒是好像没什么事”*顿了顿“希望吧。我再陪她一阵”"}
{"time": 1758039976, "type": "recv", "message_id": "868949645", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=985221995]*走到妃花跟前，伸出手盖住她脑袋上，就这么轻抚一阵“不过，早晚会被顺着找上来吧”"}
{"time": 1758040653, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1905092527", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "([CQ:at,qq=1252219916] 伊酱？)"}
{"time": 1758040692, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1735707667", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=868949645]没有卡珊德拉的声音，只剩下妃花的婴宁，有些无助，带着些许痛苦迷茫"}
{"time": 1758040861, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1412651277", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=267620087]\"是你要回去。\""}
{"time": 1758040866, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1490216375", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "*如果自己去触碰那金色丝线……恐怕瞬间变成一样的下场也说不定。叹了口气，最终也只能是……留得青山在"}
{"time": 1758040915, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1273880524", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“是吗，下次见到姐姐不知道是什么时候了”叹口气"}
{"time": 1758041512, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1563095654", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1273880524]\"确实呢～毕竟你要回到，魔族那边～\""}
{"time": 1758041533, "type": "recv", "message_id": "53143982", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1490216375]*试着先行醒来吧"}
{"time": 1758041550, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2125228288", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“？里榭娜姐姐在开玩笑吧....”"}
{"time": 1758041712, "type": "recv", "message_id": "110470101", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（刚出狼穴，又入虎口？）"}
{"time": 1758041752, "type": "recv", "message_id": "182707300", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（干嘛，你有别的家能回吗）"}
{"time": 1758041917, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2059677472", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=53143982]——那你描述()"}
{"time": 1758041927, "type": "recv", "message_id": "817911592", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（我怎么描述）"}
{"time": 1758041951, "type": "recv", "message_id": "566546788", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(就，如何醒来呢)"}
{"time": 1758041971, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1869405611", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（和之前一样？）"}
{"time": 1758041990, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2067407217", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2125228288]\"没有哦～对你而言，只能回魔族那里了吧？\"她笑眯眯地，\"毕竟，你又不是人\""}
{"time": 1758042041, "type": "recv", "message_id": "795739506", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“那我也不是纯粹的魔族...在两边不都差不多么...我不想去那边”"}
{"time": 1758042134, "type": "recv", "message_id": "856186933", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（但是之前还能飞起来）"}
{"time": 1758042137, "type": "recv", "message_id": "291063808", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（现在不行了）"}
{"time": 1758042146, "type": "recv", "message_id": "192764359", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（那我要，怎么醒呢？）"}
