{"time": 1758073355, "type": "recv", "message_id": "80777272", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“西莉斯姐姐....你醒了？”有些惊喜但又有些害怕"}
{"time": 1758073463, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2041036130", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=868786138]可惜自己的左手无力抱住她的后脑……不然也许能再快些。或许该把她放平，自上而下才能更好借助体重“……对不起。下次见面我会耐心听你抱怨的”"}
{"time": 1758073763, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1987651942", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=80777272]\"嗯....\"她睁开了眼睛...\"嗯...诺诺?\""}
{"time": 1758073812, "type": "recv", "message_id": "176008674", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“是我，西莉斯姐姐，你能醒来太好了....”"}
{"time": 1758073852, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1003014607", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“能在走之前再和你说说话...我好开心”"}
{"time": 1758074162, "type": "recv", "message_id": "103953308", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2041036130]\"...\"随着人体失温，她的手从你的脸颊上垂下，跌落到肩膀，随后...周围的景色开始破碎，你只看见她最后略微平静的笑容"}
{"time": 1758074451, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2139048831", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1003014607]\"走?\"她似乎有些疑惑，但是身体的状态不太好，\"呃...\""}
{"time": 1758074524, "type": "recv", "message_id": "855711293", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=103953308]“晚安，明天见”*喘着粗气，四仰八叉地倒在一旁，再次尝试醒来"}
{"time": 1758074595, "type": "recv", "message_id": "279464031", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“西莉斯姐姐...你先好好躺着吧”摸摸她的头“里榭娜姐姐说要让我去魔族那边做一些事情，我答应了....所以可能要暂时离开一段时间”"}
{"time": 1758074612, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1292305040", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我不会去做坏事的，西莉斯姐姐不要讨厌我”连忙补充道"}
{"time": 1758074996, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1883572604", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=855711293]入睡前的天花板出现在你的视野"}
{"time": 1758075172, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1617554680", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "*看看钟，现在过了多久？"}
{"time": 1758075947, "type": "recv", "message_id": "844513145", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1292305040]\"魔族...里榭娜?\"她费力地想要抬起身子，\"什么...?诺诺...?\""}
{"time": 1758076032, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1652970968", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1617554680]凌晨三点左右"}
{"time": 1758076272, "type": "recv", "message_id": "450146323", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“不用担心我，西莉斯姐姐，我现在挺厉害的....不再是之前那个只能逃跑的自己了”"}
{"time": 1758076292, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1585819177", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“以后我也能保护西莉斯姐姐了”"}
{"time": 1758076397, "type": "recv", "message_id": "216907372", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1652970968]*看看自己的左肩，应该不至于真的断掉。那妃花应该也不会真的死掉。但是每晚要睡两觉的感觉着实不算好"}
{"time": 1758076404, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1065859399", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1585819177]\"...你做了什么？\"她环顾四周，看了看房间，最后目光落到你身上，显然还在混乱之中"}
{"time": 1758076612, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1396312256", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=216907372]尽管如此，左臂依然传来隐约的痛感，并且随着意识清醒逐渐清晰...让人忍不住吸口冷气"}
{"time": 1758076648, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1528787332", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "房间里西里斯依然躺着好好的，诺亚坐在床边，爱璃西雅则不在这里。"}
{"time": 1758077009, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1246891935", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "*换个姿势，将左肩压在身下，以此减轻些痛感……但依旧睡不着。“……啊啊，麻烦的事越来越多……真是的，就不能遵守先来后到吗？”"}
{"time": 1758077360, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1662571408", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "由于开着小夜灯，诺亚注意到了你这边，稍微偏过来一些视线，眼神询问你是否需要帮忙。"}
{"time": 1758077719, "type": "recv", "message_id": "137002797", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“……诺亚，知不知道一个与安息相关的教派？”*省去礼节性词汇“和灾杰也有关系”"}
{"time": 1758077883, "type": "recv", "message_id": "575442262", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1065859399]（原来早就回我了（））"}
{"time": 1758078024, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1918394174", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我没做什么特别的啊....硬要说的话，我和里榭娜姐姐之前进行了一些交易，现在好像比西莉斯姐姐还厉害，所以你不用担心我了..”继续摸摸西莉斯姐姐的头，emmm，头发好柔顺，摸着感觉好舒服..."}
