{"time": 1758109482, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1134881489", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "*睡不着，索性起身，打算回秩序那边看看。反正也要去收敛办事处“有人问起来，就说我去秩序那边调查了”"}
{"time": 1758109518, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2011662296", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“之前一直说要学双剑...结果到最后也没有怎么学”把阐释者从腰间解下来放到她的身旁“西莉丝姐姐帮我保管一下吧，这把剑对我很重要的...我一定会回来取的”"}
{"time": 1758109586, "type": "recv", "message_id": "322675183", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1134881489]\"...伊芙小姐，也要一个人...去外面?\"她显出了担忧的神情"}
{"time": 1758109612, "type": "recv", "message_id": "717176877", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（那我问你柯艾特在哪.jpg）"}
{"time": 1758109617, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1373559276", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（我能不能用血在西莉丝身上留个标记啊，随时知道她的安危）"}
{"time": 1758109685, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1425432316", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2011662296]\"不止是为了我.....也为了骑士团的大家...诺诺。\"她闭上了眼睛，\"你得把剑术学完。\""}
{"time": 1758109703, "type": "recv", "message_id": "407288854", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=717176877](不在房间喵)"}
{"time": 1758109910, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1989578490", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "有些动摇“但是里榭娜姐姐说会有人来接我...那个人万一不好说话的话，我不想也不敢赌她生气的可能性...我不想在因为我，让身边的大家受到伤害了”"}
{"time": 1758109926, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1862169108", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=322675183]“主要是也睡不着”*迟疑了会。现在确实哪都不安全，自己也确实没什么防身的手段“……算了，有什么制毒的材料吗？”"}
{"time": 1758109934, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1974744246", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1373559276]（可以吗）"}
