{"time": 1758133634, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2079652803", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“嗯...”认真的看着她“我喜欢西莉丝姐姐...很认真的那种”"}
