{"time": 1758212900, "type": "recv", "message_id": "366472974", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=308536060]\"哦～那你能为我做什么?不想跟我离开的话，你要支付什么样的酬劳?\"她轻笑，握手成拳，鸽子随之消失，\"看你的样子也不能杀人吧？\""}
{"time": 1758213119, "type": "recv", "message_id": "834407347", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1997594636]“……”*咬了咬牙“……我还能站的起来吗？以后”"}
{"time": 1758213470, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1305555196", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=834407347]\"装上魔导器的话...或者...\"她停顿，\"拐杖。\""}
{"time": 1758213735, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1009231115", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1305555196]“……”*甚至没办法抱着自己的膝盖，只能无力地躺在床上“诺亚……我想回家了”"}
{"time": 1758214016, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1198464936", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1009231115]\"嗯...\"她答完，安静地坐在你旁边，\"伊芙可以不参与...等这边的事情结束，诺亚带你回家...\""}
{"time": 1758214240, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1654353131", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1198464936]“……”*用被子蒙住自己的脑袋，什么也不想，什么也想不动。只有在这样的包裹中，才能短暂不去想自己的双脚"}
