{"time": 1758228691, "type": "recv", "message_id": "711257977", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=780151162]\"嗯...\"她没有接上话题，大概也不知道该怎么接"}
{"time": 1758228760, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2031276201", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=243063922]\"还不错。\"说着她又扯下一个翅膀，三下五除二吃了下去"}
{"time": 1758228775, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1928610254", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“别扯了...我真的错了，好痛啊”"}
{"time": 1758228823, "type": "recv", "message_id": "665798285", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "想到等会要让翅膀重新长出来，就感觉好像又缺血了，头已经提前开始晕了"}
{"time": 1758228833, "type": "recv", "message_id": "351704745", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=711257977]“所以……”*咂摸着嘴“我猜你想做的事是……变成特别的人偶？”"}
