{"time": 1758229090, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1344030659", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1529760914]“明明话语里全是憧憬的样子……”*又闭上眼睛“好吧，我不说了”"}
