{"time": 1758229255, "type": "recv", "message_id": "421684028", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=665798285]\"还没饱。\"她才懒得管你，双手齐上，把你的血翼又扯下两个"}
{"time": 1758229274, "type": "recv", "message_id": "624281094", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1420352584]\"当做我没有说过吧。\"她闭上了嘴"}
{"time": 1758229291, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1031228236", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“真的很痛啊...”"}
{"time": 1758229346, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1914948021", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "强忍着喊出来的冲动“斑比小姐，我可以不去吗...我感觉我现在还好弱，去了也没什么用，能不能让我在历练历练”"}
{"time": 1758229403, "type": "recv", "message_id": "651984301", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=624281094]“嗯……”*识趣地闭上嘴，毕竟自己也没有帮她的能力"}
{"time": 1758229424, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1791845610", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1914948021]\"血的质量还不错。\"她刚喝下肚，扭头看向你，\"不行，斑比酱必须要带走你，任务就是这么说的。\""}
{"time": 1758229449, "type": "recv", "message_id": "673542589", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“那你这个任务有限时吗...”"}
{"time": 1758229511, "type": "recv", "message_id": "362744521", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"呃...\"她认真想了一会，最后拿起你的手腕狠狠咬了下去，你立刻感觉到血液大量流失"}
{"time": 1758229541, "type": "recv", "message_id": "712749044", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "但是意外地，不怎么难受?"}
{"time": 1758229549, "type": "recv", "message_id": "652212563", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=651984301]*等带了酒店，再睁开眼"}
{"time": 1758229568, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1240243823", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "感觉有些神奇，但对对吗，流失了这么多血"}
{"time": 1758229601, "type": "recv", "message_id": "135228709", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=651984301]今日的酒店也是一如既往地平和，抛开大批退房的客人不看。"}
{"time": 1758229610, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1401605226", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我怎么感觉我的血要流光光了...”"}
{"time": 1758229649, "type": "recv", "message_id": "227772970", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=135228709]以及，某个粉毛此刻正坐在大厅里，拿着高脚杯小酌红葡萄酒"}
{"time": 1758229707, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1374525283", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1401605226]你感觉眼前发黑，不过她终于停了下来，\"量大管饱。\"说完她摸了摸肚子，在客厅的沙发坐下，闭目养神"}
{"time": 1758229770, "type": "recv", "message_id": "526850876", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=227772970]“……真坐得住啊。”*气不打一处来“你的协助，就是这么协的？”"}
{"time": 1758229782, "type": "recv", "message_id": "257073590", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“可不可以先把我放下来...有点难受，斑比...酱”想要试图稍微亲近一点"}
{"time": 1758229995, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2028989741", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=526850876]\"哦...?\"她小口喝着酒，偏头看向你，\"你不打招呼自己跑了，怪我?丢了什么?\"眯起眼，随后噗嗤一笑，\"把脚丢了?\""}
{"time": 1758230050, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1089813443", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=257073590]\"那你跟我走吗？\""}
