{"time": 1758301993, "type": "recv", "message_id": "928544937", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“没关系的...只要能继续和西莉丝姐姐在一起，这些都不算什么...”"}
{"time": 1758302013, "type": "recv", "message_id": "114215378", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1032502167]“……哎，果然也没法一下子就好全”*弯下腰去轻轻戳一戳“真难看啊……”"}
{"time": 1758302114, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1944264550", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=114215378]可能是神经还没有再生，并没有什么痛感，此外...很饿"}
{"time": 1758302269, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1613094271", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1944264550]“嗯……饿了……”*眨巴眨巴眼睛看诺亚“想吃肉”"}
{"time": 1758302436, "type": "recv", "message_id": "857475509", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“斑比酱...我可以相信你吗...”"}
{"time": 1758302652, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1781520333", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1613094271]\"嗯...\"她点点头，\"我现在下去做，待会会拿给你，想吃什么?\""}
{"time": 1758302701, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1760916235", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=857475509]\"你以为我是谁?\"头顶的蝙蝠咬着你的头皮扯了扯，痛感有些入脑"}
{"time": 1758302717, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1489056610", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“疼疼疼，我错了我错了，别咬了”"}
{"time": 1758302851, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1824920536", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "万一万一成为斑比的血裔之后，之前的约定她反悔了怎么办，这个可能性自己敢赌吗...好纠结..."}
{"time": 1758303161, "type": "recv", "message_id": "266057570", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“....西莉丝姐姐你来帮我决定吧...我真的有点不知所措了”"}
{"time": 1758303167, "type": "recv", "message_id": "650679758", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "蝙蝠保持着揪住你头皮的状态，倒是没更进一步"}
{"time": 1758303949, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1557505914", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（龙哥呢）"}
{"time": 1758303970, "type": "recv", "message_id": "944532252", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1781520333]“嗯……不要那么精细的，吃不爽快”*想了想“肉排……吧”"}
{"time": 1758303987, "type": "recv", "message_id": "567675273", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“斑比酱我不会乱说你话了..快松开吧..”有些求饶似的对她说道"}
{"time": 1758304360, "type": "recv", "message_id": "787820870", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=944532252]\"好吧...猪肉似乎不太合适，煎一些牛肉?\"她把你放在床上，铺好被子，\"嗯...应该要熟一点。\""}
{"time": 1758304399, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1523747284", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=567675273]\"....\"她慢慢松开嘴，你感觉似乎破了皮，反正肯定出了血"}
{"time": 1758304444, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1085508013", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“嗯……拜托你了”*总算输了口气，不可思议的是，明明才刚来五楼不到一天，却莫名有些安全感"}
{"time": 1758304624, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1847914868", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“谢谢斑比酱，斑比酱你真好...”松了一口气，要把自己的未来交给这种人吗...“算了，西莉丝姐姐，我再想想其他办法吧....”"}
{"time": 1758304805, "type": "recv", "message_id": "129498330", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(现在后悔?)"}
{"time": 1758304863, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1213122832", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1085508013]她收拾了一些自己的衣服，离开了房间，四周重归静寂，只有一些轻微的流水声在四周环绕"}
{"time": 1758304997, "type": "recv", "message_id": "602771799", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1847914868]\"决定好了么？\"头皮隐隐作痛，\"斑比酱没什么耐心。\""}
{"time": 1758305046, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1494345180", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“emmm，抱歉了斑比酱，我还是再想想其他办法吧，对不起了，要不你再吸点我的血...”"}
{"time": 1758305268, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1492389480", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1213122832]“想成为人类吗……”*在她离开后小声嘀咕“……身份本身……哪有做了什么重要呢”"}
{"time": 1758305402, "type": "recv", "message_id": "266133217", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1494345180]\"斑比酱只给你一次机会。\"她扑棱着翅膀落在你的手腕上，随后露出牙齿就是一咬，手腕上的皮肉瞬间破开，她开始咕噜咕噜地吸"}
