{"time": 1758310263, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1940414760", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“西莉丝..姐姐，我好晕..扶我一下吧”"}
{"time": 1758310535, "type": "recv", "message_id": "961124854", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=506861422]\"啊啦～不会伤到你的，一点点～\"阴影盘旋到你面前，室内的温度降低了一些。"}
{"time": 1758310556, "type": "recv", "message_id": "302811678", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1940414760](不知道为什么，看见这话呼吸就急促了起来)"}
{"time": 1758310576, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1160057816", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（？）"}
{"time": 1758310582, "type": "recv", "message_id": "862636054", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1940414760]她自然地扶住你，\"没事...有我在。\""}
{"time": 1758310693, "type": "recv", "message_id": "590995936", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "有西莉丝姐姐在身边，感觉好像也没那么害怕了..."}
{"time": 1758310705, "type": "recv", "message_id": "340568978", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=961124854]“……”*再晚就来不及了，用尽全力尽快起身，单脚跳着朝龙芙的房门跳去“龙芙小姐……！”"}
{"time": 1758310803, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1020226031", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=590995936]你感觉生机渐渐流失，体温越来越低...越来越低...眼前似乎见到了死去的父母"}
{"time": 1758310898, "type": "recv", "message_id": "362387878", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "哎？爸爸妈妈，你们怎么来了，是来接我的吗...我还不想走，我还有好多事没有做.."}
{"time": 1758310907, "type": "recv", "message_id": "820082352", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=340568978](那你过一个敏捷)"}
