{"time": 1758367487, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2004061754", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=882108644]头顶的角逐渐消融，渐渐的....两个新生的红色蝙蝠翅膀取代了它们，斑比终于松开了你，只是眼下她面色苍白如雪，整个人软软的，轻靠在你怀里。"}
{"time": 1758367762, "type": "recv", "message_id": "349246666", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "把胳膊伸到她的嘴前面“斑比酱要不要吸点血”看她的情况感觉有些担心"}
{"time": 1758367835, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1448675335", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"不要。\"她目光瞥向一旁的两人，\"让她们给我吸。\""}
{"time": 1758367961, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1962645150", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“只有这次吗....还是之后都要她们的”"}
{"time": 1758368192, "type": "recv", "message_id": "429701769", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"我需要和你讲道理吗？\"她的眸子闪过猩红，\"快点。\""}
{"time": 1758368261, "type": "recv", "message_id": "670405529", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "有些纠结，心里不太想违抗她，但又不想伤害那两个，尤其是是西莉斯姐姐"}
{"time": 1758368551, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2083976605", "deleted": true, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "拔出剑在胳膊上割一个口子“之前不是很喜欢么...”"}
{"time": 1758368663, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1031827801", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "'爱璃西雅姐姐，西莉斯姐姐，可以借她一点点血吗...我以后会想办法补偿的\"有些不好意思的看向二人，如果斑比失控了，也许会发生更恐怖的事情"}
{"time": 1758368988, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1983155378", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"诶...血...\"爱璃西雅捂着嘴巴，眨了眨眼。"}
{"time": 1758369524, "type": "recv", "message_id": "223919055", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“你...要多少血，斑比酱...不会把人吸干吧”"}
{"time": 1758369898, "type": "recv", "message_id": "552287534", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=223919055]\"起码要把我损失的血补满。\"她顾着脸，气鼓鼓的"}
{"time": 1758370479, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1902980872", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“那真的不能用我的血吗...”试图在挣扎一下"}
{"time": 1758370947, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1062616816", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1902980872]\"那是我的血，有什么用。\"她露出尖牙，看上去已经要炸毛了"}
{"time": 1758370983, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1960618476", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“对不起，对不起.....”"}
{"time": 1758371169, "type": "recv", "message_id": "99122035", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“可以吗，爱璃西雅姐姐，西莉斯姐姐”求助的眼神看着她们两"}
{"time": 1758371193, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1325678615", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“应该不会伤害到她们两个吧...”"}
{"time": 1758371211, "type": "recv", "message_id": "739716553", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（要是龙神在就好了）"}
