{"time": 1758477765, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1423013070", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "显然没能成功"}
{"time": 1758478053, "type": "recv", "message_id": "796877688", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“好难啊.....”有些失落“明明是为了这个才变成血yi的，结果居然做不到...”"}
{"time": 1758478261, "type": "recv", "message_id": "281598967", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1365119544]“……诺亚呢？”*自然地接过盘子，但是没什么食欲“马纳利亚是谁家餐厅吗？怎么这么多人想来就来，想走就走”"}
{"time": 1758478281, "type": "recv", "message_id": "238911520", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "西里斯轻轻拥住你的肩膀，\"别担心...等斑比小姐醒了之后，再尝试问问她吧？\""}
{"time": 1758478304, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1193561352", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“嗯...也只能这样了”"}
