{"time": 1758532043, "type": "recv", "message_id": "162031584", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1626250014]\"不该看的东西...\"她没有接过戒指，\"什么...?没有帮上你的忙...还害了伊芙吗？\""}
{"time": 1758532081, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1780378717", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=346810472]\"在这边是安全的....\"她的话说了一半...突然收了回去，\"也许...\""}
{"time": 1758532151, "type": "recv", "message_id": "342142208", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“有龙芙小姐在，应该不会发生什么事吧...”"}
{"time": 1758532173, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1390972472", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=162031584]“没帮上的那部分是我的问题，不是它们的”*又把手往前送了送“现在该物归原主”"}
{"time": 1758532603, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1230739626", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:image,summary=&#91;动画表情&#93;,file=A8456474D457B4CC2E842B5E6E107D24.jpg,sub_type=1,url=https://multimedia.nt.qq.com.cn/download?appid=1407&amp;fileid=EhR8hTfd0jEbKSYN2dBrcBf4vndhwRjKXiD_CiiYofq4hOyPAzIEcHJvZFCAvaMBWhAavt0mQ1zPJj2VB4HU9cuMegIS14IBAm5q&amp;rkey=CAMSMCK-m-OfPB3Zrgt4Hv-nAMQTFHMn9vwkkK8PY_tjHXpe9Oa9uxYBofj80IeziwL-3w,file_size=12106]"}
{"time": 1758532621, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1903056140", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1390972472]\"嗯...不用不用...我原本就打算送给伊芙的...\"她连连摆手"}
{"time": 1758532849, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1101771707", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=342142208]\"她现在不在...而且...\"没有继续说下去，\"总之要小心。\""}
{"time": 1758532899, "type": "recv", "message_id": "296967837", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“太贵重了，我还不了。”*摇摇头“光借用已经算受之有愧”"}
{"time": 1758532995, "type": "recv", "message_id": "201460474", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“谢谢诺亚提醒了...”"}
{"time": 1758533243, "type": "recv", "message_id": "285565469", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“我又没做过什么”"}
{"time": 1758533283, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2776292", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=296967837]\"在我这里也没有什么作用...\"她咬着嘴唇，\"伊芙...应该比我需要吧...之前在客厅里被那个...不讲道理的人要求调查...\""}
{"time": 1758533470, "type": "recv", "message_id": "222963920", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“……”*伸出的手停了会，最后还是收回来“谢谢，我尽量别死也别忘”"}
{"time": 1758533582, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1442714907", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（不讲道理的人是谁）"}
{"time": 1758533592, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1881397439", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（科艾特）"}
{"time": 1758533659, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1221089472", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=222963920]\"嗯...\"她想了想，对你伸出右手，上面还戴着三枚戒指，\"伊芙要是不介意的话...这些也可以拿走...\""}
{"time": 1758533821, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1743878864", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1221089472]“我不擅长魔法，多要也没用”*看着蓝色的那枚“不过这枚是代表水元素吗？火不太适合我”"}
{"time": 1758533918, "type": "recv", "message_id": "282033110", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1743878864]\"嗯...\"她摘下蓝色的戒指，\"这是水元素...\"然后指着旁边的两枚，\"这是气...还有这个是...以太..\""}
{"time": 1758534043, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1037628528", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=282033110]“没，我只要土和水就好了”*摇摇头，把红色的那枚和她手上蓝色的那枚交换"}
{"time": 1758534216, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1599999012", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"这...我想更多帮上大家...\"她咬着嘴唇，有些不肯收你换回来的戒指，你这时才注意到她的右手上有两个血眼，现在还在慢慢出血。"}
{"time": 1758534247, "type": "recv", "message_id": "228832337", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（受着（）"}
{"time": 1758534419, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1757423362", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1599999012]“你的手……怎么回事？被蝙蝠咬了？”余光看一眼诺维拉“……多了我也用不过来”"}
{"time": 1758534453, "type": "recv", "message_id": "829311826", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“艾璃西雅姐姐已经帮大家很多了..”"}
{"time": 1758534511, "type": "recv", "message_id": "111956950", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "虽然不是自己干的，但和自己也脱不了干系，所以有些愧疚"}
{"time": 1758534589, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1099864559", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"没...没什么...\"她急急忙忙收回手，红色的戒指随之掉在地上，\"啊...对不起...对不起...我总是笨手笨脚...\""}
{"time": 1758534609, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1032613771", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "帮忙把戒指捡起来"}
{"time": 1758534693, "type": "recv", "message_id": "707916645", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“没有这回事啦..”把戒指放到她的手上“而且能和艾璃西雅姐姐成为朋友，我感觉很幸运呢”"}
{"time": 1758534943, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1818143571", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=707916645]\"...但我总是帮不上忙...\"她抿着唇，左手捂着右手的洞眼，看上去有些想哭，洗了洗鼻子，\"也没有才能...拖大家的后腿...\""}
{"time": 1758534991, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2135487071", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我现在才是托大家后腿的人...艾璃西雅姐姐没有嫌弃我，我已经很开心了”握着她的手"}
{"time": 1758535665, "type": "recv", "message_id": "595630365", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1818143571]“不用压力自己。有那个功夫，艾丽西娅小姐不如找找自己擅长的事”*顿了顿“而且我觉得戒指在你手上比较让人放心。我觉得戒指的主人总是爱你的”"}
{"time": 1758535742, "type": "recv", "message_id": "35213522", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（好像不对）"}
{"time": 1758535752, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1074446094", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（哦好像也对）"}
{"time": 1758535829, "type": "recv", "message_id": "407475877", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"...\"她一时语噎，低着脑袋，豆大的泪珠在空气中滴落，一边抽泣一边慢慢开口，\"可是...艾尔她...我这种人真的配得上....做她的...妹妹吗...\"攥着诺维拉的手很紧"}
{"time": 1758535912, "type": "recv", "message_id": "907614828", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（这不趁机再嘬一口（）"}
{"time": 1758535930, "type": "recv", "message_id": "46115137", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（皮肤吸血这一块）"}
{"time": 1758536017, "type": "recv", "message_id": "438766186", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“世界上哪有那么多配不配的上，我是个魔人，世界上最低等的存在，西莉丝姐姐和艾璃西雅姐姐不也没嫌弃我么....”"}
{"time": 1758536064, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1580370430", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“下次自己亲口去问问如何？如果她的回答是否，那我想她可能也不太配当一个姐姐”"}
