{"time": 1758538088, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1752940560", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1018749949][CQ:at,qq=1252219916] “没有这种事...”"}
{"time": 1758538108, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1802755496", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“说起来，这些戒指的来头不小……艾璃西亚居然有十枚么，是家里人给的？”"}
{"time": 1758538123, "type": "recv", "message_id": "842838164", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我们不是好朋友吗...我很需要艾璃西雅姐姐”"}
{"time": 1758538176, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1928544646", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=564394351]（芊神是大卫戴）"}
{"time": 1758538202, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1989814830", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=564394351]（厉害）"}
{"time": 1758538349, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1949035131", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“像我这样，以后估计也交不到朋友了..而我以前的朋友，也都离开了我...艾璃西雅姐姐已经是我现在唯一的朋友了”"}
{"time": 1758538402, "type": "recv", "message_id": "4017762", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1802755496]\"嗯...\"她摩挲着红色的戒指，\"很早之前，埃尔给我的...\""}
{"time": 1758538630, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1556119223", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“喏”*只是点点头，便不再出声，似是不言自明"}
{"time": 1758539138, "type": "recv", "message_id": "241642830", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1949035131]\"诶...朋友...\"她抬起头，眼睛周围红肿一片，\"那...西里斯姐姐...\""}
{"time": 1758539313, "type": "recv", "message_id": "54271980", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“不一样啦...”"}
{"time": 1758539333, "type": "recv", "message_id": "145937142", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"但是，这是很早之前...还没入学的时候...之后埃尔就...\"她嗫嚅着，\"因为我是没有才能的人...\""}
{"time": 1758539343, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1994295708", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“反正艾璃西雅姐姐对我来说很重要...”"}
{"time": 1758539356, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1284031472", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“说要是敢欺负你，我会帮你报仇的”"}
