{"time": 1758561791, "type": "recv", "message_id": "176549716", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1736581654]\"嗯...\"正说着话，西里斯拿着一张新的钥匙卡上了楼"}
{"time": 1758561866, "type": "recv", "message_id": "808651035", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“西莉丝姐姐...”上前轻轻抱住她"}
{"time": 1758562010, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1335077783", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "*挑了挑眉，多少感觉有些……违和"}
{"time": 1758562045, "type": "recv", "message_id": "246821636", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"哦...\"她倒是没推开诺维拉，看了一眼现场，表情有些无奈，\"伊芙怎么也在这。\""}
{"time": 1758562104, "type": "recv", "message_id": "33219899", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“来还戒指……不过没还成”"}
{"time": 1758562205, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1162068481", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"爱璃西雅觉得你更需要。\"她看向爱璃西雅，叹口气，\"虽然这话由我说不合适，但，你应该很适合。\""}
{"time": 1758562357, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1194528052", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“怎么连你也这么说……”*叹口气“我真没接触过魔法……艾丽西娅小姐自己不行吗”"}
{"time": 1758562445, "type": "recv", "message_id": "617195093", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“我只能算文职”"}
{"time": 1758562606, "type": "recv", "message_id": "56685998", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"我...我不行的啦。\"爱璃西雅手里捏着戒指，\"这种小火苗...\"她憋了口气，指尖冒出火苗，\"...伊芙肯定能发挥它们的作用的。\""}
{"time": 1758562723, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1015588201", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“艾丽西娅是学院的学生吧？是哪个科的？”*一时也弄不清楚状况“不应该吧”"}
{"time": 1758562982, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1197567856", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"塑能...\"她低着脑袋，\"我...\"咬着嘴唇，最后没出声。"}
{"time": 1758563099, "type": "recv", "message_id": "289571760", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“好了，艾璃西雅姐姐说送给你你就接受了吧...”"}
{"time": 1758563345, "type": "recv", "message_id": "42581265", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“好吧，却之不恭……那我也就先上去休息了”*点了点头“不问了不问了”"}
{"time": 1758563407, "type": "recv", "message_id": "772610891", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“……但是我相信，学院总有自己的考量的。虽然现在伊瑟尔的可靠性……成疑”"}
{"time": 1758563442, "type": "recv", "message_id": "940914440", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（羡慕五层人上人（bushi）"}
{"time": 1758563447, "type": "recv", "message_id": "148702777", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯...我也相信学院长有自己的考量...另外我们就在楼下。\"临走前西里斯开口，\"遇到事情可以来找我们。\""}
{"time": 1758563559, "type": "recv", "message_id": "546021457", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“明天我打算再去一趟收敛办事处”*看着西里斯“既然在这就提前说了，柯艾特也会去”"}
{"time": 1758563588, "type": "recv", "message_id": "209660768", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“你有什么新的线索了吗”"}
{"time": 1758563726, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1390682940", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“……其实是先去找宾森特算账”"}
{"time": 1758563784, "type": "recv", "message_id": "450405336", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“泰坦可是很强的，我之前和暴力交手过，凭我们几乎不可能赢的”"}
{"time": 1758563828, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1844601326", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“哦，那受着？”"}
{"time": 1758563954, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1935252309", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“那你有什么计划...”"}
{"time": 1758564027, "type": "recv", "message_id": "726733725", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“反正柯艾特说她不怕，不过这种事还是问西里斯小姐吧”"}
{"time": 1758564169, "type": "recv", "message_id": "16437364", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=726733725]\"宾森特本人...\"西里斯开口，\"并没有什么值得在意的，他依赖的是外置的阵法，而不是自身的实力，不过强闯警察局这种事，再加上现在不明的所谓泰坦的加成，我其实也不能确定。\""}
{"time": 1758564355, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1839426797", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“我的意思是”*摇摇头“他的律法，纵容安息的巢穴在监狱下安家？”"}
{"time": 1758564514, "type": "recv", "message_id": "494028198", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“安息是什么？”"}
{"time": 1758564521, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1697410874", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "不太懂，有点迷茫"}
{"time": 1758564534, "type": "recv", "message_id": "607903587", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“灾杰之一”"}
{"time": 1758564658, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1621075898", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“emmm，出乎意料但好像又在情理之中”"}
{"time": 1758564880, "type": "recv", "message_id": "605354425", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"安息...\"西里斯皱着眉，\"那是...想用永恒的沉睡笼罩世间的一群人...宾森特那里，下面是安息的巢穴?！\""}
{"time": 1758564974, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1223933042", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“亲眼所见”*点点头“而且物理层面上咬我很死”"}
{"time": 1758565180, "type": "recv", "message_id": "469602890", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“不然我也不至于拜托诺亚帮我”"}
{"time": 1758565240, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1518066065", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"...在这种地方还是不要单独行动。\"她叹口气，\"我们刚刚才吃了大亏...明天什么时候过去?\""}
{"time": 1758565379, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1152420302", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“明早？”"}
{"time": 1758565413, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1952834888", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“或许，越早越好”"}
{"time": 1758565495, "type": "recv", "message_id": "789534035", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“但是我现在不行，我得先修养一会。明天……你们有别的事？”"}
{"time": 1758565533, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2062748917", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "([CQ:at,qq=1040972910] )"}
{"time": 1758565552, "type": "recv", "message_id": "358138567", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“应该没有...”"}
{"time": 1758565576, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1235539985", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“那就明早吧”"}
{"time": 1758565621, "type": "recv", "message_id": "761460554", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "思索了一下，自己的翅膀是不是现在基本看不见了"}
{"time": 1758565640, "type": "recv", "message_id": "279636976", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(没有了)"}
{"time": 1758565645, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1191599822", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(头顶上有)"}
{"time": 1758565662, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1492508840", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（是不是带个帽子就遮住了）"}
{"time": 1758565707, "type": "recv", "message_id": "555495374", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“那就明天见。艾丽西娅应该也去？”"}
{"time": 1758565768, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1544415620", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"我...我就不去了...\"她缩了缩，\"我在这边等你们。\""}
{"time": 1758565853, "type": "recv", "message_id": "864429278", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“酒店里也不全然安全”*顿了顿“我也没法说哪边更危险”"}
{"time": 1758565943, "type": "recv", "message_id": "583344233", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“有斑比的话...应该..不对，也许斑比本身就是一种危险”说出这种话莫名有很刺激的感觉"}
{"time": 1758565990, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1964253445", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"到了现场我一定会拖大家后腿，在这边的话，静悄悄地...死了也...\"她的话头停住，\"没什么...\""}
{"time": 1758566065, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1477236091", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“都说了，艾璃西雅姐姐是我的好朋友....怎么会没什么，你在这样说，我要生气了...”把她的手放在手心"}
{"time": 1758566286, "type": "recv", "message_id": "950986542", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"好啦好啦...我都说没什么了。\"表情僵硬，\"没事的...祝你们明天顺利...\""}
{"time": 1758566544, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1081957607", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“先去休息吧...”"}
{"time": 1758566550, "type": "recv", "message_id": "250855139", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“真是怪人，我还以为我已经把自己看得够轻了”*听完这话皱起了眉“死之前就没什么非做不可的事吗？”"}
{"time": 1758566688, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1434235391", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"...\"对这个问题，她避开了回答，低着头看着自己的脚尖，一声不吭。"}
{"time": 1758567030, "type": "recv", "message_id": "976865888", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"好啦好啦...\"西里斯开口，打破了僵局，\"今天就这样吧，各自休息。\""}
{"time": 1758567056, "type": "recv", "message_id": "522150725", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“嗯...明天见”"}
{"time": 1758567214, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1256003990", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“……晚安”*转向诺亚“回程也拜托你了”"}
{"time": 1758567458, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1778094317", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“西莉丝姐姐,艾璃西雅姐姐看起来不太好...晚上我去陪陪她吧..”在西莉丝耳边小声的不舍的说"}
{"time": 1758567709, "type": "recv", "message_id": "230959906", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1256003990]诺亚点头，抱起你上了楼。\"伊芙，到底是怎么想的?诺亚有些不明白。\"等到明天重新坐在摆好的甜点前时，她才开口。"}
{"time": 1758567750, "type": "recv", "message_id": "77213586", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1778094317]\"呃...\"西里斯想了想，\"诺诺不会是想...\"她联想到了斑比，表情有些奇怪"}
{"time": 1758567775, "type": "recv", "message_id": "39571810", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“？西莉丝姐姐在想什么啊...”"}
{"time": 1758567790, "type": "recv", "message_id": "67473513", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我只是害怕艾璃西雅姐姐做什么傻事”"}
{"time": 1758567882, "type": "recv", "message_id": "7184440", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=230959906]“你说哪件事？”*随手插起一块巧克力蛋糕放进嘴里"}
{"time": 1758568102, "type": "recv", "message_id": "370739184", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=7184440]巧克力入口即化，不过放的时间稍长，原本似乎是做了冰糕流心处理，此时则显得有些软踏。\"嗯...就是...伊芙不是很讨厌诺维拉的吗？\""}
{"time": 1758568141, "type": "recv", "message_id": "609322735", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=67473513]\"这种时候谁都会想你会不会...\"她看了一眼爱璃西雅，\"当时都流口水了。\"她的手指点在你的额头"}
{"time": 1758568196, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1355014072", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我不会对熟人下手啦...好人也不会.. ”"}
{"time": 1758568373, "type": "recv", "message_id": "409695684", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=370739184]“我倒是想干掉她，只可惜现在做不到。”*靠在椅子上“现在更难了，而且……总不能在酒店里”"}
{"time": 1758568492, "type": "recv", "message_id": "514308501", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "(哎，诺亚怎么这样（bushi)"}
{"time": 1758568667, "type": "recv", "message_id": "271465592", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(对的，因为这是大陆酒店)"}
{"time": 1758568668, "type": "recv", "message_id": "422219327", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“只能明晚再和西莉丝姐姐一起睡了，哎”叹口气"}
