{"time": 1758737502, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1634294088", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1287451566]\"诶...有谁在喊我吗？\"她迷茫地四处看看。"}
