{"time": 1758740994, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1857401975", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=257590114]\"编号#68，客人，你要做什么?\""}
{"time": 1758741055, "type": "recv", "message_id": "470043511", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1053915249]\"嗯...诺亚应该做的。\"她铺好床，走到夜灯前打开，\"今夜宜忘却...伊芙，祝你有个好梦。\""}
{"time": 1758741076, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1654793523", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“emmm，听起来感觉冷冰冰的，姐姐你没有留影功能吧...”"}
{"time": 1758741130, "type": "recv", "message_id": "802696494", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“刚刚的事情应该没有记录吧...”"}
{"time": 1758741188, "type": "recv", "message_id": "136511203", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“嗯，晚安”*躺在床上盖好被子，房间稍有些空旷，不过不是不能忍受"}
{"time": 1758741209, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1345812679", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=802696494]“...抱歉客人，你无权询问。”"}
{"time": 1758741235, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1749449793", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“你...你..怎么这样”"}
{"time": 1758741258, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1509640910", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=136511203]她走出房间，同时关上了灯。床铺带着些温热，似乎是精心处理过，躺上去倒是刚好合适，一片静谧，四周唯有流水声。"}
{"time": 1758741296, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1044583498", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（哪种流水声）"}
{"time": 1758741354, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1758850173", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(小桥流水)"}
{"time": 1758741375, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2051744199", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(五楼的布景就是小桥流水，墙里有流水)"}
{"time": 1758741375, "type": "recv", "message_id": "177651684", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（？）"}
{"time": 1758741379, "type": "recv", "message_id": "799520866", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（好的）"}
{"time": 1758741385, "type": "recv", "message_id": "324787494", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“68号...”想要喊她，但果然自己很讨厌这种冷冰冰的感觉“好不方便，我要给你起个名字”"}
{"time": 1758741450, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1337296714", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "*盯了会天花板，听听门外的动静，再神经质地盯着窗户和漆黑的角落看了看"}
{"time": 1758741602, "type": "recv", "message_id": "689096784", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=324787494]\"客人，我没有名字。\""}
{"time": 1758741628, "type": "recv", "message_id": "969630056", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1337296714]当然不会有意料之外的客人，今夜星河静顿"}
{"time": 1758741658, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1046259151", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“...你之前没有，以后就有了”思索了一下“之后我就叫你可可了”"}
{"time": 1758741675, "type": "recv", "message_id": "869404828", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "*这才慢慢闭上眼。自私地说，希望不会做梦吧"}
{"time": 1758741705, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1381484474", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“所以可可刚刚的事情，可以忘掉吗，求求你了...”抓着她的手臂晃晃"}
{"time": 1758741787, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1587756716", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:image,file={FC10BDE2-BE62-BAC8-28EF-1477693633C9}.png,sub_type=0,url=https://gchat.qpic.cn/gchatpic_new/0/0-0-FC10BDE2BE62BAC828EF1477693633C9/0,file_size=788983]"}
{"time": 1758741787, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1447219653", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "（唉）"}
{"time": 1758741795, "type": "recv", "message_id": "788216383", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "（我长夜月专呢）"}
{"time": 1758741798, "type": "recv", "message_id": "468962470", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "（寄！）"}
{"time": 1758741809, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2107696828", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（晚安，全世界无梦）"}
{"time": 1758741821, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1050252936", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "。log off"}
{"time": 1758779842, "type": "reply", "message_id": "839332319", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": 2875548981, "name": "小雅"}, "message": "继续记录乐谱"}
{"time": 1758779858, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1764901072", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1381484474]()"}
{"time": 1758780158, "type": "recv", "message_id": "640315228", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“怎么这样...”"}
{"time": 1758780164, "type": "recv", "message_id": "704573284", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=869404828]在松软仿佛被阳光浸透的被窝里睡去，难得长夜无梦。"}
{"time": 1758780184, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1166736230", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "松开手“刚刚的事情应该算客人的隐私吧...”"}
{"time": 1758780424, "type": "recv", "message_id": "679437916", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1166736230]人偶不予回复，\"客人，如果没有事的话，请你不要打扰我。\""}
{"time": 1758780511, "type": "recv", "message_id": "187263011", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“...”感觉有些生气，但又不知道说什么好，不过忽然想起一件事“你会补衣服吗”"}
{"time": 1758780541, "type": "recv", "message_id": "88770997", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=704573284]*睡！"}
{"time": 1758780788, "type": "recv", "message_id": "832991816", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=187263011]\"客人如有破损的衣服，请交给我。\""}
{"time": 1758780883, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1113351083", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“你等一下”听到可以，感觉刚刚的不愉快瞬间烟消云散了，去把之前西莉丝姐姐送自己的衣服拿过来“拜托你了...可..68号”"}
{"time": 1758781089, "type": "recv", "message_id": "186556131", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"...\"她接过衣服端详，最后点点头。\"今天的天色已晚，客人早点休息吧。\""}
{"time": 1758781117, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1301568070", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“嗯...那晚安了”"}
{"time": 1758781154, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1229213580", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "坐到艾璃西雅身旁“艾璃西雅姐姐，你也快去洗澡吧，洗完差不多该睡了”"}
{"time": 1758781327, "type": "recv", "message_id": "154118535", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1229213580]\"嗯。\"她放下杯子，转身拿了衣服进了浴室"}
{"time": 1758781520, "type": "recv", "message_id": "890185893", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "先回房间了，躺在床上等艾璃西雅姐姐洗完澡，好软啊，毕竟劳累了一天，感觉意识快要融化了，不过还是强撑着，等艾璃西雅"}
{"time": 1758781720, "type": "recv", "message_id": "925264912", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "稍等了一会，爱璃西雅裹着浴巾走了进来，\"嗯...\""}
{"time": 1758781942, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1645064869", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"还没睡吗？\"她走到床边，拿起睡衣，\"啊...诺诺别看啊\""}
{"time": 1758782011, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1169718755", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“在等..艾璃西雅姐姐..”看到她进来，熬不住了，安心的睡了过去"}
{"time": 1758782026, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1573645690", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（年轻就是好，倒头就睡）"}
{"time": 1758782107, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1693403650", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "你迷迷糊糊间感觉到过她在你身边躺下"}
{"time": 1758782252, "type": "recv", "message_id": "164857209", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "睡!"}
{"time": 1758782426, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1461017883", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(ok)"}
{"time": 1758782431, "type": "recv", "message_id": "826076013", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "那么"}
{"time": 1758782666, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1181657258", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=88770997]伴随着清晨的阳光，你在一片松弛中醒来，似乎很久没睡过这么舒服的觉了"}
{"time": 1758782899, "type": "recv", "message_id": "389537894", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=164857209]醒来时，你发现自己被被子裹得紧紧的，一旁的爱璃西雅的被子被你抢过大半"}
{"time": 1758782927, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1882212879", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我怎么这么坏”"}
{"time": 1758782965, "type": "recv", "message_id": "406507569", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "把卷着的被子松开，盖在艾璃西雅姐姐的身上"}
{"time": 1758782977, "type": "recv", "message_id": "642422582", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1181657258]*有一种自己还在家里的错觉，睁眼支起上身，迷迷糊糊地找一下洋荷"}
{"time": 1758783215, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1720633408", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=642422582]她当然不在这，偌大的床铺上只有你一个人，房间里也没有人。"}
{"time": 1758783247, "type": "recv", "message_id": "786317398", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "让艾璃西雅姐姐多睡一会，自己先去洗漱吧"}
{"time": 1758783310, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2114200450", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“哦……忘了……”*低着头发会呆，随后一点一点挪到床边，看看能不能站起来"}
{"time": 1758783638, "type": "recv", "message_id": "212464679", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2114200450]左脚似乎有些陌生，但站起来没什么太大的问题"}
{"time": 1758783656, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1336657073", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=786317398]你起身的时候，她拽住了你的手，\"...别走...\""}
{"time": 1758783709, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1862064261", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“哎，是把我误会成了姐姐吗”坐在她身旁，摸摸她的头“不要怕哦，我不会走的...”"}
{"time": 1758783752, "type": "recv", "message_id": "65037478", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“这下两条腿都不伦不类了……算了，起码还在身上”穿上拖鞋，朝门口走去开门"}
{"time": 1758784470, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1929516097", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=65037478]诺亚坐在房间门外的沙发上，\"...早安。\""}
{"time": 1758784623, "type": "recv", "message_id": "390681370", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“早安。虽然不知道有没有后遗症，总之现在可以正常下地了”*倒两杯水，推一杯到她面前，自己喝另一杯"}
{"time": 1758784705, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1337579407", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1862064261]\"唔...\"她的眉头紧皱，\"陪着我...\""}
{"time": 1758784764, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1483612172", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“嗯嗯...我会陪着你的，不要害怕..”"}
{"time": 1758785047, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1485423746", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=390681370]\"...有好些了吗？\""}
{"time": 1758785095, "type": "recv", "message_id": "856338121", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“艾璃西雅乖哦，姐姐最喜欢你了，永远不会丢下你一个人的...”"}
{"time": 1758785310, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2072880797", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1485423746]*提起裤腿，活动一番脚踝脚趾，想了想还是不做承重的动作了“我觉得，应该？原来魔法和药物能做到这么多东西”"}
{"time": 1758785335, "type": "recv", "message_id": "206494883", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=856338121]\"嗯...\"她渐渐消停，重新睡下"}
{"time": 1758785449, "type": "recv", "message_id": "876407114", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "这种情况，感觉还是就一直待在这里陪着艾璃西雅姐姐等她醒来比较好"}
{"time": 1758785966, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1050553840", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2072880797]\"嗯...不过要是有什么后遗症，伊芙小姐要记得说，嗯，因为这种事情，本身就，很超越常识。\""}
{"time": 1758786029, "type": "recv", "message_id": "614855522", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=876407114]她紧握着你的手，\"......\""}
{"time": 1758786160, "type": "recv", "message_id": "714013828", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“我还以为你呆在玛纳利亚，常识涉及的范围会比我大些”*两条腿都多少有些问题，还是先坐下“放心，有问题我肯定会说的”"}
{"time": 1758786822, "type": "recv", "message_id": "34053867", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=714013828]\"嗯，有问题我会帮伊芙去问柯艾特的。\"她接过水杯，\"诺亚会让伊芙完完整整地回家。\""}
{"time": 1758786828, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2051021295", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（要睡着了）"}
{"time": 1758786844, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1720749128", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（睡龙）"}
{"time": 1758787202, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2028157324", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(那就睡)"}
