{"time": 1758789077, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1573620418", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "怎么会...穿好衣服坐在沙发上思考，要不去问问斑比酱吧"}
{"time": 1758789109, "type": "recv", "message_id": "595358864", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=253126990]“那也没这么早就是了……西丽丝小姐和看守所比较熟，一会总得等她的”"}
{"time": 1758789121, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2054468354", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "虽然有点害怕斑比，但不想拖大家的后腿"}
{"time": 1758789152, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1001107013", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "颤颤巍巍的移动到斑比的房间门口，犹豫许久敲了敲门"}
{"time": 1758789449, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1983607748", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=595358864]\"干嘛，你不是要讨回公道?\"她坐在沙发上，翘起腿，\"姐带你，杀过去。\""}
{"time": 1758789619, "type": "recv", "message_id": "145370670", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1001107013]门无人自开，你感觉冷冷的空气扑面而来"}
{"time": 1758789664, "type": "recv", "message_id": "952005422", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“主...主人”进门的时候小心翼翼把门带上"}
{"time": 1758789699, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1589002386", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "本身就有点害怕，现在甚至有点腿抖"}
{"time": 1758789772, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1867101813", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1983607748]“你的行事风格还真是，喜欢走极端”*耸了耸肩“急着一会也没必要吧”"}
{"time": 1758789872, "type": "recv", "message_id": "553123519", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1589002386]室内拉着厚厚的窗帘，几乎不见阳光，所幸你现在的视力在这种程度的昏暗下倒也不能算看不清。床上一对如同燃烧的火焰的眼瞳此刻正盯着你"}
{"time": 1758790007, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1090268862", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“斑...斑比大人早上好...”"}
{"time": 1758790011, "type": "recv", "message_id": "816833287", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1867101813]\"哦，我还以为你会说真性情呢。\"她撇撇脑袋，\"不过你要是想等就等吧。\"\n诺亚向你们道了一声之后开口，\"两位早餐想吃什么?\""}
{"time": 1758790309, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2136306692", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1090268862]\"...\"她的语气有些不善，\"干嘛？\""}
{"time": 1758790413, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1510170579", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=816833287]“牛奶与鸡蛋三明治吧。我可以和你一起去取？”"}
{"time": 1758790448, "type": "recv", "message_id": "130236098", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“昨..昨晚，我成功变成了蝙蝠，但不知道为什么只变了一小会..然后现在怎么尝试都不行了”有点不敢抬头看她"}
{"time": 1758790749, "type": "recv", "message_id": "106973508", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（缺血了吧(）"}
{"time": 1758791081, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2116340331", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1510170579]\"哦，我不需要。\"柯艾特打个哈欠，\"...诺亚自己过去就好。\"人偶开口婉拒，随后自顾自下楼了"}
{"time": 1758791094, "type": "recv", "message_id": "714321763", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=130236098]\"哦，和我有什么关系。\""}
{"time": 1758791114, "type": "recv", "message_id": "789982854", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"如果就因为这种事找我，下次绝不轻饶。\""}
{"time": 1758791161, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1300157923", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我..我想请教一下斑比大人..”戳手指"}
{"time": 1758791246, "type": "recv", "message_id": "447434165", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2116340331]\"真有趣...不是吗？\"柯艾特看向她离开的方向，\"这个人偶，似乎有些背离了最初的程序。\""}
{"time": 1758791276, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1299758050", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1300157923]\"都说，不要因为这种事找我。\"她带着明显的起床气，语气里已经暗含着怒气"}
{"time": 1758791349, "type": "recv", "message_id": "75822344", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“对..对不起，我这就离开...”"}
{"time": 1758791412, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1852327578", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "逃跑似的飞速离开这里，走的时候不忘把门带上"}
{"time": 1758791439, "type": "recv", "message_id": "698073526", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"哼...\"你听见她的冷哼，门关上的同时室温都回升了一些。"}
{"time": 1758791532, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1967897567", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "还有一点点后怕，继续思考原因，会不会是因为自己有点缺血？去找68号"}
{"time": 1758791549, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1002368870", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“早饭我想吃一些动物的血，可以吗...”"}
{"time": 1758791593, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1726194945", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "等你回到房间，西里斯已经坐在了桌前，穿戴地很整齐，而人偶不在。"}
{"time": 1758791630, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1279403846", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“早上好啊，西莉丝姐姐”看见她感觉好安心"}
{"time": 1758791667, "type": "recv", "message_id": "648570530", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=447434165]“确实，我是觉得变得更有趣了”*同样看着门口“说起来，万一等我们去了，发现教团已经转移了怎么办？”"}
{"time": 1758791909, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1646416146", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1279403846]\"早上好，我已经让人偶去取餐了。\"她今天穿着黑色的成套衣着，不过没有佩戴什么多余的装饰，头发梳成了干练单马尾"}
{"time": 1758791944, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2080140217", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“这样啊，西莉丝姐姐今天也好漂亮...”"}
{"time": 1758792115, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1349230155", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "坐到她的旁边"}
{"time": 1758794593, "type": "recv", "message_id": "514259142", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=648570530]\"那就，当面质问坐在那些脏东西上面的家伙，不就好了。\"她收回目光，\"说起来，人偶的事之后也要处理，你的意见是?\""}
{"time": 1758794914, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1718708611", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1349230155]\"刚刚去做什么了？\""}
{"time": 1758794975, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1263729359", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“哎”叹口气“去找斑比酱问变形的事情了，昨晚明明已经成功了，不知道为什么又不行了，结果被轰出来了”"}
{"time": 1758795354, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1021580128", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(加油翔哥)"}
{"time": 1758795361, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2085721746", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "()"}
{"time": 1758797374, "type": "recv", "message_id": "311158334", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=514259142]“处理什么？她就是个人偶”*挑眉"}
{"time": 1758799098, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1621417049", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=311158334]\"一般来说，作为主人还是希望她可以更遵守初始的条款，不是吗？\"她打着哈欠，揉碎自己的头发，\"你知道的。\""}
{"time": 1758799329, "type": "recv", "message_id": "554907077", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“她出于自己的想法救了我的命，总不能指望我对让她变得冷冰冰持反对以外的态度吧”*皱了皱眉“哪怕是龙芙小姐的意思。我也要争一争的”"}
{"time": 1758800616, "type": "recv", "message_id": "677132105", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=554907077]\"随便咯，我只是提醒你一下。\"她看上去不甚在意，\"反正，最后也是你的事情。\"她突然想起了什么，\"对了，昨天给你的糖吃了吗\""}
{"time": 1758800696, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2031542832", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“尝了点，怎么了？”*心里在想要不要追下去的事"}
{"time": 1758800786, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2118934724", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"没什么，每天吃一颗。告诉自己生活是甜的，对你有好处。\""}
{"time": 1758801057, "type": "recv", "message_id": "279056678", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "*沉默了一会，看着她开口“当然，总会是的。不过糖也总有吃完的时候吧”*晃了晃盒子"}
{"time": 1758801141, "type": "recv", "message_id": "304467040", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"这一盒够了，你还想要多少?\"她没好气地开口，\"我也没很多\""}
{"time": 1758801247, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1539607762", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“我的意思是……甜的日子也总有过完的时候。剩下的时日要么在等，要么在怀念，要么在……追逐”"}
{"time": 1758801643, "type": "recv", "message_id": "760946262", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（翔哥呢）"}
{"time": 1758802151, "type": "recv", "message_id": "608360150", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(他很忙)"}
{"time": 1758802161, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1460887441", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（？）"}
{"time": 1758804383, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1224124730", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（复活了）"}
{"time": 1758804439, "type": "recv", "message_id": "846073756", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1539607762]（那句话怎么说来着，每句话都要上价值真该改改（bushi）"}
{"time": 1758804513, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1417063203", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（16岁正是中二病的时候）"}
{"time": 1758809753, "type": "recv", "message_id": "596487717", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1539607762]\"甜蜜的回忆会给你面对接下来的追逐的力量。\"她似乎被你逗笑了，学着你的口吻，\"懂了吗？\""}
{"time": 1758809845, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2139058615", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1263729359]\"嗯...虽然有些魔族和人类有相似的思维或是感情，但和她们相处，终究还是要慎重。\""}
{"time": 1758809905, "type": "recv", "message_id": "910250930", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“不然你以为我是为了什么才到这儿来？”*歪歪脑袋看她，一副“你猜”的样子"}
{"time": 1758809971, "type": "recv", "message_id": "70150009", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"这也算字面意思。\"她稍微挑了挑眉，\"全部吃完，一天一粒。\""}
{"time": 1758810202, "type": "recv", "message_id": "412632044", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“哦”*拿出那个罐子，从里头又挑出一粒放进嘴里“谢谢，就是有点齁”"}
{"time": 1758810231, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1308541108", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2139058615][CQ:at,qq=1252219916] “嗯..西莉丝姐姐说的对”"}
{"time": 1758810270, "type": "recv", "message_id": "662411098", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "虽然早上因为斑比的事情有些心情不好，但看见西莉丝姐姐就拨开云雾，重见晴空了"}
{"time": 1758810506, "type": "recv", "message_id": "150046287", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=412632044]里面估摸着还有十来粒，\"这几天也许身上会有些黏，正常现象?也许吧。\"她勾着自己的下巴，\"就这样。\""}
{"time": 1758810549, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1080210241", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "下来就等吃早饭了"}
{"time": 1758810594, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1117441629", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=662411098]居家人偶推着早餐车进来，都是一些常见的食物，除了豆浆新鲜烘焙的面包外还有一些在这里不常见的包子。"}
{"time": 1758810708, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1863791399", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“68号酱，后厨有没有不要的动物的血液吗，可以给我吗”诚恳的看着她"}
{"time": 1758810752, "type": "recv", "message_id": "510038291", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"...客人请不要提一些无理的要求。\"她快速上完餐，一刻也不想停留"}
{"time": 1758810771, "type": "recv", "message_id": "410325756", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“emmm，花钱买也不可以吗..”"}
{"time": 1758810811, "type": "recv", "message_id": "430650954", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=150046287]“哎，你是医生还是炼金术师？”*盖上盖子“说话像医嘱”"}
{"time": 1758810971, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1604504751", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"本身也不冲突。\"，她翻了翻眼睛，向你露出个白眼\"，\"想跟我学?\""}
{"time": 1758811293, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1811890262", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“虽然这话轮不到我说……但是我再考虑考虑”*转头看向门口"}
{"time": 1758811912, "type": "recv", "message_id": "643499039", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=410325756]\"原则上可以。\"她语气带着疏远，\"不过，请不要问我，这种事请和前台商议。\""}
{"time": 1758811972, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1578364557", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1811890262]她不置可否，也没有继续说下去，过了一会，诺亚推着早餐车进了门。几乎所有种类的早餐，你曾见过的，不曾见过的，都出现在餐车上。"}
{"time": 1758812085, "type": "recv", "message_id": "486024646", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“好..好吧”感觉68好像对自己有意见"}
{"time": 1758812166, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2080695491", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1578364557]“哇哦，是不是太丰盛了些？”眼睛有点发光“嗯……矜持，吃太多会走不动路的”"}
{"time": 1758815405, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1777911493", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=486024646]“没什么的话，请客人自行安排，”"}
