{"time": 1758816030, "type": "recv", "message_id": "949885334", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（原来走错岔路口了）"}
{"time": 1758816045, "type": "recv", "message_id": "376449294", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（我说马路怎么那么远）"}
{"time": 1758816207, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2138151840", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "*既然这样，先端过一碟最经典的培根煎蛋卷。怕有些咸，又端过一小碟南瓜汤“这些是……诺亚做的？”"}
{"time": 1758816255, "type": "recv", "message_id": "456654640", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "明明桌子上的食物看起来很好吃的样子，但莫名没有什么食欲"}
{"time": 1758816292, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1978655375", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“西莉丝姐姐，我好像不是很饿”"}
{"time": 1758816391, "type": "recv", "message_id": "335703098", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2138151840]“嗯。不要小看了家居人偶。”她比了个爱心的手势，随后感觉似乎有些 不太合适，“嗯，味道如何..”"}
{"time": 1758816472, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1355515328", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（怎么态度相差这么大（）"}
{"time": 1758816542, "type": "recv", "message_id": "661054529", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1978655375]“不行，今天得多吃一点。”她拿起桌上的面包抹上果酱"}
{"time": 1758816559, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2123828714", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "递到你面前，“今天还有要做的事吧？”"}
{"time": 1758816857, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2095732095", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“嗯...谢谢西莉丝姐姐”接过面包，感觉西莉丝姐姐递过来的东西还是比较有食欲的"}
{"time": 1758816966, "type": "recv", "message_id": "155122043", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2095732095]“吃完饭我们就下楼等她们。”"}
{"time": 1758816979, "type": "recv", "message_id": "448695691", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=335703098]“真不错，厉害到我都想夺人所爱了”*点点头，小口吃起来，发出满意的哼哼声"}
{"time": 1758817006, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1702195264", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“嗯...”努力让自己多吃一点"}
{"time": 1758817937, "type": "recv", "message_id": "792109567", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=448695691]\"夺人所爱？”她似乎没理解这句话的意思，“呃...”"}
{"time": 1758818184, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1931785352", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "柯艾特在旁边笑了笑，“没什么，只是在夸诺亚做菜很好吃啦。”"}
{"time": 1758818358, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1101242749", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1702195264]（吃完了说一声）"}
{"time": 1758818420, "type": "recv", "message_id": "617262226", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "偷偷在手上划一道伤口，让血渗进面包里，感觉稍微好吃了不少...."}
{"time": 1758818461, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1253149834", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "如法炮制，虽然有点虚弱，但还是吃饱了“我吃饱了，西莉丝姐姐”"}
{"time": 1758818466, "type": "recv", "message_id": "497679419", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“没什么，只是在想人偶算不算非卖品的事”"}
{"time": 1758819021, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1337298877", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "（你自己喝自己的血是什么套路）"}
{"time": 1758819406, "type": "recv", "message_id": "672595761", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1253149834]“哦...”她眯起眼睛，仔细看了看，“诺诺是不是很想要血？”"}
{"time": 1758819453, "type": "recv", "message_id": "353025022", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=497679419]“这种事情，你得去问人偶的主人咯。”柯艾特打趣，诺亚则是有些惊讶，“我？呃...我不能离开酒店啦...”"}
{"time": 1758819512, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2018137630", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“嗯...昨天之后，我就感觉渴求血....等下西莉丝姐姐帮我问问酒店前台吧. 有没有动物的血可以给我..”"}
{"time": 1758819544, "type": "recv", "message_id": "12962324", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“也许补充血之后...我就又可以变身了”"}
{"time": 1758819604, "type": "recv", "message_id": "927780611", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=12962324]“...动物的血也可以吗？” 她叹口气，放下手里的早餐，“不行的话，吸一点我的血吧..”"}
{"time": 1758819673, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1376813482", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“都是血，应该可以吧...没事，西莉丝姐姐..我一点都不想吸你的血”不争气的咽了咽口水"}
{"time": 1758819680, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1348505251", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=353025022]“之后再说吧，吃饭吃饭”"}
{"time": 1758820067, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1094194556", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1348505251]*擦掉嘴角最后一点残余的酱汁，桌上还剩不少“嘛……作为正餐来说都绰绰有余。余下的只能中午回来再继续想办法咯”"}
{"time": 1758820091, "type": "recv", "message_id": "298295916", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（话说艾璃西雅不吃饭吗）"}
{"time": 1758820134, "type": "recv", "message_id": "833860954", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“西莉丝姐姐你快帮我去问问吧，我去叫艾璃西雅姐姐起床吃饭”急忙转移话题，害怕自己真的忍不住吸了西莉丝姐姐的血"}
{"time": 1758821076, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1819257556", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1094194556] “嗯...祝两位能顺利归来，我会为各位做好午餐。”诺亚轻点头，向你们鞠了一躬"}
{"time": 1758821112, "type": "recv", "message_id": "630398147", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=833860954]“好啦...”她掩面笑了笑，“看你的嘴角，这不是完全忍不住了吗？”她伸出手，挽起袖子，“想要吗？”"}
{"time": 1758821151, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1485488939", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（怎么不抽我的（）"}
{"time": 1758821283, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1773100457", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "真的可以吗，会不会伤害到西莉丝姐姐，但正是因为是西莉丝姐姐，好想尝尝啊，喜欢的人的血是什么味道的，好想知道..“..嗯”最终还是诚实的点了点头“真的可..可以吗”双手捧起她的胳膊"}
{"time": 1758821803, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1921251712", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“只是一点点的话，只能解馋用，知道吗？”她的另一只手抵在你的额头，“我说停就要停。”"}
{"time": 1758821869, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1271901709", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1819257556]整理了一下衣服，但其实柯艾特根本没换衣服的款式，“走吧，今天你说揍谁，我替你揍谁。”"}
{"time": 1758821918, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1790433913", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“嗯...我只吸一点点..”嘴慢慢靠近西莉丝姐姐的胳膊..好软好白..先轻轻的吻一下“我会很轻很轻的...”"}
{"time": 1758822000, "type": "recv", "message_id": "328507020", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "吸血应该怎么做呢，稍微有点手足无措"}
{"time": 1758822198, "type": "recv", "message_id": "431929463", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1271901709]“这么好心？好啊，总之我们先下去吧”"}
{"time": 1758822228, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1386097190", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "轻轻的咬破一个小口，慢慢品味西莉丝姐姐的血"}
{"time": 1758822381, "type": "recv", "message_id": "896960797", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "（这种描述你可以自己来，毕竟血）"}
{"time": 1758822385, "type": "recv", "message_id": "631223460", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "当品尝到血的味道的时候，感觉浑身好像震了一下一样，从来没有品尝过这么美味的东西，同时鼻尖还能闻到西莉丝姐姐身上淡淡的香味..好幸福，小口小口的品味"}
{"time": 1758822391, "type": "recv", "message_id": "42883870", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=896960797]（在打字）"}
{"time": 1758822442, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1867681477", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=431929463]她戴上一直挂在腰间的面具，狼形的面具，蓝色的护目镜平添一股肃杀的感觉，“那么，我来为你开路。”"}
