{"time": 1758824685, "type": "recv", "message_id": "911225131", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"不清楚，她最近一直神经兮兮的。\"西里斯摇摇头，\"那就一起吧，这件事宾森特必须给我们一个解释才行。\""}
{"time": 1758824761, "type": "recv", "message_id": "545945213", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“嗯。西里斯小姐觉得其中会有多少……‘隐秘的理由’？”"}
{"time": 1758824853, "type": "recv", "message_id": "396419499", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "找一顶鸭舌帽戴在头顶，把小翅膀盖在里面“好像只能这样了..”然后站在西莉丝姐姐身旁"}
{"time": 1758824859, "type": "recv", "message_id": "134873604", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"伊芙小姐也能看出来吧，那...和血裔显然脱不了干系。\"她闭上眼，\"事实上，也确实是。\""}
{"time": 1758825037, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1887724343", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“……最后的样子倒是一样的狼狈”*摇摇头“希望西里斯小姐的公信力够用……走吧”"}
{"time": 1758825131, "type": "recv", "message_id": "738336271", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“在现在，我也不确定管不管用咯？”她的目光落到你身后，“不行的话，也有第二方案吧？对吗。”"}
{"time": 1758825194, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1453493375", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“嗯，我认为还算可靠”*点点头，就转身准备出发"}
{"time": 1758825244, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1991418653", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "带好两把剑，在确认一下自己身上看不出来其他魔族特征"}
