{"time": 1758953570, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1263901640", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1107968083]被遮住的地方倒是好了一些，不过长期曝晒在阳光之下，始终会有影响"}
{"time": 1758953778, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1078986870", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "带把伞，帽子也带着“这样应该没事了..西莉丝姐姐”"}
