{"time": 1759049739, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2034522797", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“西莉丝姐姐去吗..西莉丝姐姐去的话我就去”"}
{"time": 1759049939, "type": "recv", "message_id": "813643654", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"既然来了...不过...\"她看向伊芙，\"我们可以在上面等吗？也算帮你照看一下后路。\""}
{"time": 1759050140, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2058983387", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“……随你”*摇了摇头“但是不下去我们就进不了收敛办事厅”"}
{"time": 1759050210, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1359653101", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"你确信下面连着那个地方?\"西里斯紧握着诺维拉的手，你甚至感觉她有些过于用力，以至于你有些手疼"}
{"time": 1759050259, "type": "recv", "message_id": "888255320", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“不，但是能开门的人在这下面。无罪之人。”"}
