{"time": 1759078151, "type": "recv", "message_id": "443167154", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "不太懂发生了什么，但先看着了"}
{"time": 1759078309, "type": "recv", "message_id": "972508768", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（骗你的，我在没有炉子的情况下是字面意义上的什么都做不到（）"}
{"time": 1759078344, "type": "recv", "message_id": "635021252", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“那丝线不能直接用剑砍吗”提问"}
{"time": 1759078346, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1772151107", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"这只是普通的网啦，就算强度高上那么一点，也不是拖你们入梦的捕网。\"她瞥了一眼伊芙，\"话说，另外两个人只是看着吗？\"又看向诺维拉"}
{"time": 1759078387, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1375054446", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“可以的话，让我试试，如果伊芙小姐可以让我吸口血的话，成功概率也许也会变大”"}
{"time": 1759078494, "type": "recv", "message_id": "546851029", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“喔，行啊，等价交换，你能给我什么？”"}
{"time": 1759078514, "type": "recv", "message_id": "692965938", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我能帮你砍开网呗”"}
{"time": 1759078551, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1252828409", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“怎么，你不需要下去？”"}
{"time": 1759078563, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1041441605", "deleted": true, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“这网是给你一个人开的么？”"}
{"time": 1759078598, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1549181293", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“这网是给我一个人开的么？”"}
{"time": 1759078635, "type": "recv", "message_id": "61745323", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“emmm，毕竟很累”拔出火剑，先砍一下试试"}
{"time": 1759078647, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1325549360", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（要过剑吗，话说）"}
