{"time": 1759078938, "type": "recv", "message_id": "10535308", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "剑身深深烙进虚空中，你隐约可见白色的丝线。"}
{"time": 1759078974, "type": "recv", "message_id": "909718077", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"...被什么隐藏起来了?\"西里斯低头仔细看了一下，\"确实是丝线...只是，不确定是不是蛛丝...\""}
{"time": 1759078981, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1505595366", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "试图将丝线也一同砍开"}
{"time": 1759079276, "type": "recv", "message_id": "536706373", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "剑身被卡在丝线之中，你有些动不了剑"}
{"time": 1759079385, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1508044969", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“啧...”左手拔出阐释者在右臂砍一刀，控制流出的鲜血赋予火剑之上，继续用力去砍断"}
{"time": 1759079545, "type": "recv", "message_id": "809424000", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "你的动作被西里斯拦下，\"别那么拼命。\"她皱着眉看着戴着面具的柯艾特，\"小姐应该有别的办法吧？\""}
{"time": 1759079627, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1135350701", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“好吧..”算了，如果出事的话，这些血用来带西莉丝姐姐逃跑好像更值得一些..."}
{"time": 1759080504, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1828208349", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1135350701]\"诶，可是看她砍很有意思诶。\"柯艾特面具下的声音带着些调侃，\"算了，小姑娘，从我的风衣口袋里，拿出一管蓝色的试剂\""}
{"time": 1759080571, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1945343238", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“哎？我吗..好的，谢谢姐姐”左手把剑放回去 伸过去找试剂"}
{"time": 1759080952, "type": "recv", "message_id": "351293676", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "她的口袋里东西不少，都是些码好的瓶瓶罐罐，你看见了天蓝色，偏紫蓝色和深蓝色的试管"}
{"time": 1759080984, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1480553262", "deleted": true, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“三种蓝色的都可以吗，”"}
{"time": 1759080989, "type": "recv", "message_id": "359052313", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“三种蓝色的都可以吗，姐姐”"}
{"time": 1759081042, "type": "recv", "message_id": "15258443", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"...\"她的面具朝向你，沉默了一会，拿出了天蓝色的那管塞进你怀里，\"喝。\""}
{"time": 1759081087, "type": "recv", "message_id": "606669842", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“oh”应该也许大概不会出什么事吧，咬开瓶塞，然后喝下去"}
{"time": 1759081108, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1399917710", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(真喝?)"}
{"time": 1759081125, "type": "recv", "message_id": "349324022", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（？）"}
{"time": 1759081141, "type": "recv", "message_id": "622022758", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "喝之前先看眼西莉丝姐姐"}
{"time": 1759081197, "type": "recv", "message_id": "800724648", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "她对你摇摇头，试管里的试剂散发着薰衣草的香气。"}
{"time": 1759081221, "type": "recv", "message_id": "365479878", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“呃..这个真的可以喝吗”"}
{"time": 1759081284, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1159290808", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"可以啊，只要你不怕五脏六腑被烧成灰。\""}
