{"time": 1759125679, "type": "recv", "message_id": "803163283", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“那伊芙小姐再试试吧..”把剑收回去，站到西莉斯姐姐身边"}
