{"time": 1759125912, "type": "reply", "message_id": "695836922", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": 2875548981, "name": "小雅"}, "message": "[伊芙]演奏出: 1D20+1={7}+1=8"}
{"time": 1759125940, "type": "recv", "message_id": "951387535", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"这可真是...坚韧啊？\"柯艾特的声音染上了一些愉快，\"火属性的戒指是不是被你扔了?\""}
{"time": 1759125985, "type": "recv", "message_id": "207300751", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“这不是有个自己能点火但是不肯点的？火本来就不适合我”"}
{"time": 1759126108, "type": "recv", "message_id": "718802183", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"谁?\"柯艾特看向诺维拉，\"小姑娘，是你吗？\""}
{"time": 1759126141, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1710569329", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“额....我已经不会点火了”"}
{"time": 1759126408, "type": "recv", "message_id": "852990366", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“那个能力是我找别人借的，以及被....emmm..收回去了”"}
{"time": 1759126533, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1794828058", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"不是你自己的?\"她的面具对着伊芙，\"那你怕成那样?\""}
{"time": 1759126928, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2036506567", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“？”"}
{"time": 1759126951, "type": "recv", "message_id": "479310156", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“我怎么知道，而且不是自己的就不能杀人吗？”"}
{"time": 1759127224, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1898315056", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"算了。\"她扭回头，\"等溶解剂生效还要一会，你是不是该说一下，什么无罪之人?\""}
{"time": 1759127364, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1638724112", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“安息教的……我猜不是普通成员。”简单解释“叫妃花，与刚刚看到的那些不一样，她期望的路子是全世界人与人为善。”"}
{"time": 1759127403, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1626683604", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“……然后被他们的头头发现了，现在被控制着”"}
{"time": 1759127472, "type": "recv", "message_id": "732153506", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(翔哥一声不吭吗？)"}
{"time": 1759127479, "type": "recv", "message_id": "854437843", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“emmm，听起来那个姐姐是个很善良的人啊...我会帮忙的”"}
{"time": 1759127485, "type": "recv", "message_id": "144842212", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（我在打字）"}
{"time": 1759127519, "type": "recv", "message_id": "461261437", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“善良的人不应该是这种下场”"}
{"time": 1759127612, "type": "recv", "message_id": "649093349", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"之前帮我们打开门的，就是她?\"西里斯走上前补充，\"那个时候的气息，只逗留了一下下。\""}
{"time": 1759127645, "type": "recv", "message_id": "905858308", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“趁现在还没不可挽回”*皱眉“但是我记得她被发现和你也脱不了关系。在哪哈特那里到底发生了什么？”"}
{"time": 1759127685, "type": "recv", "message_id": "149260905", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我....我吗，我只是使用了一直以来隐藏的力量就是了....”"}
{"time": 1759127810, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1388223180", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=649093349]“是，她和我……签了约定，能彼此借用身体”"}
{"time": 1759127857, "type": "recv", "message_id": "445772628", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"我们被对方拦下来了。\"西里斯稍微帮诺维拉挡住了一点视线，\"我的失误，没有力量在暴力的地盘确实是砧板上的鱼肉，但我没想到连基础的地位都没有。\""}
{"time": 1759127867, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1151463578", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "关于里榭娜姐姐的事情还是稍微隐瞒一下吧，这种事情说了也没什么用，只会让本就脆弱的同盟更加失衡"}
{"time": 1759128361, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1761938991", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“没关系，西莉斯姐姐，不要自责了，这不是你的错，错的都是娜哈特”重新牵起她的手，十指相扣"}
{"time": 1759128692, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1513968409", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（）[CQ:at,qq=1252219916]"}
{"time": 1759128694, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1037344189", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“妃花当时在看你们。后来就被波及了”*皱眉“……她的愿望要是没那么大就好了”"}
{"time": 1759128721, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1810227528", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(我在思考一件事)"}
