{"time": 1759129395, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1900959807", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(差不多吧)"}
{"time": 1759129514, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1993125581", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1761938991]她的手被你牵起，你倒是很轻松滑进她的指缝，“唉...”她微微摇摇头，“要保持一些警戒啦...”语气颇无奈"}
{"time": 1759129599, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1469898564", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“嗯...我会的，西莉斯姐姐”然后看向伊芙“妃花小姐没有错，错的是不承认妃花梦想的人...”"}
{"time": 1759129600, "type": "recv", "message_id": "496450170", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1037344189]柯艾特站起身伸展了一下四肢，“身处灾杰祸乱的中心，她那种身份不被波及是不可能的。为什么她会在那啦”"}
{"time": 1759129624, "type": "recv", "message_id": "882702346", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（hhh,修玛吉亚没有错，错的是不承认修玛吉亚梦想的人（笑了））"}
{"time": 1759129715, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1032677468", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1469898564]“……她的梦想我不做评价，但是诞生这个梦想本身就是错误。那不可能实现，你不明白吗？”"}
{"time": 1759129729, "type": "recv", "message_id": "295341159", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=882702346]（？）"}
{"time": 1759129737, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1165087378", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "（那你的有咩呢）"}
{"time": 1759129762, "type": "recv", "message_id": "257290812", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（我的有咩是保护大家的有咩）"}
{"time": 1759129788, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1102658648", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "（你不是小社长，怎么变巧爷了）"}
{"time": 1759129810, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1061045079", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（他不是要保护修玛吉亚的有咩么）"}
{"time": 1759129811, "type": "recv", "message_id": "878665590", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“至于她……我当时希望她能帮帮西里斯，她本来和我说不会有负担的”*看着自己的手“……她应该不会骗我才对”"}
{"time": 1759130012, "type": "recv", "message_id": "429688664", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“梦想这种东西，只要朝着那个方向一直前进就好了...”摇摇头“我会尽自己的全力去救出她的..”"}
{"time": 1759130147, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1445808199", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"哦，可能本来确实是那样吧。\"柯艾特又拿出一管淡红色的试剂，\"只是出现了变数，是谁呢？好难猜啊\""}
{"time": 1759130307, "type": "recv", "message_id": "482451333", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:image,file=2FC307E0E63951141CA8527750DA26BA.png,sub_type=0,url=https://multimedia.nt.qq.com.cn/download?appid=1407&amp;fileid=EhTgquyhcDCaznYbM7OkATnF2kLvYBiQGiD_Cijs4JWIt_2PAzIEcHJvZFCAvaMBWhB7Ial8PU3CBtC0ONPK6PdVegJW4oIBAm5q&amp;rkey=CAQSMMOsFVh1UpPIBhX-icKI68GFhvtI9KW0ms12c0TwvrP1yLEDCKXY9euNDXFnY1iNDg,file_size=3344]（原来是有伏笔的（bushi）,成神吧，芙蕾雅）"}
{"time": 1759130318, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1092144220", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（梦里的事）"}
{"time": 1759130326, "type": "recv", "message_id": "235699123", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（可以不实锤的）"}
{"time": 1759130340, "type": "recv", "message_id": "364395960", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（无所谓，我是想让芙蕾雅成神的）"}
{"time": 1759130381, "type": "recv", "message_id": "489726265", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1445808199]“……”*转过头盯向诺薇拉“你肯定还知道别的吧。西丽丝和妃花昏迷后，到底发生了什么？”"}
{"time": 1759130427, "type": "recv", "message_id": "453970449", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=364395960]（成吧.jpg）"}
{"time": 1759130442, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1189348314", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（但是一棒直接成神是不是太快了）"}
{"time": 1759130451, "type": "recv", "message_id": "178844727", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我已经说了好多遍了吧，我使用了之前一直隐藏的力量.....如果不是迫不得已，我也不想这样”"}
{"time": 1759130460, "type": "recv", "message_id": "603536804", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（上一级其实没涨多少kd，十个人都没杀到）"}
{"time": 1759130471, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1439676119", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（hh,因为成神是我本来的想法，要完结了么）"}
{"time": 1759130482, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1078647669", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（但是一想到不让我完结，就有点难受（）"}
{"time": 1759130489, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2001980727", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“隐藏的力量是什么？和别的灾杰有关？”"}
{"time": 1759130602, "type": "recv", "message_id": "626919670", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“就是我的魔族血脉啊....我是人魔混血，之前一直在假装自己是个单纯的人类，后面为了救西莉斯姐姐，我放弃了伪装，获得了自己应有的力量...至于其他的我也记不清楚了，好像迷迷糊糊中有人说要借给我力量，但具体的我也不是很清楚”"}
{"time": 1759130727, "type": "recv", "message_id": "763570854", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"记不清...\"西里斯握着你的手微微用力，\"这种时候?还是那种时候。\""}
{"time": 1759130735, "type": "recv", "message_id": "198685665", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“哦，听起来反倒不需要我动手干掉你了。”"}
{"time": 1759130814, "type": "recv", "message_id": "102856225", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“你想通知圣教庭来抓我?这是出去之后的事情吧”"}
{"time": 1759130857, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1512392805", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“不需要，我已经什么都不用做了”"}
{"time": 1759130919, "type": "recv", "message_id": "650811431", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“不如你趁现在多出点力，说不定有人愿意为你辩护呢？”"}
{"time": 1759131044, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1729655336", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“不用你说，我也不会袖手旁观的...”"}
{"time": 1759131064, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1238705610", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=763570854]她伸出手，手指搭在你的脖子上的圈痕，不过最终没继续说什么。"}
{"time": 1759131064, "type": "recv", "message_id": "18603719", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=763570854][CQ:at,qq=1252219916] “什么意思？”"}
{"time": 1759131085, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2059992816", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“这个...之后再说吧”在西莉斯耳边小声的说到"}
{"time": 1759131103, "type": "recv", "message_id": "180680196", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=18603719]（意思是你真不记得还是装不记得吧）"}
{"time": 1759131133, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1050355535", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2059992816]“有点痛，西莉斯姐姐别摸了...”"}
{"time": 1759131212, "type": "recv", "message_id": "730965977", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"真不知道，这个决定是不是对的。\"她的声音里带着些苦恼。\n\"好啦，我想愉快的闲聊时间该到此结束了。\"柯艾特拍拍手"}
{"time": 1759131251, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1366867431", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"谁来做收尾工作?\"她摇晃着手里的红色试剂，\"这可是现世报哦?\""}
{"time": 1759131299, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1385185464", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“？”有些迷惑的看着她"}
{"time": 1759131322, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1904306519", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“我来。”*伸手接过红色试剂"}
{"time": 1759131376, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1880619334", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“果然有的事情还是要亲手做吧。”*拔开塞子，准备倾倒"}
{"time": 1759131710, "type": "recv", "message_id": "216418740", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "和以往的试剂不同，打开塞子，一股辛辣的味道立刻刺激了你们每一个人的鼻腔，尤其是离得最近的伊芙，几乎感觉喉咙里有火在烧"}
{"time": 1759131792, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1810981291", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“不错，够劲才行啊~”*屏住呼吸，把液体均匀倾倒在丝线上"}
{"time": 1759132498, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1148215344", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（别崩坏三了）"}
