{"time": 1759135636, "type": "recv", "message_id": "610450332", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "蓝火几乎遍布了开裂的监牢地面，\"真是夸张\""}
{"time": 1759135651, "type": "recv", "message_id": "950959255", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“会不会烧到妃花姐姐..”有些担忧"}
{"time": 1759135702, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1648087432", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“顺藤摸瓜，顺线找人……至少她和我说过她在玛纳利亚，而这是线最多的地方”"}
{"time": 1759135723, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2102805598", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2023373252]\"没什么...\"她的眼中映着火光，\"毕竟这是我的责任。\""}
{"time": 1759135985, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1564040757", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“虽然本来这事不归我管，但是他们要处理灾杰，我要报仇，反正没人会想留着这堆线”"}
{"time": 1759136937, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1794067959", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"哦～万一烧到了你那个相好，怎么办?\"柯艾特带着调侃"}
{"time": 1759137505, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1522005776", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（原来是我动）"}
