{"time": 1759137845, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1130225809", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“我会想办法让他付医药费的”"}
{"time": 1759138275, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1454653287", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"在这种火势下，被烧到只是医药费的事吗？\"她掂量着空试管，若有所思"}
{"time": 1759138419, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2044049612", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“……你说得对”*驱动水元素指环，生成液体先把自己包在水球里“那我先跳”"}
