{"time": 1759139765, "type": "recv", "message_id": "184150021", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“反正我没打算干看着”"}
{"time": 1759139793, "type": "recv", "message_id": "489198823", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "*使使劲，虽然好像已经用了不少魔力了"}
{"time": 1759141137, "type": "recv", "message_id": "978206025", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"这种情况，万一她不在下面呢?\"西里斯跟着开口，\"伊芙小姐，这样下去是不行的。\""}
{"time": 1759141425, "type": "recv", "message_id": "676137397", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“……那还有别的办法吗？我早就不剩什么手段了”"}
