{"time": 1759143410, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1860010429", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“好..我很快就回来”"}
{"time": 1759143441, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1679526554", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "你看到她勾出笑容，“这样么，也行吧。”她重新戴上面具，“我原本想激一下你呢，毕竟，我有些感兴趣。”她把手里的试管随手一扔，砸在力场墙上碎成一片片，随后从腰间抽出一支针剂，“过来。”"}
{"time": 1759143450, "type": "recv", "message_id": "222119059", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "（不是橘色吗）"}
