{"time": 1759144306, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1573548673", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“她比我神秘多了，你又不亏”"}
{"time": 1759144325, "type": "recv", "message_id": "203859171", "deleted": true, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“直接喝下去吗..”感觉有点没底，比跳火坑还害怕"}
