{"time": 1759144694, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1978915275", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“那你直接跳？”她手里转着针剂，“等死？”"}
{"time": 1759144752, "type": "recv", "message_id": "476908828", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“应该不会死吧....不过如果能帮我少受一点伤的话，那就来吧”伸出手臂，闭着眼睛有点不敢看"}
{"time": 1759144979, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2069548276", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "她拿住你的手臂，你感觉到冰凉的触感抵在你的皮肤上"}
{"time": 1759145077, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1730710503", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "虽然已经经历过许多更疼的事情，但对打针还是有种莫名的恐惧，有些紧张"}
