{"time": 1759156305, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1802737487", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“……我还挺忙的。现在身体里住了两个人，拜过两个师母，认过一个君王，还答应了一个人要学琴……”*掰着手指头算"}
{"time": 1759156314, "type": "recv", "message_id": "317737819", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“收我做徒，你认真的？”"}
