{"time": 1759156850, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1113772000", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1713259336]\"我的世界也有限，仅在马纳利亚的日子。和陛下的时长是一样的。\""}
{"time": 1759156878, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1273961966", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1665890999]她其实不太安心，握住你的手臂，\"...诺诺?真的要下去吗\""}
{"time": 1759156926, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1238211971", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“没事的，西莉丝姐姐，这点火对我来说不算什么的...放心好了”"}
