{"time": 1759157400, "type": "recv", "message_id": "817039829", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=597416865]\"...这种事，好吧。\"她最后点了头。"}
{"time": 1759157560, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1013443085", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2084871165]\"随你的便。\"你们看着诺薇拉钻进了裂隙，\"我只是觉得，像你这么弱，不掌握点什么，下次再被人卸腿卸胳膊?\""}
