{"time": 1759176348, "type": "recv", "message_id": "536903975", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "似乎，还不够?你的血翼轰击在丝线上的同时，另一段隐约传来了你此前未曾看过的金芒，覆盖在丝线之上"}
{"time": 1759176387, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1274936104", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "那是什么...可恶"}
