{"time": 1759176631, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2056625129", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "似乎并不是质的问题，血液本身就做不到这种事?这么想着的你"}
{"time": 1759176738, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1068181409", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "可是事到如今，自己还有其他的办法吗....现在转身离去的话，等再回来茧里的人应该会死吧..."}
{"time": 1759176926, "type": "recv", "message_id": "686750191", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "会有人能在这里帮到你吗？"}
{"time": 1759176936, "type": "recv", "message_id": "644740529", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（会有吗（）"}
{"time": 1759176939, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1249126512", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "孤身一人，和她们隔着大火"}
{"time": 1759177006, "type": "recv", "message_id": "963153713", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "稍微止一下血，深呼一口气...不能慌，先调查一下吧，看看丝线来源"}
{"time": 1759177081, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1407477298", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "流出了一地的血，染红了丝线的同时，也泼洒了一地的幽光"}
{"time": 1759177202, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1556519552", "deleted": true, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "为什么..会有光，明明这么深的地方，寻找一下光源"}
{"time": 1759177249, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1036582800", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（思考ing）"}
{"time": 1759177270, "type": "recv", "message_id": "831577106", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "流在地上的血不要浪费，稍微回收一下"}
{"time": 1759177329, "type": "recv", "message_id": "71293945", "deleted": true, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "为什么蛛网上会有苔藓..已经存在很长时间了吗"}
{"time": 1759177490, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1585963748", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "你凑近了一些，那与其说是自然生长的苔藓，不如说是人为添加的照明"}
{"time": 1759177539, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1121758877", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "之前丝线砍不断是因为那金色的光芒，如果用血彻底浸染丝线的话，会不会有用...."}
{"time": 1759177773, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1367236252", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "找一根丝线尝试一下，将血浸入丝线，随后看看能不能通过控制血来移动丝线..但很快便放弃了这个想法，就算可以，浸满这么多丝线的血也不是目前自己可以付出的.."}
{"time": 1759177818, "type": "recv", "message_id": "149023848", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "显然血液浸染不了如此之多的丝线"}
{"time": 1759177919, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1485195238", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "大家都离我好远..没有人能帮到我，只能靠自己了...不对，好像还有一个人，我现在的血都是是斑比酱的，也许通过血液，我可以获取到她的帮助..."}
{"time": 1759177967, "type": "recv", "message_id": "809144058", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“斑比酱？斑比大人？主人”呼喊着斑比的名字，希望能得到回应"}
{"time": 1759178064, "type": "recv", "message_id": "589212203", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "灵感一下"}
{"time": 1759178083, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1986043640", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": ".rd+1 灵感"}
{"time": 1759178083, "type": "reply", "message_id": "1986043640", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": 2875548981, "name": "小雅"}, "message": "[诺薇拉]使用[灵感]演奏出:[1D20+1={8}+1=9]"}
{"time": 1759178159, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1154763441", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "你体内的血液属于她的话，或许可以通过与血液的交互?"}
{"time": 1759178371, "type": "recv", "message_id": "677503636", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "去触碰血液，感受血液中斑比的气息，希望心中的想法能通过血液传递给她"}
{"time": 1759178392, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1703209187", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "于此时，你想"}
{"time": 1759178421, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1577801121", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（帮帮我，斑比小姐（bushi）"}
{"time": 1759178479, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1353766855", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“帮帮我斩断丝线吧，斑比酱，斑比大人，主人”不知道斑比喜欢听哪个，只能一股脑的全喊出来了"}
{"time": 1759178566, "type": "recv", "message_id": "663709493", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"胡乱叫嚷，成何体统。\"血液在你面前汇聚成人形，那本就是她的东西，金发赤瞳的女孩出现在你面前，\"你是我的眷属，怎弄出如此痴态\""}
{"time": 1759178626, "type": "recv", "message_id": "689054257", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“对..对不起,斑比酱”"}
{"time": 1759178653, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1994629603", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "看到斑比酱感觉好开心...有一种很安心的感觉"}
{"time": 1759178689, "type": "recv", "message_id": "335079435", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"所以，你要干嘛？\"她抬头打量四周，微皱眉，\"巢穴?怎么在这种地方\""}
{"time": 1759178691, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1815018833", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "有种上前抱住她的冲动,不过感觉这样做下场可能会很惨..还是算了"}
{"time": 1759178774, "type": "recv", "message_id": "796873987", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“有一个对我们很重要的大姐姐被抓了，我想把她救出来...但她被丝线捆了起来，凭我的力量砍不断这些，希望斑比酱可以帮帮我...”"}
{"time": 1759178892, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1133878584", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "她抬头打量了一眼茧，\"哦，这个啊。\"她对你招手，\"那，先趴下吧。\""}
{"time": 1759179005, "type": "recv", "message_id": "450552335", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“哎？”不太懂她什么意思，但还是先照做了，毕竟斑比酱的命令是不可以违抗的，随后趴倒在地上，微微抬头欣赏斑比的英姿"}
{"time": 1759179053, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1148441857", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "她径直坐到你背上，\"请求我?你想好要为我做什么吗？\""}
{"time": 1759179152, "type": "recv", "message_id": "115173681", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "斑比坐在身上，不知道为什么没有感觉到被羞辱，反而有种很荣幸的感觉“帮斑比酱收集血液？”"}
{"time": 1759179263, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1632058874", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"哦?那你能为我收集到什么？\"她此刻的眼眸没有早上时的凶戾，带着些好奇，\"说清楚的话我会考虑的哦\""}
{"time": 1759179436, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1239469246", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“龙裔的血怎么样...虽然好像有一点点毒性，但对斑比酱来说应该不是什么大问题吧....”"}
{"time": 1759179605, "type": "recv", "message_id": "68489315", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"不够纯正的话，喝起来会很奇怪。\"她的手搭在你是头发上，\"不过勉强算你合格。\""}
{"time": 1759179690, "type": "recv", "message_id": "411026640", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“下次见到里榭娜姐姐的话...我也可以尝试要一点点她的血”一想到里榭娜，脸颊就有点微微泛红，想到了上次离别的那个吻，里榭娜姐姐的血会是什么味道的呢..思绪忍不住飘飞了"}
{"time": 1759179725, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1944410508", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "她重重拍了一下你走神的脑袋，\"难道你想用我的血?要是想要的话，就自己动手。\"紧接着跟着一句嘀咕，\"好像本来就是我的血?\""}
{"time": 1759179868, "type": "recv", "message_id": "314884602", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“哎，可以吗？会不会有些僭越”居然还有意外之喜吗"}
{"time": 1759180057, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1156506041", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"你也知道?\"她扯着你的脸颊，很是用力，\"用你的，快点。\""}
{"time": 1759180135, "type": "recv", "message_id": "403455170", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“对..对不起，斑比酱可以先起来吗，你坐在我身上我有点不太方便放血....”"}
{"time": 1759180320, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1073224728", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "她啧了一声，伸出手，指尖划破你的脖子，精准地从两道环中间穿过，形成了竖着的疤痕，血液飞溅而出"}
{"time": 1759180381, "type": "recv", "message_id": "702083318", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“好痛.....”平常的伤口倒也没什么，但一碰到那两道印记便感觉难以忍受"}
{"time": 1759180581, "type": "recv", "message_id": "930944092", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"自己捂住。\"血液在她手中汇聚成长矛，\"只是一个茧，你还真是没用。\""}
{"time": 1759180740, "type": "recv", "message_id": "312839506", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"说吧，直接打破?还是单纯剪下来\""}
{"time": 1759180742, "type": "recv", "message_id": "387922337", "deleted": true, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "一只手撑着地，另一只手捂着脖子止血..“是斑比酱太厉害了，对了，斑比酱也是灾杰吗”"}
{"time": 1759180794, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1923191839", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "一只手撑着地，另一只手捂着脖子止血..“是斑比酱太厉害了，能打破的话还是打破最好，不过希望不会伤到茧里的那个姐姐”"}
{"time": 1759180940, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1308186586", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "血矛朝着茧直直地飞去，不偏不倚直指着心脏，你听到让人牙酸的碎裂声，一片...两片，茧在你面前完全崩落，里面的女孩轻轻掉在地上。"}
{"time": 1759180981, "type": "recv", "message_id": "298982947", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“太厉害了斑比酱..不愧是您，对了，斑比酱也是灾杰吗”"}
{"time": 1759181098, "type": "recv", "message_id": "43448558", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "她的指甲搭在你的伤口上轻轻敲击，似乎有些不悦，\"斑比酱是庭院的主人，灾杰?\""}
{"time": 1759181134, "type": "recv", "message_id": "800325664", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“对不起，对不起...斑比酱饶了我吧”"}
{"time": 1759181309, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1954758132", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"承诺给我的血，什么时候送来?\"她的指甲抵在皮肤上，尽管在身高上，倒是和你差不多?"}
{"time": 1759181374, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1632945753", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“今晚回去的时候，我就把血交给斑比酱...”"}
{"time": 1759181517, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1413332121", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"那还差不多。\"她站起身，你背上的压力消失，\"这女孩?\"你看着她走向橘发的女孩，\"斑比酱想到了！要不要转化成眷属呢？\""}
{"time": 1759181621, "type": "recv", "message_id": "61380919", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“不..不要了吧..斑比酱转换眷属要花那么多的血...而且现在身边也没有血可以吸..”"}
{"time": 1759181649, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1053062550", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“而且...而且我很能干的..斑比酱有我就够了....”"}
{"time": 1759181658, "type": "recv", "message_id": "948886797", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "有点没底气"}
{"time": 1759181766, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1846398369", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"...\"她停下脚步，回头看了你一眼，带着些鄙夷，\"算了，这女孩太虚弱了，斑比酱要是咬上去估计会很麻烦。\""}
{"time": 1759181814, "type": "recv", "message_id": "108932248", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我..可以起来了吗”"}
{"time": 1759181829, "type": "recv", "message_id": "131952629", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"没事我就走了，记住，不要随便用我的血找我！过段时间会变成你自己的血。\"她的身形开始消融"}
{"time": 1759181853, "type": "recv", "message_id": "473274778", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“嗯嗯..我记住了，斑比酱再见”"}
{"time": 1759181883, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1072768218", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(你不拜托她的话，待会怎么上去呢"}
{"time": 1759181887, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1219923191", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（感觉该睡了，晚安）"}
{"time": 1759181915, "type": "recv", "message_id": "44015873", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(不把离开的跑完?)"}
{"time": 1759181919, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1804265633", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1072768218]（自己飞上去吧，不过确实，拜托她也是对的）"}
{"time": 1759181922, "type": "recv", "message_id": "539373462", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(那明天又要)"}
{"time": 1759181934, "type": "recv", "message_id": "178903103", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“斑比酱，可以再帮我一个小忙吗..”"}
{"time": 1759182003, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1297454491", "deleted": true, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“外面着起了大火，我自己还好，带她有可能承受不了那股高温..”趴在地上诚恳的看着斑比"}
{"time": 1759182018, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1197332417", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“外面着起了大火，我自己还好，但她有可能承受不了那股高温..”趴在地上诚恳的看着斑比"}
{"time": 1759182109, "type": "recv", "message_id": "303243636", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"啊...好烦。\"她低下头看着你，\"没有血让我尝一口的话，这种事我不会帮的。\""}
{"time": 1759182153, "type": "recv", "message_id": "572666230", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我..的血的话，可以吗...”"}
{"time": 1759182213, "type": "recv", "message_id": "111136007", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“晚上除了龙裔的血 我还会再带一些其他的血.. ”"}
{"time": 1759182288, "type": "recv", "message_id": "523917748", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"啧。\"她抬起头，从自己的手腕开始滴下血珠，让你无比垂涎的气味弥漫开来"}
{"time": 1759182326, "type": "recv", "message_id": "557516198", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我...我可以尝尝吗”"}
{"time": 1759182395, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1329042473", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"身为血裔，有着斑比酱的血，结果被烧成这样?当那是阳光吗？\"她盯着你皮肤上的焦黑，血珠即将滴下，你要是再不行动的话..."}
{"time": 1759182494, "type": "recv", "message_id": "287819938", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "飞快的跑过去，然后趴在那里抬起头，像一只等待投喂的小狗，期待着血珠滴进嘴中"}
{"time": 1759182602, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2129917982", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"今晚，带着三份特殊的血。\"血珠滴落在你的唇上，一种难以言喻的快感席卷你的身心，以至于你都没有注意到皮肤上的焦黑正在被修复"}
{"time": 1759182716, "type": "recv", "message_id": "495984643", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“谢谢斑比酱的赏赐...”沉浸在那股快感中难以自拔"}
{"time": 1759182903, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1950482962", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "脖子上的伤口被她再次揭开，\"带着这种印记呢～\"血液牵引到她手中并被揉成形，薄薄的血膜覆盖住你的同时，分出一部分遮住了橘发的女孩。"}
{"time": 1759182926, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1672059396", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"就这样吧，斑比酱要休息了。\""}
{"time": 1759183024, "type": "recv", "message_id": "700612361", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "刚刚还感觉到舒爽的身体犹如触电一般顿了一下 强忍着那股痛苦笑着看向斑比“晚上见..斑比酱”"}
{"time": 1759183087, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1158644325", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "她伸出三根手指，随后化成了血液，沿着脖子上的伤口流入你的体内。"}
{"time": 1759183215, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1918966300", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "看到斑比酱离开之后，重新站起来，拍拍身上的灰，抱起眼前大概率是妃花的女子“幸好有斑比酱..”原路返回！"}
{"time": 1759183319, "type": "recv", "message_id": "703736224", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(感觉她比你高)"}
{"time": 1759183347, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1779865551", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1918966300]过个察觉"}
{"time": 1759183358, "type": "recv", "message_id": "62370833", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（公主抱应该没问题吧）"}
{"time": 1759183363, "type": "recv", "message_id": "738085148", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": ".rd"}
{"time": 1759183363, "type": "reply", "message_id": "738085148", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": 2875548981, "name": "小雅"}, "message": "[诺薇拉]演奏出: 1D20=14"}
{"time": 1759183454, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1538790379", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "女孩抱起来格外地轻，此外，掉在空中的丝线此刻在轻轻抖动，在无风地此处看上去不像是自然的事情。"}
{"time": 1759183512, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1528520864", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "此地不宜久留，快快离开..不想多待一刻了"}
{"time": 1759183656, "type": "recv", "message_id": "246197607", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "你抱着她向外穿行...火焰毫不意外地蔓延到更深处，几乎很快就和你遭遇"}
{"time": 1759203926, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1107394435", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "相信斑比酱，应该不会有什么事，紧紧的抱着她，然后飞入火焰中"}
{"time": 1759208657, "type": "recv", "message_id": "578116422", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "火浪拍击，薄薄的血膜悉数抵挡，不出意外的话，大概没什么问题。"}
{"time": 1759208793, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2037121734", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "不愧是斑比酱，好厉害 带着对斑比的瞻仰之情朝出口飞去"}
{"time": 1759209275, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2106464643", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(想了一下，感觉没必要)"}
{"time": 1759209283, "type": "recv", "message_id": "493672667", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(龙神在不在)"}
{"time": 1759209290, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1168887220", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（[CQ:at,qq=825734198] ）"}
{"time": 1759209383, "type": "recv", "message_id": "365370909", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（在）"}
{"time": 1759209490, "type": "recv", "message_id": "960022849", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2037121734](那你该，英雄到来了)"}
{"time": 1759209497, "type": "recv", "message_id": "295977332", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(飞出去自己描述一下?)"}
{"time": 1759209704, "type": "recv", "message_id": "528915372", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（好的）"}
{"time": 1759209978, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1201301314", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "与来时相比，回去时感觉稍微轻松一些，但也丝毫不敢懈怠，害怕晚一点都会让怀中的女孩情况更加恶化...不遗余力的朝着前方飞行，过了一会终于看到了那个口子，直接冲过去，看到了熟悉的脸庞，心顿时放了下来“快...帮她治疗”然后瘫倒在地，好累啊，稍微睡一小下吧，就一小会"}
{"time": 1759210138, "type": "recv", "message_id": "97022268", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（但其实我也不知道她什么情况（）"}
{"time": 1759210149, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1210585479", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "（那你检查一下不就好了）"}
{"time": 1759210155, "type": "recv", "message_id": "813974434", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（等会醒来就要抽龙哥血了）"}
{"time": 1759210161, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2124751735", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（但是我会说）"}
{"time": 1759210164, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1320815956", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（让我抽一管不过分吧）"}
{"time": 1759210180, "type": "recv", "message_id": "845109533", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=674521069]（）"}
{"time": 1759210197, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1939382077", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "（）"}
{"time": 1759210211, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1540470814", "deleted": true, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "（原来如此，金铲铲喊的）"}
{"time": 1759210218, "type": "recv", "message_id": "814574786", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "（原来如此，金铲铲害的）"}
{"time": 1759210255, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1369611431", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "‘（但是三种特殊的血怎么找呢，伊芙一种，还有两种怎么搞）"}
{"time": 1759210430, "type": "recv", "message_id": "886256462", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=674521069]“我是理论派。”她摊着手，“也有些庸人会用所谓即时炼成，不过我看来，那就跟挥刀舞棒差不多。”"}
{"time": 1759210434, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1488203516", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（一个人抽三份）"}
{"time": 1759210483, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1537598589", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（还真是，是三份，不是三种）"}
{"time": 1759210706, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1669610301", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（好问题）"}
{"time": 1759210832, "type": "recv", "message_id": "417012437", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=886256462]“那种事我也不感兴趣……毕竟天生和火无缘啦。那……祝你收徒愉快？”"}
{"time": 1759211121, "type": "recv", "message_id": "736045416", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=417012437]\"练成的基础在于明晰材料的性质。\"她把面具挂在腰间，\"没什么难的，教你认一认得了。不过说起来...\"她看着对面，\"真够多的，居然烧到了现在。\""}
{"time": 1759211212, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2064631740", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“嗯……举个例子？那种丝线……怎么看出来是什么？”"}
{"time": 1759211510, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1756395065", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2064631740]\"你不是有一只特殊的眼睛么？\"她盯着你的左眼，\"只要你想，朝着性质思考而不是玛纳的话，理应实现这种程度的解析。\"她摇头，\"真是方便，我们的话，就得自己取材，做实验，积累经验才可以了，。\""}
{"time": 1759211741, "type": "recv", "message_id": "689339410", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“也不总是我的能力。”*顿了顿“虽然说人太贪心不好。嗯……你有罐子吗？”"}
{"time": 1759211859, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1945901899", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"你要装什么?\"这么说着，她拿出一个干净的玻璃罐子"}
{"time": 1759212162, "type": "recv", "message_id": "834670157", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "*靠坐着把罐子放在手边，老样子用匕首在左手腕开个口子，然后便把伤口悬在罐口上方“如果……那小魔人能出来，这点就给她当报酬好了。没出来的话……”*另一只手收好匕首，总感觉这匕首上沾的全是自己的血。旋开糖罐盖子，塞一颗到嘴里“如果她没上来，就当原料吧。我也弄不来别的东西了”"}
{"time": 1759212186, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1188932253", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（死因是自杀）"}
{"time": 1759212415, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1750231184", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=834670157]\"哦?\"柯艾特看了一眼就收回目光，\"看来确实很重要了，那个女孩。\""}
{"time": 1759212750, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1998733995", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“答应过了……”*一边在补充一边在掏空的感觉并不好受，感觉有一根线穿过身体，还在单方向抽动"}
{"time": 1759212968, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1611327908", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1998733995]\"...\"西里斯走上前递出绷带，\"我帮伊芙包扎一下吧。\""}
{"time": 1759212990, "type": "recv", "message_id": "49662582", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（没那么快（）"}
