{"time": 1759214776, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1184184131", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“呃……”手撑着地面想要站起来，但伤口还没止住，不靠两只手也站不起来，只能拜托其他人代为确认“她……怎么样？”"}
{"time": 1759214799, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1371969846", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“en...emm...哦”有些半睡半醒的回应"}
