{"time": 1759258024, "type": "recv", "message_id": "732399041", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“能补充就好……”*听她这么说也算放心了些“那……等她恢复的这段期间，找点事干？比如，传授点小配方？”"}
{"time": 1759258257, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1516719152", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=364307141]\"进来。\""}
{"time": 1759258277, "type": "recv", "message_id": "874678608", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=732399041]\"你倒是心急。\""}
{"time": 1759258300, "type": "recv", "message_id": "167157943", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"先从认清材料开始吧。\"她扔给你一本册子"}
{"time": 1759258305, "type": "recv", "message_id": "632769748", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "小心的推开门，然后双手捧着罐子小跑过去“斑比酱，快尝尝这个”"}
{"time": 1759258573, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1152690514", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=632769748]室内依然拉着窗帘，她躺在床上靠着，表情慵懒，\"过来吧\""}
{"time": 1759258580, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1970751774", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=167157943]“也行。”*接过册子，把妃花背起来准备上楼"}
{"time": 1759258681, "type": "recv", "message_id": "102340604", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“斑比酱，快来试试”双手把瓶子递过去"}
{"time": 1759258870, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1203382305", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1970751774]她的身体软软地搭在你的背上，但你没有闻到那种独特的香味"}
{"time": 1759259199, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1973304646", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=102340604]\"拧开 \""}
{"time": 1759259233, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1250797693", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "小心翼翼的打开罐子“需要我来喂斑比酱么”"}
{"time": 1759259347, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1070466738", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1203382305]*如果变成了普通人……说不定也不坏"}
{"time": 1759259347, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1803565834", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"可以。\"她惬意地靠着床垫，\"一份。\""}
{"time": 1759259440, "type": "recv", "message_id": "991447435", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "谨慎的把罐子递到斑比酱的嘴边“啊...斑比酱张嘴”"}
{"time": 1759259528, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1265823141", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "然后一个很缓的角度缓慢的倾斜罐子，让血液慢慢流入斑比酱的嘴中"}
{"time": 1759259683, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1431602064", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1070466738]身体倒是温热，至少还有生命体征，轻轻的呼吸吐在你的脖颈，加上垂落在你肩膀的柔软头发，有点痒。"}
{"time": 1759259684, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1267425243", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1070466738]*总之上楼"}
{"time": 1759260170, "type": "recv", "message_id": "52993071", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1265823141]\"唔...\"喝了一点，她抬手推开你，\"龙的血，好稀薄。\"皱眉"}
{"time": 1759260448, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1307918360", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1267425243]柯艾特跟着你重新回了五楼的房间，\"好了，我就不打扰你们了，先走咯?\""}
{"time": 1759262771, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1011140569", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(人呢，都睡了?)"}
{"time": 1759263259, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1735722672", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（在洲）"}
