{"time": 1759299814, "type": "recv", "message_id": "350210472", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（我觉得龙哥没醒啊）"}
{"time": 1759299840, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1280731468", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=52993071][CQ:at,qq=1252219916] “我觉得还蛮好喝的啊...”有点委屈"}
{"time": 1759299863, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1743229355", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(为冇不问)"}
{"time": 1759299927, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1532048977", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（[CQ:at,qq=825734198] 你醒了吗）"}
{"time": 1759300176, "type": "recv", "message_id": "404219418", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1280731468]\"你是不是没尝过真正的龙血?\"她虽然有些嫌弃，不过咕噜咕噜喝下了一半，\"算你，算你合格。\""}
{"time": 1759300212, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1156906499", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我也一共没喝过多少血....谢谢斑比酱”"}
{"time": 1759300295, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1226607785", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“斑比酱要尝尝我的血吗...虽说之前我体内的血都被你换了，但这么长时间了，我身体应该也重新造了一些吧...”"}
{"time": 1759300455, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1134503991", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"你的?你的不算。\"剩下的半罐被她放在桌上，\"就算是我，一次也不能喝太多这种东西。\""}
{"time": 1759300577, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1893677237", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“哎？好吧...那我先走了，斑比酱，我去找找剩下的血..”"}
{"time": 1759300856, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1467494280", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"去吧，今晚带给我。\"她伸了个懒腰，\"做的好的话，今晚斑比酱会给你奖励哦?\""}
{"time": 1759300901, "type": "recv", "message_id": "187537723", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“真的吗？我会努力的，那我就不打扰斑比酱休息了，拜拜”有些开心的离开了"}
{"time": 1759300995, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1271366136", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "刚刚离开房门，这扇门自动合上。你重又回到了温暖的走廊"}
{"time": 1759301117, "type": "recv", "message_id": "888216142", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "但是剩下两份去哪里找呢，好纠结...要不抽一点妃花小姐的血液？算了，妃花小姐那么虚弱。那个面具女呢，拿自己的血液和她交换的话，说不定可以..."}
{"time": 1759301152, "type": "recv", "message_id": "687957959", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "不过先回去找西莉斯姐姐吧，有点想她了"}
{"time": 1759301924, "type": "recv", "message_id": "837483167", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(去哪找)"}
{"time": 1759301939, "type": "recv", "message_id": "125450390", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（回房间啊）"}
{"time": 1759301945, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1898763871", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（难道西莉斯也上五楼了？）"}
{"time": 1759302139, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1931253715", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "你推开房间门，人偶静静地站在门边，低着眼睑，没有说话。西里斯坐在沙发上，垂着脑袋，看上去似乎睡着了"}
{"time": 1759302192, "type": "recv", "message_id": "883342570", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "\"怎么在这里睡了？\"过去小心翼翼的把西莉斯姐姐抱起来"}
{"time": 1759302445, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1435421604", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "她的脑袋静静垂落，头发散在你的手臂上，双手搭在自己的小腹上，似乎没醒"}
{"time": 1759302544, "type": "recv", "message_id": "573616861", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "强忍着做坏事的冲动，不行，怎么忍得住的，偷偷亲一下西莉斯姐姐的额头，然后把西莉斯姐姐抱回她的床上，帮她盖好被子"}
{"time": 1759302925, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1317661209", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=573616861]过一下侦查"}
{"time": 1759302932, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2140685316", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": ".rd"}
{"time": 1759302932, "type": "reply", "message_id": "2140685316", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": 2875548981, "name": "小雅"}, "message": "[诺薇拉]演奏出: 1D20=8"}
{"time": 1759303089, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1696415090", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "吻完抬起头的时候，你可以看见她的睫毛微微抖动"}
{"time": 1759303296, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2094427749", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "哎，西莉斯姐姐不会被我弄醒了吧...还是在装睡？算了，先把她抱到床上再说吧"}
{"time": 1759303422, "type": "recv", "message_id": "773784774", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（1吗，yln）"}
