{"time": 1759318448, "type": "recv", "message_id": "279997659", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "*点点头，先把妃花搬到自己的房间里"}
{"time": 1759318556, "type": "recv", "message_id": "260534066", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“西莉丝姐姐真好....”好开心，好幸福，西莉丝姐姐...好软..久违的感觉到了安心，很快便睡着了"}
{"time": 1759319945, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1275441145", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=279997659]呼吸平稳但低，你顺利把她搬到了房间。"}
{"time": 1759320047, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1014285040", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=260534066](那就睡！)"}
