{"time": 1759320332, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1054905631", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "不在，房间里静悄悄"}
{"time": 1759320475, "type": "recv", "message_id": "17192580", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "*有点怪不习惯的，也不知道怎么联系她……把妃花先放在床上，打点温水用吸管蘸着帮她润润嘴唇，之后就先看看小册子吧"}
{"time": 1759320782, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1508427737", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=17192580]时间总是过得很快，册子里是一些基础的材料学知识，包含常见材料的解析，第一章的内容是涉及，无机非材料。你抬起头的时候，黄昏时的房间里除你之外已经多了一个人偶。"}
{"time": 1759320808, "type": "recv", "message_id": "780164514", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=260534066]醒来的时候已是黄昏时分，主要是饿了"}
{"time": 1759320834, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1415925747", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "看看西莉丝姐姐醒了吗"}
