{"time": 1759351741, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1864278256", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1806649531]\"当然是，日积月累，慢慢纠正。首先...就从不要太多亲密接触开始吧。\""}
{"time": 1759351766, "type": "recv", "message_id": "208474387", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“哎？不要...”"}
