{"time": 1759352477, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1744330795", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“不要么..西莉丝姐姐，”"}
{"time": 1759352576, "type": "recv", "message_id": "153096767", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=925131737]“看起来明天密会就要开始了，你也休息么？”"}
{"time": 1759352807, "type": "recv", "message_id": "576374641", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1744330795]\"我也没有正视这种情感的...\"她停顿了一下，\"嗯..啊啊，诺诺...懂我的意思吗？\""}
{"time": 1759354120, "type": "recv", "message_id": "981119888", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“如果我点头的话...以后还会有亲密接触吗....”"}
{"time": 1759354128, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2094219172", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=153096767]“明天...再说吧。” 她的声音渐小，“早上喊我起床...”随后归于沉寂，而相应的，怀中的女孩呼吸平稳的同时倒是有了些动静，“...唔..唔”发出了两声呢喃。"}
{"time": 1759355012, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1912495766", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=981119888]\"嗯...不行呢。\""}
