{"time": 1759413994, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1419781009", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“但是...我会尊重西莉丝姐姐的想法的...我会努力让西莉丝姐姐喜欢上我的...”"}
{"time": 1759414037, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1778500502", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1577327013]\"嗯...事情会告一段落吗？\"妃花闭上眼，语气有些虚弱，\"我在现实里苏醒，好像已经没有那种特殊的力量了...\""}
{"time": 1759414068, "type": "recv", "message_id": "832369776", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1419781009]\"我现在就很喜欢小诺诺，所以，这样就好。\""}
{"time": 1759414130, "type": "recv", "message_id": "469583740", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "只能先暂时顺从西莉丝姐姐了，不想被西莉丝姐姐讨厌...时间还很长"}
{"time": 1759414291, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1061007506", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=469583740]她稍微松了口气，\"今天就这样，好吗？好好休息\""}
{"time": 1759414337, "type": "recv", "message_id": "197059139", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“西莉丝姐姐等会可以陪我出下门吗...我想看看能不能遇到什么坏人，从他们那里收点血...”"}
{"time": 1759414388, "type": "recv", "message_id": "920677649", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1778500502]“……”*现在也说不出力量不重要这种话，“至少你还醒着……妃花之前是不是说……在现实里会比较麻烦？”"}
{"time": 1759414455, "type": "recv", "message_id": "631277363", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=197059139](特殊的血，我在想普通人的算吗)"}
