{"time": 1759414777, "type": "recv", "message_id": "877626533", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（准备找柯艾特交换吧）"}
{"time": 1759414866, "type": "recv", "message_id": "143674113", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=92332384]“这么一说，好像确实？”*有点后知后觉“不知道算好事还是坏事呢？我是觉得，普通人也不错啦”"}
{"time": 1759414932, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2136353171", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“...我果然还是应该感谢玛文大人吗？”她小声呢喃。随后看到了你的手，伸出手紧紧握住，“伊芙...这是因为妃花吗？”"}
{"time": 1759415260, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1336266659", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（怎么不感谢我（bushi）"}
