{"time": 1759417114, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1443518453", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=158193880]“唔……”*想不出什么安慰的话“好嘛，都过去了，我也没真的出什么事……别说我了，妃花现在算是能和正常人一样生活了？”"}
{"time": 1759417198, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1560566598", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1443518453]\"嗯...\"她稍微开心了一点，\"不过我好像也帮不上什么大忙了...现在的话...只能勉强让大家做个好梦。\""}
{"time": 1759417481, "type": "recv", "message_id": "314341957", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1560566598]“这样的话……*虽然好像有些自私，但是这么想着“或许恰到好处？普普通通，就很好”"}
{"time": 1759417583, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1008029232", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1791734151][CQ:at,qq=1252219916] “今天我去救妃花小姐的时候..斑比酱帮了我，她向我提出要给她三份特殊的血液...”"}
{"time": 1759417592, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1904057110", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“嗯，那样也很了不起了”*对着她点点头，“对有的人来说，一个好梦也是梦寐以求的”"}
{"time": 1759417600, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1030600171", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“目前我只有伊芙小姐的，还差两份”"}
{"time": 1759418364, "type": "recv", "message_id": "522398408", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1904057110]\"诶，可是后续的事情，我完全帮不上忙了...他们想做的事情也是...\""}
{"time": 1759418369, "type": "recv", "message_id": "540837583", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1030600171]\"我的可以吗\""}
{"time": 1759418408, "type": "recv", "message_id": "857335076", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“但是我今天已经吸过西莉斯姐姐的了....而且不想给斑比酱你的血”"}
{"time": 1759418827, "type": "recv", "message_id": "231058522", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(龙神好像幽会了)"}
{"time": 1759418839, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2035970535", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=857335076]\"不想给?\""}
{"time": 1759418856, "type": "recv", "message_id": "212922124", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（刚碰头）"}
{"time": 1759418883, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1093227489", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“算了..西莉丝姐姐当我没有说后面的话好了，短时间内失血太多的话会很难受的...”"}
{"time": 1759418915, "type": "recv", "message_id": "335690838", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“还是西莉丝姐姐其实很享受被吸血的感觉吗...再享受也不可以啦...”"}
{"time": 1759418941, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1774334442", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=335690838]\"呃，什么时候有这种奇怪的想法?我可是很怕疼的。\""}
{"time": 1759419013, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2126535494", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“那就更不可以了..我不想看到西莉丝姐姐受到伤害，尤其是为了我..我先去找那个带面具的姐姐问问好了....”"}
{"time": 1759419179, "type": "recv", "message_id": "148224218", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2126535494]\"嗯，不会离家出走了？\""}
{"time": 1759419255, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1525119203", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=522398408]“啊……妃花想帮上忙的话，我倒是知道一个姑娘。是个很想做个好梦的姑娘”"}
{"time": 1759419419, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2016219679", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1525119203]\"诶，我还能帮上忙吗？\""}
{"time": 1759419539, "type": "recv", "message_id": "887313193", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“当然，不管是什么人，只要想都能帮上忙的。”*点点头“不过，反正要等到晚上吧，妃花可以再休息一会”"}
{"time": 1759419650, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1857750865", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=148224218]“西莉丝姐姐还喜欢我的话..我就不会走的”"}
