{"time": 1759432391, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2142069120", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=769033841]\"诺亚?\"她有些疑惑，\"诺亚是伊芙认可的人吗？\""}
{"time": 1759432435, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1602372692", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=312345441]\"哦哦...等一下\""}
{"time": 1759432571, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1644179835", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2142069120]“是个帮了我很多的，想成为人类的人偶。虽然在我眼中，她和人早就没太多区别……或者说比许多人都好”"}
{"time": 1759432838, "type": "recv", "message_id": "707984209", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1602372692]过了一下她才打开门，身上的衣服看上去刚刚才穿好，有些凌乱，头发上沾了些棉絮"}
{"time": 1759432861, "type": "recv", "message_id": "104488569", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“艾璃西雅姐姐睡了一天吗？有些疑惑”"}
{"time": 1759432927, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1485895045", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1644179835]\"哦...\"她稍微放下被子，露出橘色的脑袋，\"我也想重新成为人类。\"表情认真"}
{"time": 1759433028, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1364800024", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=104488569]\"唔..一直没醒，感觉做了好长好长的梦\""}
