{"time": 1759655923, "type": "recv", "message_id": "637189023", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1226080724]\"有吗？\"她从被窝里坐起来，穿着的衬衣没有扣得很好，在身上松松垮垮的，一只手挡住嘴巴打哈欠，\"嗯...还好?其实...\""}
{"time": 1759655996, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1067443099", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“艾璃西雅姐姐快点换好衣服吧,出来吃饭”"}
{"time": 1759656064, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1077374860", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1644179835]\"人偶啊...\"她缓缓吐出口气，语气有些欢欣，\"伊芙也遇到很美丽的邂逅了呢。\""}
{"time": 1759656140, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2021501878", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“嗯……真是意外之喜”*点点头，但是想了想诺亚在自己的感染下恐怕和妃花……没那么合得来"}
{"time": 1759656579, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1254039953", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1067443099]\"诶?\"她放下手开始系扣子，发丝凌乱，长短不一地披在肩膀上，\"不怎么饿诶\""}
{"time": 1759656625, "type": "recv", "message_id": "547768199", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“但是你一天没吃了哎，稍微吃点吧”"}
{"time": 1759657168, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1952569663", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2021501878]\"唔...伊芙，晚上有什么事吗？\""}
{"time": 1759657277, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1832290532", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“嗯，有个姑娘，她和姐姐分开了”*点点头，不去想别的含义“她很喜欢她姐姐，但是她姐姐总是冷冷的……但是好几天都没见上，还是第一次。她说她想在梦里再见一次”"}
{"time": 1759657767, "type": "recv", "message_id": "343863121", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=547768199]\"虽然是这么说啦...不过我还想睡一会其实，如果能继续做梦就好了\""}
{"time": 1759658123, "type": "recv", "message_id": "532435482", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1832290532]\"可以哦。\"她点点头，费力想从床上起来"}
{"time": 1759658181, "type": "recv", "message_id": "617927518", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“你……再休息会吧？现在妃花已经是普通人了，应该也需要吃东西？反正现在离晚上还早……”"}
{"time": 1759658809, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1724686912", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯嗯。\"听完你的话她老老实实地躺下，\"嗯...\"欲言又止，不过肚子的咕咕声让她脸颊瞬间染上红晕"}
{"time": 1759658866, "type": "recv", "message_id": "98235111", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=343863121][CQ:at,qq=1252219916] “爱璃西雅姐姐梦到了什么呢”"}
{"time": 1759658868, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2034769372", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（所以饿肚子是什么值得脸红的事吗.jpg）"}
{"time": 1759658893, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1788537142", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（在我们二次元肚子咕咕叫，不太淑女吧）"}
