{"time": 1759659799, "type": "recv", "message_id": "106073827", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“先吃饭吧，艾璃西雅姐姐，吃完饭我们可以出去玩玩...放松放松”"}
{"time": 1759659993, "type": "recv", "message_id": "610051837", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2099246172]\"妃花也想和伊芙一起...\"她微微抓住你的衣袖"}
{"time": 1759660142, "type": "recv", "message_id": "201530675", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“嗯……也好，那就一起转转吧。这酒店还挺大的”"}
{"time": 1759660955, "type": "recv", "message_id": "22918460", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(既然如此，该补一下酒店描述了)"}
{"time": 1759661223, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1023379562", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=106073827]\"嗯...诺诺都这么说了。\"她扣好了扣子，\"晚上要出门吗？\""}
{"time": 1759661282, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1259659986", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“应该可以吧...我还没在晚上逛过马纳利亚呢，等会吃饭的时候把西莉丝姐姐一起叫上”"}
{"time": 1759661670, "type": "recv", "message_id": "940324093", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1259659986]\"唔...要出门的话，穿什么衣服好呢...\"她看上去陷入了纠结，低头思考"}
{"time": 1759662005, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1539989160", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"诺诺有什么想法吗？\""}
{"time": 1759662623, "type": "recv", "message_id": "429358632", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我来选吗？都有哪些衣服”"}
{"time": 1759663419, "type": "recv", "message_id": "670866184", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=201530675]她靠着床背坐起来，看上去有些费力，手指捎着自己的发尾，身上还是那套白色的抹胸包臀白裙，不过头发没有扎，本来有的饰品也消失了七七八八，\"伊芙...要麻烦你带我走了。\""}
{"time": 1759663831, "type": "recv", "message_id": "343476837", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“不影响……我也没怎么认真逛过”*摇摇头，牵起她一只手“走吧”"}
