{"time": 1759670642, "type": "recv", "message_id": "632587970", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1923718349]\"...但是这样，我怎么和你一起...\"她的手放在头发上，有些苦恼，本就有些散的发丝更显凌乱"}
{"time": 1759670792, "type": "recv", "message_id": "465591843", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“好了好了，我又不只是为了让你帮我做什么才去救你的。”*顿了顿“我们现在只是去吃饭而已”"}
{"time": 1759672840, "type": "recv", "message_id": "924182735", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=23712232]\"诺诺想要什么样的衣服?\""}
