{"time": 1759675035, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1905439710", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=803513366]\"简洁风是什么样的衣服?\""}
{"time": 1759675068, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1165430647", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“简单一点...不太复杂”手指戳着脸颊思考"}
{"time": 1759675266, "type": "recv", "message_id": "637428167", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“嗯……暖色系啊……”*打量考虑一番，有点陌生。先……把双马尾环一圈，随后打开衣柜，挑一身东西结合的明黄色无袖交叠棉上衣，和黑色里衬橘色主体的分离袖套，只露出两边肩膀。下装则是经典双层及膝裙，腰后垂下两条燕尾般的渐细拖尾"}
{"time": 1759676631, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2041411584", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(双马尾环一圈?)"}
{"time": 1759676667, "type": "recv", "message_id": "390851963", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（今汐那种）"}
{"time": 1759677044, "type": "recv", "message_id": "150371716", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1165430647]\"那就一样的?\"对方看上去也不太懂服饰这种事，满脸困惑，\"我也不懂诶。\""}
{"time": 1759677111, "type": "recv", "message_id": "533922105", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=637428167]\"唔...\"她伸出手，\"很漂亮...伊芙可以帮我换吗？\""}
{"time": 1759677225, "type": "recv", "message_id": "108252114", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“哎？一样吗，那和艾璃西雅姐姐站一起说不定别人会以为我们是亲姐妹呢...不过我也没有姐姐，当妹妹会是什么感觉呢..艾璃西雅可以当一天我的姐姐吗，可以吗，可以吗，可以吗”有些兴奋的看着她"}
{"time": 1759677335, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1941676808", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=533922105]“咳，这个，不太方便……”*轻咳一声"}
{"time": 1759677940, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1546146054", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=108252114]\"诶...西里斯不是诺诺的姐姐吗？\""}
{"time": 1759677973, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1072207632", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“不是啦...我对西莉丝姐姐是另一种感情啦,不是姐妹的那种..”脸有点红"}
{"time": 1759678238, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1885114201", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1941676808]\"嗯...不可以吗？\""}
{"time": 1759678453, "type": "recv", "message_id": "214380400", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1072207632]\"不是姐妹?诶...\"爱璃西雅突然有了精神，\"难道说?\""}
{"time": 1759678581, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2049846892", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“嗯...嗯....我喜欢...不..不对啦，现在是在说我和艾璃西雅姐姐之间的事情啦,所以可以吗，就一天，一天就可以了”"}
{"time": 1759678948, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2082663907", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1885114201]“你实在没力气的话……”*有些纠结，诺亚怎么还没来"}
{"time": 1759679632, "type": "recv", "message_id": "376091672", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2049846892]\"哇哦哦，那可真是，西里斯姐姐知道吗？\"她露出些了然的笑，\"我是不会说出来的\""}
{"time": 1759679718, "type": "recv", "message_id": "431550399", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“都说了不要聊这方面了么..”低下头戳手指“西莉丝姐姐说我年纪太小了....而且都是女孩子，不可能在一起的,不过我不会放弃的...”"}
{"time": 1759679873, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1005786467", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2082663907]\"唔...\"她拿起衣服，\"伊芙要是困扰的话...我自己来吧。\""}
{"time": 1759679981, "type": "recv", "message_id": "642053975", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“嗯……就作为康复的起点吧？”"}
{"time": 1759680096, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1309982774", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=431550399]\"哦...不过她说的也没什么问题吧？\"爱璃西雅笑眯眯，摸摸你的脑袋，\"我什么也不知道。\""}
{"time": 1759680265, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1767654006", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“哎...”叹口气“所以可以吗，艾璃西雅当我一天姐姐”"}
{"time": 1759680448, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1684176978", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=642053975]\"伊芙不是刚刚才说...不康复也没关系吗？\"妃花轻笑起来，抬手开始解自己的衣服扣子"}
{"time": 1759680626, "type": "recv", "message_id": "913727928", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1767654006]\"只是一天吗？\"她摸着你的脑袋，手指搭在你的蝙蝠耳朵上，有些痒"}
{"time": 1759680648, "type": "recv", "message_id": "22333474", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“emmm，那一直当我姐姐？”"}
{"time": 1759680668, "type": "recv", "message_id": "52483457", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“好痒啊，艾璃西雅姐姐轻点”"}
{"time": 1759680726, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1017527580", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“能康复当然更好了？我看妃花也不是甘愿一直当伤员的样子”"}
{"time": 1759680810, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1853007021", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=52483457]\"我本来就是吧?从各种方面看。\"她收回手，\"所以要让我做什么啦\""}
{"time": 1759680843, "type": "recv", "message_id": "607727297", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1017527580]*转过身去站到门口"}
{"time": 1759680864, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1081967234", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1017527580](背闪吗？)"}
{"time": 1759680887, "type": "recv", "message_id": "638222004", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（）"}
{"time": 1759680900, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1737680581", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“emmm，事已至此，先去吃饭吧.....姐姐”试探性的叫到"}
{"time": 1759680942, "type": "recv", "message_id": "295604000", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=607727297]她的手指搭在最后一粒扣子上，抬起头看向你的方向，在此刻光线昏暗的室内声音尤为明显，\"伊芙...打算帮我换吗？\""}
{"time": 1759681136, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1500552555", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（那很快了（）"}
{"time": 1759681168, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1447211274", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1737680581]\"所以...和之前有什么区别啦?\"她无奈地笑笑，随后轻咳了两下，\"诺...妹妹。\""}
