{"time": 1759685055, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1865923227", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1369283047]“嗯，看起来确实要些时间习惯……伸手”*闭着眼把内衣撑起来"}
{"time": 1759685452, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1628638905", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1881348576]\"好啊。\"她穿着清新的校园风衣服，\"怎么样?有点不习惯\""}
{"time": 1759685543, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1905378540", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“很适合姐姐啊...走吧走吧，去吃饭吧”挽起她胳膊往外面走"}
{"time": 1759685549, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1533268697", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1865923227]\"诶...习惯什么?\""}
