{"time": 1759686697, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1627546534", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“谢谢西莉丝姐姐的夸奖了..”环视一下找68，把旧衣服交给她“对了，之前让你缝的那件衣服怎么样了”"}
{"time": 1759687056, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2041466882", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1599630972]\"好哦...\"她伸着手，在黑暗中绿色的眸子闪闪发光，\"伊芙觉得妃花...之前做的那些事...可以被原谅吗？\""}
{"time": 1759687227, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1534566688", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1627546534]\"如果客人需要的话。\"她接过旧衣服，\"...晚餐之后我会送回您的卧室。\""}
{"time": 1759687246, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2010401288", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“那多谢68号酱了”"}
{"time": 1759687288, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1599659391", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "回头再去找西莉丝聊天“西莉丝姐姐，我们晚上吃什么呢”"}
{"time": 1759687787, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1634200926", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1599659391]\"今晚的话，诺诺想吃什么?\""}
{"time": 1759687808, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1516516816", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（想吃毛血旺（）"}
{"time": 1759687824, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1386137313", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“艾璃西雅姐姐有什么想吃的吗”"}
{"time": 1759688365, "type": "recv", "message_id": "989193091", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"我吗？想吃甜点啦\""}
{"time": 1759688410, "type": "recv", "message_id": "645721235", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“哎，甜点不能当饭吃啦...姐姐怎么感觉比我还小孩”"}
{"time": 1759688627, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1838912354", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"不能吗？我觉得我的胃口.吃一点就可以了\""}
{"time": 1759688703, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1920250170", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“emmm”想想书上怎么说的“姐姐甜品吃太多,营养会不均衡的..要..多吃蔬菜啦”虽然自己也不爱吃蔬菜"}
{"time": 1759688951, "type": "recv", "message_id": "71497167", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“西莉丝姐姐，我想吃点带血的东西....血鸭啦，血肠啦，血薄饼之类的...”"}
{"time": 1759688994, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1764875225", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(明天继续吧)"}
