{"time": 1759747883, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1898617029", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2006709196][CQ:at,qq=1252219916] 乖乖点点头“那我们在哪吃”"}
{"time": 1759748109, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1582694734", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1576577386]“嗯……那不是该问我的事情。”*摇摇头“因为我也一样，为了一个愿望，用着很多不属于我的力量，帮过人也伤过人……对不对得起，该不该原谅，得问她们本人。但是问过之后，我也不打算放弃就是了”"}
{"time": 1759748185, "type": "recv", "message_id": "552999258", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "*撑起那件上衣，从她头上往下套"}
{"time": 1759748457, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1643737205", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1898617029]\"就在楼下吧，二层有餐厅。\"西里斯给自己披上外衣，推开门。\n\"诶，这么久都不知道?诺诺是不是家里蹲啊？\"爱璃西雅紧跟着她，脸上露出促狭的笑容"}
{"time": 1759748770, "type": "recv", "message_id": "511110320", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“爱璃西雅姐姐之前去过？”反问道，戴上帽子跟过去"}
{"time": 1759748813, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1563129569", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=552999258]\"嗯...\"露出的一抹橘色好像毛绒堆里显眼的兔子，声音有些不清楚，\"伊芙说得对啦...不过现在，妃花倒没有这些烦恼了，只是...依然不能完全摆脱吧？那些过去。\""}
{"time": 1759749021, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1680937844", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1563129569]“当然，谁都一样。所以……做自己想做的，能做的，该做的……其实比想象中的难，但是好过一睡不醒”"}
{"time": 1759749102, "type": "recv", "message_id": "638269319", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=511110320]\"当然啦，论对这里的了解程度，诺诺完全不如我呢。\"今天她没扎头发，看上去文静了一些，\"虽然也可以让人偶小姐送上来就是了，不过到处走走也很有意思吧？\""}
{"time": 1759749137, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1022555742", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“？我还以为姐姐在这里一直都在睡觉呢”"}
{"time": 1759749477, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1632688969", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1680937844]\"之前就是一睡不醒?\"你给她套好了上衣，她的脸上洋溢着一抹笑容，\"妃花其实也不讨厌啦，只是觉得，既然到了现在这个情况，果然还是...这样才有活着的真切感觉。\""}
{"time": 1759749683, "type": "recv", "message_id": "119293593", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“一会吃到好吃的，就更有感觉了”*勾起嘴角，把裙子也递给她“这个……应该，可以自己来？”"}
{"time": 1759749858, "type": "recv", "message_id": "826201516", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1022555742]\"你是不是太小看我了？\"她清了清嗓子，\"咳咳，这酒店除了五层我都一清二楚。说到底，我才是姐姐。\""}
{"time": 1759749884, "type": "recv", "message_id": "886088595", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“姐姐真厉害啊”崇拜的看着她"}
{"time": 1759749894, "type": "recv", "message_id": "504187356", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（怎么感觉有点阴阳怪气）"}
{"time": 1759750374, "type": "recv", "message_id": "601453961", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=119293593]她接过裙子，\"虽然很想再拜托伊芙就是啦...\"语中带笑，有些活泼，\"不过看伊芙这么困扰的话，我自己来吧。\""}
{"time": 1759750414, "type": "recv", "message_id": "749689485", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“嗯……我去外面等你吧”*轻咳一声，站起身来"}
{"time": 1759750582, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1561134563", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=886088595]她侧过脑袋瞪了你一眼，先出了门。西里斯耸了耸肩，跟她一起出去了。"}
{"time": 1759751026, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1999376799", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1561134563]（？）"}
{"time": 1759751044, "type": "recv", "message_id": "872776246", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我是真心的啊...姐姐”跟上去解释"}
{"time": 1759751061, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1594333000", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=749689485]\"嗯。\"你听到她抖着裙子，随后是掀开被子的声音。"}
{"time": 1759751255, "type": "recv", "message_id": "245551350", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=872776246]\"那怎么了?\"她回头伸手用力捏了捏你的脸颊，\"快走，走前面。\""}
{"time": 1759751402, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1866328846", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“哎，我不认路？”"}
{"time": 1759751854, "type": "recv", "message_id": "913340759", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1594333000]过了一会，随着一声带扣清脆的声音，门外再听不到里面的声音。"}
{"time": 1759751870, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1919326906", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1866328846]\"别管，我指你走。\"她推了你一下"}
{"time": 1759751901, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1815982203", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“那好吧....”去坐电梯了"}
{"time": 1759752520, "type": "recv", "message_id": "940438482", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=913340759]*敲敲门“好了吗？”"}
{"time": 1759753082, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2142151017", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1815982203]云台坐成的电梯虽然是无遮掩，但不管坐几次都给人很奇妙的感觉，爱璃西雅推着你在二楼下，走了两步，一个宽敞明亮，几乎和大堂一样规模的餐厅出现在你们面前，\"是自助餐哦?而且味道很好。\""}
{"time": 1759753129, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1809348132", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=940438482]\"嗯...\"你听到里面传出的声音，\"伊芙...我...\"紧接着传来一声很响的扑通声，好像重物落地"}
{"time": 1759753546, "type": "recv", "message_id": "906390123", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“？”*开门"}
{"time": 1759753625, "type": "recv", "message_id": "438353883", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“看起来好丰盛...”"}
{"time": 1759753813, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1393610679", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（好奇个问题伊酱，同名加值不叠加这个规则在天防方面是怎么个说法）"}
{"time": 1759754021, "type": "recv", "message_id": "61024165", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "看看有哪些跟血有关的菜品"}
{"time": 1759754042, "type": "recv", "message_id": "923849062", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(天防本身可叠，但天防加值不叠)"}
{"time": 1759754088, "type": "recv", "message_id": "212978193", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=906390123]妃花倒在地上，看起来磕到了膝盖，\"嘶...\""}
{"time": 1759754115, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1989255174", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=61024165]那当然，动物的血是经典的菜品"}
{"time": 1759754336, "type": "recv", "message_id": "710985567", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=212978193]“怎么搞得？”*快步走到旁边把她扶起来，心说莫不是和先前见过那摄魂怪（？）有关。“应该……不是有人来过吧？”"}
{"time": 1759754358, "type": "recv", "message_id": "704552560", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“艾璃西雅姐姐和西莉丝姐姐有什么想吃的吗，我帮你们拿吧”"}
{"time": 1759755039, "type": "recv", "message_id": "480258848", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=710985567]\"没...妃花想起床...\"她抬起头看向你，随后低下头看着自己的小腿，\"原来会这么疼...\""}
{"time": 1759755123, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2016801337", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=704552560]\"别拿一堆猪血鸭血就行了。\"爱璃西雅挑了挑眉，\"你知道我想吃什么的。\"\n西里斯点头，\"那就麻烦诺诺了，我吃什么都可以。\""}
{"time": 1759755373, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1171290863", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“那就交给我吧”拍拍胸膛"}
{"time": 1759755582, "type": "recv", "message_id": "59079188", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=480258848]“没出大事就好……”*松了口气，扶她起来“现在还不能自己行走吗？”"}
{"time": 1759755614, "type": "recv", "message_id": "43973882", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "西莉丝姐姐的话，帮她拿一份牛排，奶油蘑菇汤，面包，帮艾璃西雅姐姐拿一份沙拉，然后再拿各种的甜品，泡芙，马卡龙，奶油蛋糕"}
{"time": 1759755647, "type": "recv", "message_id": "358747120", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "先回去把东西给她们“艾璃西雅姐姐要多吃蔬菜啊，西莉丝姐姐还有什么要吃的吗”"}
{"time": 1759756280, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1174873988", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(吃撑了)"}
{"time": 1759756332, "type": "recv", "message_id": "895830825", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=59079188]\"嗯...腿上有点没力气，麻烦伊芙了。\"她软软地靠着你的半边身子，几乎整个人的重量都在你身上，所幸也不重"}
{"time": 1759756360, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1034770771", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=358747120]\"可以了，诺诺去给自己拿餐吧。\"西里斯点头，帮你摆了一下盘子"}
{"time": 1759756522, "type": "recv", "message_id": "858126080", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=895830825]“……和之前，我的腿有关系吗？”*扶她起来，轻声问问，帮她理一下衣服"}
{"time": 1759756561, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1167554654", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“谢谢西莉丝姐姐”去给自己取餐了 血肠，血薄饼，面包，蔬菜沙拉，再拿三盒牛奶，回去把牛奶分一下"}
{"time": 1759756734, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1896067264", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=858126080]衣服上身倒是很合身，看上去很雍容，不过头发还是乱糟糟的，\"嗯...?\"她收回目光，\"没有啦，肯定是我自己的问题。\""}
{"time": 1759756959, "type": "recv", "message_id": "367329691", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（我会说我有心理学）"}
{"time": 1759757023, "type": "recv", "message_id": "855107122", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(好的)"}
{"time": 1759757037, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1230467563", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1167554654]她们坐在桌前等你"}
{"time": 1759757208, "type": "recv", "message_id": "928650558", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "坐下，然后吃饭，看看动物的血吃起来是什么感觉“我开动了”"}
{"time": 1759757378, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1007101793", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "在口感上，和你人类的时候差不多，不过现在作为吸血裔，倒是能显而易见地尝出一些血之滋味，但是显然，和人血比起来差了相当多。"}
{"time": 1759757486, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1456814785", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "勉强可以作为代餐吧，不过有一点点失望就是了"}
