{"time": 1759770614, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1805171866", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1165711777]酒店的餐厅里似乎没什么人的样子，这个情况似乎有些不正常。"}
{"time": 1759770669, "type": "recv", "message_id": "732125500", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“西莉丝姐姐..周围怎么没什么人的样子，现在不是饭点吗？”"}
{"time": 1759770698, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1700994666", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=348101962]\"嗯...伊芙在看什么?\""}
{"time": 1759770850, "type": "recv", "message_id": "280089619", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“诺亚……找不到了”*有些焦虑，莫名有一种离了她寸步难行的感觉"}
{"time": 1759771155, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1310398933", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=732125500]\"嗯...最近确实没什么人。\""}
{"time": 1759771161, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1505718551", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"不过有点奇怪，注意一下\""}
{"time": 1759771226, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1523369030", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“嘶...不会大家都在睡觉吧..艾璃西雅姐姐今天也睡了一天，会不会其实不是她贪睡，而是因为什么外力呢”"}
{"time": 1759771369, "type": "recv", "message_id": "606460504", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=280089619]\"嗯?\"妃花轻轻掐了掐你的手臂，\"伊芙...不要担心。\""}
{"time": 1759771395, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1064784287", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"我会陪着你一起去找。\""}
{"time": 1759771573, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2146177761", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1523369030]\"睡觉?会是这种原因吗？\"西里斯侧目看向爱璃西雅，爱璃西雅一边吃着甜点，一边开口，\"大概不是吧，我自己的问题应该是\""}
{"time": 1759771849, "type": "recv", "message_id": "762315742", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“是吗，艾璃西雅姐姐也吃点蔬菜吧，吃甜点太多小心变成小胖子...”"}
{"time": 1759771954, "type": "recv", "message_id": "320664403", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"我不会，我是不会胖的体质\""}
{"time": 1759772044, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2079755257", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“那...总之多吃点蔬菜啦”"}
{"time": 1759772090, "type": "recv", "message_id": "527093272", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“西莉丝姐姐，吃完饭我们出去逛逛吧...想看看这座城市的夜景”"}
{"time": 1759772307, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1629068503", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"我吗？我晚上可能还有事。\"西里斯放下手里的刀叉，一本正经地开口"}
{"time": 1759772342, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1348171322", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“哎？什么事情”有点惊讶，明明这几天一直都和西莉丝姐姐待在一起"}
{"time": 1759772462, "type": "recv", "message_id": "965028420", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"有我自己的小秘密啦，那...爱璃西雅可以帮我看看诺诺吗？\""}
{"time": 1759772519, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1018443231", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“？是很重要的事情吗....”"}
{"time": 1759772768, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1154422513", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"呃...\"她迟疑了一下，\"反正今晚诺诺和爱璃西雅一起，好吗？\""}
{"time": 1759772781, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1735825169", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1064784287][CQ:at,qq=825734198]"}
{"time": 1759772814, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2053542241", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“西莉丝姐姐是要去见谁吗...”有些心不在焉"}
{"time": 1759772982, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2121759208", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "西莉丝姐姐会不会其实有喜欢的人，晚上要去见他..不对，不对..西莉丝姐姐都说没有了,她不会骗我的..不会..应该不会吧...."}
{"time": 1759773012, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1297376435", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"不是，我待在酒店里啦。\"她摸摸你的脑袋，\"就这样好吗？听我的话\""}
{"time": 1759773140, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1855276419", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "爱璃西雅接过话，\"好啊，我肯定可以胜任\""}
{"time": 1759773238, "type": "recv", "message_id": "808370549", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“嗯..我会听话的”把脑子里奇怪的想法扔出去，西莉丝姐姐肯定不会骗我的“那等下我们一起出去玩吧，艾璃西雅姐姐”"}
{"time": 1759773513, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2006481957", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"好啊，我带着你玩。\"她笑嘻嘻地，把手里的蛋糕递给你，\"诺诺也吃点\""}
{"time": 1759773664, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1541461418", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“谢谢姐姐”接过她手中的蛋糕慢慢吃完，甜甜的，虽然没有人类血液美味，但也不错了"}
{"time": 1759773675, "type": "recv", "message_id": "264583694", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（想睡了）"}
{"time": 1759773768, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1591256302", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(那你睡吧)"}
{"time": 1759773772, "type": "recv", "message_id": "425401003", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(我也没意见喵)"}
{"time": 1759773782, "type": "recv", "message_id": "777647370", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（晚安💤）"}
{"time": 1759798615, "type": "recv", "message_id": "513778718", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（哇，稳定昏迷）"}
{"time": 1759798672, "type": "recv", "message_id": "558706892", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(是人类吗，一点睡觉)"}
{"time": 1759798692, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1573205072", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(猛攻一天太累了?)"}
{"time": 1759798727, "type": "recv", "message_id": "764748917", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（作息太健康了）"}
{"time": 1759798801, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1596033505", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(不评价)"}
{"time": 1759798934, "type": "recv", "message_id": "342868687", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1064784287]“嗯……”*不知道该点头还是摇头，勉强挤出一点笑容“希望她没事……”"}
{"time": 1759799314, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1162925407", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"唔?她做了什么?\"妃花尝试从你身上移开一点重量，不过试了几次全都失败，\"呃...或许有什么理由...\""}
{"time": 1759799823, "type": "recv", "message_id": "121608241", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“她很可靠。不是人偶的那种可靠。她会陪我去找你，也会把我带回安全的地方。会给我带吃的，也会一晚上守着门口。就算被人下命令来杀我……我也相信她会站在我这边”"}
{"time": 1759800819, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1917544512", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"唔...\"妃花眨了眨眼，\"虽然我不知道啦，不过既然伊芙这么说，那诺亚小姐一定是很重要的人吧？\"她抬起手，\"不过我曾经见过她哦?\""}
{"time": 1759800961, "type": "recv", "message_id": "85163947", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“嗯？见过？在哪里？”*猛抬头"}
{"time": 1759801340, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1258409209", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"就在那一次...\"她说得很慢，\"昏暗的地下室...我当时也被绑着，用一些办法...唔，看见过。\""}
{"time": 1759801428, "type": "recv", "message_id": "517209263", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "*等她继续说"}
{"time": 1759801580, "type": "recv", "message_id": "872421312", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"虽然妃花有...\"她有些语塞，\"当时看见她砍掉了伊芙的脚...\"支支吾吾了几声，后面没再继续说"}
{"time": 1759802007, "type": "recv", "message_id": "69685491", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“那次是……没有别的办法”*摇摇头“不那样的话，可能会死吧”"}
{"time": 1759802130, "type": "recv", "message_id": "434207094", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"...\"她对着你眨眨眼，\"没事没事，现在看上去挺好的。伊芙，我们去哪里?\""}
{"time": 1759802182, "type": "recv", "message_id": "899001032", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“下楼吃饭，等学院开放的通知……然后看看能不能找到诺亚或者龙芙小姐吧”"}
{"time": 1759802458, "type": "recv", "message_id": "736764948", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"总之...就交给伊芙咯?\"她捏了捏自己的裙角，\"好重...\""}
{"time": 1759802566, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1447119806", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "*抿了抿嘴，现在看来怎么都不正常。卡珊德拉还在昏睡，不知道还能不能再用用左眼？"}
{"time": 1759802904, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2084184939", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(可以吧)"}
{"time": 1759802923, "type": "recv", "message_id": "846902310", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "*那就看看，主要看脚下"}
{"time": 1759803134, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2099938084", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "那你过一个灵感"}
{"time": 1759803141, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2143151877", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "。ri+1"}
{"time": 1759803141, "type": "reply", "message_id": "2143151877", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": 2875548981, "name": "小雅"}, "message": "先攻列表已设置:\n1. [伊芙]: 1D20+1=5"}
