{"time": 1759803571, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1274375777", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "没看出什么异常?但其实她的左腿上有一些黑色的驳质"}
{"time": 1759803584, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1822515781", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "除此之外倒没什么特别的"}
{"time": 1759803679, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1274275395", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“嗯，还好有升降台”*扶着她往升降台走，准备下楼"}
{"time": 1759803888, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1730337240", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"我这样是不是很不方便...\"你们上了升降的云台，她轻轻开口，隔着裙子敲敲自己的大腿，\"唔...果然还是该坐轮椅吧？\""}
{"time": 1759804309, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1512273119", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“有的话，当然”*按下通往餐厅的按钮"}
