{"time": 1759828763, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1358388444", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1512273119]\"不过能像现在这样，妃花已经很满意了。\"她有些好奇地看着室内的布景，\"所以有一些不好的地方也就只是瑕疵啦。\""}
{"time": 1759828808, "type": "recv", "message_id": "907902911", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1541461418]但吃到后半段就有些索然无味，没有血液滋润的食物终究只是凡品。"}
{"time": 1759828822, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2008177106", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（哎喰种）"}
