{"time": 1759829037, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1419071611", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1358388444]“嗯，什么时候能彻底脱离这扭曲的城中就好了……不过，总感觉还有好多债要还，嘛……”"}
