{"time": 1759829097, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1710632924", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（你要提交的血液份数（）"}
{"time": 1759829172, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1723610527", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "努力去吃完，不能辜负艾璃西雅姐姐的心意.."}
{"time": 1759829248, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2119182217", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1710632924](这不是等你来么)"}
{"time": 1759829263, "type": "recv", "message_id": "206924096", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（等我来是？）"}
{"time": 1759829274, "type": "recv", "message_id": "389918733", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（问你柯艾特在哪（）"}
{"time": 1759829281, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1458807801", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（你看我也不知道）"}
{"time": 1759829681, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2029433108", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1419071611]\"之前伊芙也说有必须回去的地方吧？嘛，妃花虽然已经被剥落了力量，不过还是知道一些事情的。唔...至少这里的事情快结束了。\""}
{"time": 1759829726, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1482385692", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1723610527]\"吃不下就别吃了。\"爱璃西雅好笑地看了你一眼，\"想要血吗？\""}
{"time": 1759829824, "type": "recv", "message_id": "601453937", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“哎？没关系...我可以的”"}
{"time": 1759830095, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1601961013", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2029433108]“嗯，那就好……”*总算是松了口气“啊，到了……已经闻到香味了”"}
{"time": 1759830157, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1400184920", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"不要勉强自己哦，不过看上去好像也不算饥渴。\"爱璃西雅挂着笑容，手里的叉子停在一块巧克力蛋糕上，\"明明早上的时候还是那种样子呢～\""}
{"time": 1759830194, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1219281127", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“早上？”"}
{"time": 1759830294, "type": "recv", "message_id": "270596863", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1219281127]有点疑惑“早上发生了什么吗”"}
{"time": 1759830411, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1459367509", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1601961013]\"嗯嗯。\"妃花停住了话头，\"好香...妃花想吃烤薄饼...松饼也不错，啊...还有之前看伊芙吃的蛋糕。\""}
{"time": 1759830458, "type": "recv", "message_id": "683775329", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=270596863]\"还是昨天晚上，有点记不清了。\"爱璃西雅眨眨眼，\"咦，我有这么健忘吗\""}
{"time": 1759830692, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1181748165", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1459367509]“嗯，去找找看……这里应该都会有？”"}
{"time": 1759830735, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1489785877", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "你们推开门进去，此时餐厅几乎没什么人，所以倒是一眼就看见了诺诺西里斯和爱璃西雅"}
{"time": 1759830768, "type": "recv", "message_id": "554228776", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=683775329][CQ:at,qq=1252219916] “艾璃西雅姐姐说的是哪件事？”"}
{"time": 1759830781, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1695650204", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（现在几点）"}
{"time": 1759830936, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1313951445", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(晚上7点左右吧)"}
{"time": 1759830966, "type": "recv", "message_id": "302386228", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=554228776]\"就是你抱着我的手啃啊?\"她撸起衬衣的袖子，露出你的牙印"}
{"time": 1759831126, "type": "recv", "message_id": "817034977", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“？”"}
{"time": 1759831153, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1305435080", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1489785877]“怎么这么冷清……厨师没上班吗？”*嘀咕一下，扶着妃花去旁边的桌子落座"}
{"time": 1759831174, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1157720533", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“对..不起，艾璃西雅姐姐”"}
{"time": 1759831259, "type": "recv", "message_id": "173797964", "deleted": true, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“你没有受伤吧，凑过去仔细看看”"}
