{"time": 1759833008, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1109906219", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2089675146]“我看你们这边感情戏角色已经饱和了”*揶揄地瞥一眼“还有我们的位置？”"}
{"time": 1759833316, "type": "recv", "message_id": "908868909", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "擦擦眼角的泪，看到伊芙想起了斑比的任务，问道“你身边那个戴面具的姐姐呢”"}
{"time": 1759833431, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2039411231", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"诶?不过伊芙还没回答我的问题。这位是?\"她指着挂在你肩膀上的妃花"}
{"time": 1759833465, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1930066219", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“妃花小姐身体没什么大碍吧”确认一下，希望没什么事"}
{"time": 1759835250, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1363651349", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2039411231]“是我的朋友，妃花。我觉得她应该也很适合和你做朋友”"}
{"time": 1759837066, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2139999730", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1930066219]妃花眨了眨眼看向你，有些疑惑，不过还是礼貌开口，\"我没什么事啦，谢谢你。\""}
{"time": 1759837127, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1560052211", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“不用谢啦..妃花小姐很伟大啊，能帮助你我也很开心”"}
{"time": 1759837144, "type": "recv", "message_id": "594644320", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=908868909]（）"}
