{"time": 1759856374, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1098058694", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（但是也没我活）"}
{"time": 1759856442, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1095123591", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(你猜?)"}
{"time": 1759856449, "type": "recv", "message_id": "615785082", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（我不想猜）"}
{"time": 1759856574, "type": "recv", "message_id": "347779924", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(没你活又是，你主动参与话题不就好了)"}
{"time": 1759856600, "type": "recv", "message_id": "660326591", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（翔哥先动呗）"}
{"time": 1759856723, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1699970359", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“那艾璃西雅姐姐要走了吗...”"}
{"time": 1759856858, "type": "recv", "message_id": "229553121", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"要走?是什么意思。\""}
{"time": 1759856892, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1999909610", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“学院开了之后...艾璃西雅姐姐肯定要回去的吧，我现在这种情况肯定进不去啦”"}
{"time": 1759857111, "type": "recv", "message_id": "842866800", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"呃...这种事情，也正常吧诺诺。\"她无奈地摇摇头，\"就像和伊芙小姐一样，总有一天会分开的。\""}
{"time": 1759857159, "type": "recv", "message_id": "560304522", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“但是...艾璃西雅姐姐不是说要做我姐姐么,亲人也要分开吗”"}
{"time": 1759857603, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1398846226", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“哦？和我有什么舍不得的”*起身去拿妃花想要的甜品“我倒希望我们不再见面比较好”"}
{"time": 1759857877, "type": "recv", "message_id": "333432611", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"是吗？\"她歪头看向伊芙，\"就当是这样吧。\"虽然摸摸诺诺的脑袋，\"姐妹也不能永远在一起啊\""}
{"time": 1759857992, "type": "recv", "message_id": "377093853", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“....我讨厌这种分离”"}
{"time": 1759858178, "type": "recv", "message_id": "226462577", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"天下没有不散的筵席啦。\""}
{"time": 1759858378, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1177566248", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“.....”想要反驳，但不知道该说什么"}
{"time": 1759858459, "type": "recv", "message_id": "565239934", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "只能握拳咬牙自己生闷气了"}
{"time": 1759858547, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1997536972", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"好了。\"妃花坐在自己的座位上，轻笑了一下，\"要是真的很喜欢，就一直跟着不就好了。\""}
{"time": 1759858586, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2098187828", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我进不去学院啦...而且就算进去了，大概率是给姐姐添麻烦”"}
{"time": 1759858871, "type": "recv", "message_id": "183311064", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（那就带走）"}
{"time": 1759858907, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1840142458", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "*端着松饼薄饼和熔岩蛋糕回来，放在妃花面前，自己则是烟熏培根三明治"}
{"time": 1759859136, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1975511692", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“好了，既然有分别的打算……”*摘下戒指，在桌上推向艾丽西亚“也该物归原主了。”"}
{"time": 1759859164, "type": "recv", "message_id": "75690161", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（我把水戒指还你了吗）"}
{"time": 1759859184, "type": "recv", "message_id": "508739659", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（不知道，反正我有的都还）"}
{"time": 1759859199, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1719612214", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（就当还了）"}
{"time": 1759859229, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1137983977", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "妃花接过盘子，\"看上去好好吃...\"说话的声音不大，但透露着惊喜"}
{"time": 1759859327, "type": "recv", "message_id": "826459656", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1975511692]\"诶..上次不就说送给伊芙了吗？\""}
{"time": 1759859454, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1838432884", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“作为初次见面的礼物太过贵重。”*摇摇头“我也拿不出可以回的礼。它已经帮过我了”"}
{"time": 1759859881, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1763867382", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2098187828]\"唔...\"她没说什么，\"好吧。\""}
{"time": 1759859906, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1830471459", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1838432884]\"但是送给伊芙，更有用处不是吗\""}
{"time": 1759860014, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1967862335", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“为什么会这么觉得呢？把这些送给你的人肯定有她的考量。就算真要给我，也得征询一下对方的意见吧。”*咬下一口酥脆的烤三明治"}
{"time": 1759860359, "type": "recv", "message_id": "452428020", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"好吧...\"她想了想，\"这件事确实不问问艾尔的话...\""}
{"time": 1759860382, "type": "recv", "message_id": "625157726", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "努力去平复心情“妃花小姐要不要一起去玩...”"}
{"time": 1759860387, "type": "recv", "message_id": "176812563", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"那我这里也没有什么更用的上的东西给伊芙了...\"她看着戒指"}
{"time": 1759860561, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1213996621", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“没必要，我们两不相欠”"}
{"time": 1759860597, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1904546136", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=625157726]\"我吗？\"她放下手里的博饼，\"我的腿脚不太方便...\""}
{"time": 1759860622, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2092379446", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“如果你想的话..我可以背你”"}
{"time": 1759860725, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1829427033", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1213996621]\"好吧。\"她默默收起戒指，\"既然伊芙小姐这么想的话。\""}
{"time": 1759861002, "type": "recv", "message_id": "912911402", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2092379446]她的目光转到伊芙那边，有些拿不定主意"}
{"time": 1759861087, "type": "recv", "message_id": "906668379", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“她们在营救的时候都出了大力……我觉得暂时可以信任，不过看你自己的想法吧”*喝上一口柳橙汁"}
{"time": 1759861321, "type": "recv", "message_id": "938205349", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"那我先吃完这些吧...\"她努力保持矜持，但那副新鲜的摸样怎么都掩盖不住"}
{"time": 1759861493, "type": "recv", "message_id": "749946400", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "*点点头，说起来之后她会打算去哪？没想过，不知道，但也不方便问。不过还是在想诺亚去哪了……最坏的可能总是挥之不去"}
{"time": 1759861567, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1036908899", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“对了，听伊芙说妃花的梦想是全世界人与人为善？”"}
{"time": 1759861617, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1881823283", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "妃花咬了一口松饼，露出了一副怀念的神色，过了一下才反应过来，\"诶...嗯...曾经是。\""}
{"time": 1759861643, "type": "recv", "message_id": "953077991", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“曾经是？”有点不太懂她的意思"}
{"time": 1759861651, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1803596186", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“这个梦想不是挺好的么”"}
{"time": 1759861686, "type": "recv", "message_id": "467664182", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（你在伊芙面前说这个是不是有点地狱（）"}
{"time": 1759861747, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1108098794", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=333432611]（我觉得这句也挺地狱的）"}
{"time": 1759861759, "type": "recv", "message_id": "49605925", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（好的）"}
{"time": 1759861868, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1101989549", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"伊芙说这种空泛的梦想实现不了...而且，我现在也没有实现的能力了。\"她刻意没看你，专心盯着博饼"}
{"time": 1759861908, "type": "recv", "message_id": "577047323", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“对于伟大的梦想，过程更重要吧...”"}
{"time": 1759861959, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1489823021", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“？”"}
{"time": 1759862075, "type": "recv", "message_id": "780494594", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“那妃花现在想做什么呢”"}
{"time": 1759862146, "type": "recv", "message_id": "482256350", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“如果你觉得你的目标没有你的过程重要，那它就不是你的目标”*翻了个白眼，胃口少了一半"}
{"time": 1759862195, "type": "recv", "message_id": "823738439", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"目前没有想好啦...\"语气有点弱弱地"}
{"time": 1759862248, "type": "recv", "message_id": "755286451", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "爱璃西雅眯着眼走上前，把诺诺一把拉开，\"啊...我这边还有一些想吃的点心，诺诺可以帮我去拿吗？\""}
{"time": 1759862354, "type": "recv", "message_id": "71492502", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“好吧”起身去帮艾璃西雅拿点心，顺便帮她拿点蔬菜，环绕环绕四周"}
{"time": 1759862548, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2026788326", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "。log off"}
{"time": 1759917400, "type": "reply", "message_id": "356971702", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": 2875548981, "name": "小雅"}, "message": "继续记录乐谱"}
{"time": 1759917411, "type": "recv", "message_id": "538884571", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=71492502]（）"}
{"time": 1759917717, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1009674334", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=482256350]\"抱歉...诺诺还小，有些没看懂气氛。\"爱璃西雅看诺诺走远，向你们道歉"}
{"time": 1759917971, "type": "recv", "message_id": "735013992", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“……没事。不过刚才的话我是认真的。我没有以后更多见面的打算。这次来马纳利亚只是偶然”"}
{"time": 1759918249, "type": "recv", "message_id": "329029065", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯...\"爱璃西雅轻轻点头，\"那就算萍水相逢?不过缘分这种事也许说不好呢。\""}
{"time": 1759918363, "type": "recv", "message_id": "275028931", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"不过看样子，伊芙小姐和诺诺之间似乎有一些不愉快的过往。我就不追问了...\"她说完停住，看向室内其他的地方。"}
{"time": 1759918471, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1187618150", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“谢谢，艾丽西娅小姐今天看见过诺亚吗？”*闪电般换了个话题"}
{"time": 1759918486, "type": "recv", "message_id": "508774418", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（[CQ:at,qq=1040972910] ）"}
{"time": 1759918497, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1181031372", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（怎么了）"}
{"time": 1759918507, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1228536670", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（你动啊）"}
{"time": 1759918508, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2010944985", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（我在远处啊）"}
{"time": 1759918521, "type": "recv", "message_id": "237692787", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（拿完不就回来了（）"}
{"time": 1759918521, "type": "recv", "message_id": "461910383", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（而且伊神也没回我）"}
{"time": 1759918543, "type": "recv", "message_id": "725873623", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（主要是我要吃饭了）"}
{"time": 1759918558, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1521644010", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（不是说没什么人么，我想看看能不能抓到路人聊一聊）"}
{"time": 1759918603, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1757000824", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(我没回你不就是你找点事做)"}
{"time": 1759918623, "type": "recv", "message_id": "648512121", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(free time嘛，你去拿东西啦)"}
{"time": 1759918632, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1886313929", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(要找路人的话就跟我说一声)"}
{"time": 1759918640, "type": "recv", "message_id": "973637124", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(也妹说啊)"}
{"time": 1759918641, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1515027755", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "看看有没有酒店工作人员"}
{"time": 1759918734, "type": "recv", "message_id": "902736730", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1187618150]\"诺亚?\"她点着自己的脸颊，\"嗯...\"思考了一会，\"下午似乎有人给我盖过被子，不知道是不是啦...\""}
{"time": 1759919105, "type": "recv", "message_id": "915560577", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1515027755]有的有的，有些餐品会有人工作人员替换"}
{"time": 1759919132, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1636953401", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（那是男的还是女的呢）"}
{"time": 1759919349, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1573927575", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(呃，不太重要吧)"}
{"time": 1759919358, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2066327783", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（好的）"}
{"time": 1759919381, "type": "recv", "message_id": "509136107", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "找到一个女工作人员“姐姐，今天的人怎么这么少，平常也是这样的吗”"}
{"time": 1759919382, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1563705715", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(名字上写着staff的人能有多重要)"}
{"time": 1759919651, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1365598442", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=509136107]\"这些天...人都不怎么多。\"她看了你一眼，回答。"}
{"time": 1759919696, "type": "recv", "message_id": "165329766", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“这样啊...是因为住的人不太多？还是大家都不吃饭了”"}
{"time": 1759920125, "type": "recv", "message_id": "706044085", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“硬要说的话...大家的作息都不怎么规律吧。”她如此解释，“感觉什么时间段来的人都有。”"}
{"time": 1759920150, "type": "recv", "message_id": "572954548", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（吃饭）"}
{"time": 1759920324, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1653699225", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=902736730]“嗯……”*依旧有些心不在焉，是不是该去问问龙芙小姐？"}
{"time": 1759920336, "type": "recv", "message_id": "515879555", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "*说起来，晚上好像有人找自己……？"}
{"time": 1759920759, "type": "recv", "message_id": "938539764", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1653699225]看你的样子，她过了一会才开口，“一般而言，如果很在意的话，应该立刻行动起来。”"}
{"time": 1759920907, "type": "recv", "message_id": "97371268", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "*或许最坏的情况已经发生，自己缺乏求证的勇气，但……“你说得对……那两位先聊吧，我上去一趟”*摇摇头，带着歉意起身离席"}
{"time": 1759920985, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1502464736", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=706044085][CQ:at,qq=1252219916] “好吧..谢谢姐姐了，不打扰你的工作了”然后带着那些吃的回去"}
{"time": 1759921050, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1901343540", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=97371268]“诶...伊芙要走吗？”妃花捏住你的袖子，“不带着妃花一起吗？”"}
{"time": 1759921061, "type": "recv", "message_id": "854343815", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1502464736]那你回去的时候刚好看见这一幕"}
{"time": 1759921216, "type": "recv", "message_id": "428722034", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1901343540]“我上去找个人，很快回来”*有些无奈“我也不确定她好不好说话……甚至不确定找不找得到，我自己去就行了”"}
{"time": 1759921320, "type": "recv", "message_id": "14213961", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "\"那我们等你一会...妃花小姐还有什么想吃的吗，我可以帮你拿\"然后把爱璃西雅要吃的递给她"}
{"time": 1759921424, "type": "recv", "message_id": "159834954", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=428722034]\"好吧...\"妃花惺惺松开手，\"那伊芙...要记得回来，我找不到你，现在...\""}
{"time": 1759921529, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1909184887", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=14213961]\"嗯嗯。\"她接过了你的盘子，\"如果诺诺感兴趣，也可以跟着伊芙小姐一起。\""}
{"time": 1759921537, "type": "recv", "message_id": "359405691", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=159834954]“当然当然”*看着她的眼睛说完，便转身上楼"}
{"time": 1759921754, "type": "recv", "message_id": "253711474", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“伊芙小姐要去找谁？”"}
