{"time": 1759922350, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1741851535", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（因为我没有动过啊）"}
{"time": 1759922369, "type": "recv", "message_id": "531892328", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（我往外走，你不跟着我怎么问我）"}
{"time": 1759922404, "type": "recv", "message_id": "823906607", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=253711474]问妃花和爱璃西雅"}
{"time": 1759922479, "type": "recv", "message_id": "331394474", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯...\"爱璃西雅看着伊芙的背影，\"诺亚，今天似乎没有见过她。\""}
{"time": 1759922497, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1185032285", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(你不说问谁，我和龙神都以为是在问他你没发现吗)"}
{"time": 1759922574, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2102383199", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“诺亚失踪了吗？”虽然有点担心，但是妃花和爱璃西雅姐姐在这万一也出什么事就不好了“emmm，我还是留在这里和你们一起吧，万一你们也失踪了就不好了”"}
{"time": 1759922779, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1332637999", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（理论上你跟我上去，也不会把你踹下去（）"}
{"time": 1759922783, "type": "recv", "message_id": "721143878", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "*总之上楼"}
{"time": 1759922953, "type": "recv", "message_id": "742974539", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1185032285]（对不起）"}
{"time": 1759923115, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1828819366", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2102383199]\"我总觉得诺诺是不是对我太不放心了，明明我才是姐姐。\"爱璃西雅敲敲你的脑门，看着伊芙离开，\"不过我对那边也不太放心就是了。\"\n妃花低着头看着桌面，没开口。"}
{"time": 1759923120, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2013644296", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=721143878](去哪)"}
{"time": 1759923135, "type": "recv", "message_id": "126090132", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "*回房间，去龙芙的门前"}
{"time": 1759923274, "type": "recv", "message_id": "630379955", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“不怕一万就怕万一么...诺亚肯定不会平白无故的失踪，而且妃花小姐的状况也不太好...我还是就在这边吧，相信伊芙小姐吧”"}
{"time": 1759923284, "type": "recv", "message_id": "123178838", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=126090132]整个五层都可以说是龙芙的私人房间，你其实也拿不准她到底住在哪里"}
{"time": 1759923298, "type": "recv", "message_id": "56006835", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（上次她进去的那个门）"}
