{"time": 1759923414, "type": "recv", "message_id": "33425754", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "*鼓起勇气敲敲门“龙芙小姐？”"}
{"time": 1759923546, "type": "recv", "message_id": "415538798", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=630379955]\"诺诺之前不是还要出门吗？\"爱璃西雅笑了笑，\"而且，万一西里斯在这个时候失踪的话...?\""}
{"time": 1759923595, "type": "recv", "message_id": "10025558", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（西里斯有没有说干嘛去了）"}
{"time": 1759923644, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1846281460", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=33425754](过个幸运吧"}
