{"time": 1759924044, "type": "recv", "message_id": "899421663", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=274750427]\"好啦好啦，我只是随便说说啦。\"她收起表情，\"不过在这种时候，还是...有些担忧\""}
{"time": 1759924156, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1109719793", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“....哎，那还是不出去了吧”"}
