{"time": 1759924417, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1105236046", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=626804328]\"哼哼?现在知道我的聪明在哪了？\""}
{"time": 1759924449, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1877216280", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“艾璃西雅姐姐确实聪明”奉承一下"}
{"time": 1759924530, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1652267313", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1970125370]“是我，伊芙·艾络温。抱歉打扰您……”*抿了抿嘴“我……想问问诺亚去哪了？我想见她。”"}
{"time": 1759924736, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1861769679", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1652267313]\"诺亚?\"她的语气停顿了一下，\"你为什么要找人偶。\""}
{"time": 1759924864, "type": "recv", "message_id": "516912832", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1861769679]“她很重要……”*有些语塞，不知道到底该怎么解释。“她说会等我们回来……我还有朋友要介绍给她”"}
{"time": 1759924879, "type": "recv", "message_id": "52597609", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1877216280]\"怎么总感觉在说怪话?\"她吐出口气，\"我们也不能一直在餐厅吧？\""}
{"time": 1759924934, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1331631645", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“你吃好了？”"}
