{"time": 1759945868, "type": "recv", "message_id": "382253107", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“好...”忽然想起了什么“要不艾璃西雅姐姐先回学院吧...万一明天又关门了就不好了”"}
{"time": 1759946100, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1905361766", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"不是明天早上才开门吗？\""}
{"time": 1759946134, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1558445961", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1575814990]“咦？伊芙不是说是今天么”"}
{"time": 1759946209, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1950171827", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(?)"}
{"time": 1759946245, "type": "recv", "message_id": "185756924", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"我们要是在这里等着的话，也没办法现在去学院吧？\"她放下手里的刀叉，\"嘛，我倒也不急\""}
{"time": 1759946299, "type": "recv", "message_id": "357912189", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“oh，对哦，但是现在我们走开的话，伊芙不就找不到我们了”"}
