{"time": 1759947357, "type": "recv", "message_id": "340683355", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"可以啊，难得有这样闲暇的时间对不对。少女的茶话会，就是这么回事。\"爱璃西雅倒是很有兴致的样子"}
{"time": 1759947359, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1797551936", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（？）"}
