{"time": 1759947419, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1023948323", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（打他妈普通大坝）"}
{"time": 1759947480, "type": "recv", "message_id": "653134659", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“那我想问了，艾璃西雅姐姐有没有喜欢的人啊”八卦一下"}
{"time": 1759947505, "type": "recv", "message_id": "29164527", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1868242383]（那很厉害了）"}
{"time": 1759947704, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1399310854", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2062466850]\"不过我没想到你会这么关心人偶。\"房门被她的手推开，在自己的居所倒是没有戴面具，竖瞳看向你，\"发生了一些可能我也很感兴趣的事吗？作为偶尔的调料，不妨说一说。\""}
{"time": 1759947765, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1756311368", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=653134659]她在桌上摆好三份奶茶，有些刻意地端起其中一杯，\"我吗？如果不是恋爱那种的话，姑且是有的。\""}
{"time": 1759947842, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1278636991", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1399310854]“可能……说不上有趣”*有点没信心“开始之前……可以斗胆问问，您对诺亚的看法吗？”"}
{"time": 1759947849, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1933491420", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“哎，我是想问恋爱的那种了”有些失望“不过不是恋爱的话，那是谁，艾尔吗”"}
{"time": 1759948169, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1295482538", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1278636991]“妾身如果说，只是普通的人偶，没看出什么特别之处，你会说什么？”"}
{"time": 1759948260, "type": "recv", "message_id": "13870283", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1933491420]“埃尔当然是...妹妹怎么会不喜欢姐姐。”她摇摇头，突然一改有些丧的表情 ，笑眯眯地看向你，“我能不能喜欢喜欢小诺诺？”"}
{"time": 1759948315, "type": "recv", "message_id": "559401569", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“可以啊，我也很喜欢艾璃西雅姐姐，姐妹那种”"}
{"time": 1759948346, "type": "recv", "message_id": "338581940", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "*松了口气“那我会……比较安心。嗯。我其实有点担心她……被特殊处理了什么的。她会关心我，会考虑我……对我而言，她就是特别的”"}
{"time": 1759948583, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1007375959", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=559401569]“诶，可是万一不是姐妹那种呢？”她叉了个小点心在你的眼前晃了晃，闻言妃花都有些意外地抬起头看着你们。"}
{"time": 1759948680, "type": "recv", "message_id": "84333352", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“？艾璃西雅姐姐不要开这种玩笑啦”"}
{"time": 1759948710, "type": "recv", "message_id": "908458902", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=338581940]“虽然对于有固定模块的人偶而言并不正常，但妾身不反对人偶拥有自己的心灵。”她从腰间拿出烟斗点燃，“毕竟，很有趣。就像是在创造生命，嗯...?有点像创世之龙的玩笑。”"}
{"time": 1759948890, "type": "recv", "message_id": "52563902", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“万一我当真了...怎么办”"}
{"time": 1759948965, "type": "recv", "message_id": "438765841", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=52563902]“当真的了话，就咬住蛋糕？”她的另一只手撑着自己的下巴，轻轻地笑，“嘻嘻...”"}
{"time": 1759949028, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1966748439", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（要不要来个意志检定（）"}
