{"time": 1759949097, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1506679561", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=908458902]“创造生命……我暂时还没法感同身受，但我觉得这是难能可贵的偶然。”*还是决定隐瞒诺亚的梦想“我……有些自以为是地说，觉得我和她对彼此而言，都是特殊的”"}
{"time": 1759949124, "type": "recv", "message_id": "31332799", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1966748439]（哎，花心）"}
