{"time": 1759949188, "type": "recv", "message_id": "97091562", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（里榭娜吧）"}
{"time": 1759949203, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1217622902", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（血的能力换扭曲的情感么）"}
{"time": 1759949361, "type": "recv", "message_id": "21774984", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1506679561]“嚯？妾身的人偶可是非卖品。” 她抽了一口烟斗，不同于刺鼻的烟味，传出了有人心沁的香味。"}
{"time": 1759949366, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1982210940", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "好不容易平静下的内心又开始躁动起来，自己确实喜欢艾璃西雅姐姐，但是姐妹的那种，对吧，是姐妹的那种....不断重复试图去压制这种感觉，我喜欢西莉丝姐姐,不能做花心的人...但是里榭娜姐姐呢，自己其实已经很花心了，好痛苦，好复杂..想不明白"}
{"time": 1759949385, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1640773223", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "脸刷一下的变红，低下头，不敢看艾璃西雅"}
{"time": 1759949691, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1639762504", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1640773223]“诶？”她看了看你的样子，“难道说？”随后她有些好笑地放下叉子，“好啦，小诺诺别再逗姐姐了。”"}
{"time": 1759949722, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1932058804", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“不是姐姐在逗我么...”"}
{"time": 1759949779, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1244816955", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "急忙喝一口奶茶稍微缓一下，还是不要太花心了，艾璃西雅姐姐肯定是在开玩笑，忍住，忍住..."}
{"time": 1759950035, "type": "recv", "message_id": "325362284", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“想到这里就随便说出口了嘛。”她掩面，很明显在笑，“不过小诺诺没有当真吧？”"}
{"time": 1759950091, "type": "recv", "message_id": "39194641", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“没...没有...”自己的这种感情还是藏在心里吧..说出来的话，艾璃西雅姐姐和西莉丝姐姐都会讨厌自己的吧"}
{"time": 1759950125, "type": "recv", "message_id": "172204400", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“那妃花姐姐呢..有喜欢的人吗”转移话题，然后喝一口奶茶"}
{"time": 1759950219, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2120584073", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=21774984]“我……我也没钱……”*低下头，更说不出“能不能送给我”这种话，小声说到“那有没有什么别的……交换？不，我现在只想见见她。在我还在马纳利亚的时候，还在这夏日酒店的时候”"}
{"time": 1759950349, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1631194448", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=172204400]\"诶...\"一时间没反应过来话题转移到自己身上，妃花有些没拿稳手里的饼干，掉在了餐盘上，\"妃花的话...喜欢...不过最喜欢大家都能爱身边的人...\""}
{"time": 1759950465, "type": "recv", "message_id": "251320360", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2120584073]龙芙有些好笑地看着你，\"只是半天没见，紧张成这样?编号31，现在叫诺亚的话...\"她挥挥手，\"放心，妾身的人偶，自然有妾身的保护。\""}
{"time": 1759950588, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1046782268", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“珍惜身边人吗..妃花姐姐说的对”反正里榭娜姐姐现在也不在身边..自己只用把全部的爱都给西莉丝姐姐就好了，剩下的以后再说，那果然还是不能太花心...回想一下之前和西莉丝姐姐的亲密互动，不断在心中重复我最喜欢西莉丝姐姐了，总算感觉稍微好了一点"}
{"time": 1759950835, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2089933974", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1046782268]\"诶，真是好宽泛的喜欢。\"爱璃西雅叼着汤匙，语气调侃，\"不过小诺诺这种类型也不错啦，我也不讨厌呢。\"她对你眨了眨一只眼睛。\n妃花有些不好意思地低下头，半晌才开口，\"妃花...妃花也很羡慕，大胆的喜欢这种事...\""}
{"time": 1759950881, "type": "recv", "message_id": "38173120", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“我只是觉得，这些经历很珍贵，我怕会被忘掉……有龙芙小姐在，自然是……不该担心的”"}
{"time": 1759951026, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2046180731", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“好了好了..不要在说了，话说艾璃西雅姐姐平常闲暇的时候都在做什么”不想在讨论这个话题了，赶紧换一个"}
{"time": 1759951076, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1443910199", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=38173120]\"谁会忘掉?\"她微微摇摇头，\"真是的，都找到妾身这里了。\"她递给你一个方形的钥匙，语气却挺轻松，\"四楼的房间钥匙，以后不准住在五楼了，妾身这里可不是医护站。\""}
{"time": 1759951238, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1350280972", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2046180731]\"我的话...\"她摸摸自己的脑袋，\"说出来很无聊诶...真的要说吗？\""}
{"time": 1759951244, "type": "recv", "message_id": "567034121", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“谢谢您！”*又惊又喜地双手接过钥匙，抓在手里深鞠一躬“我我……也没东西要收拾的，那我这就下楼去。告辞了。”"}
{"time": 1759951263, "type": "recv", "message_id": "24356696", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“无所谓吧...反正现在都是闲聊了”"}
{"time": 1759951516, "type": "recv", "message_id": "228474344", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=24356696]\"呃...每次被莉莉丝和莉莉尤姆她们丢下，我就去找埃尔，一待就好几天...经常会错过上课...\""}
{"time": 1759951566, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1441148041", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“？好过分，她们经常丢下你吗...用不用我帮姐姐报仇”"}
{"time": 1759951567, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1759382149", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=567034121]\"慢走不送，哦。\"她想起了什么，随意的语气开口，\"柯艾特给的东西要老实吃完，对血脉有好处。\""}
{"time": 1759951745, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1941644244", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1441148041]\"嗯...那个..不用了吧。\"她迟疑地开口，\"毕竟我们也是朋友吧？\""}
{"time": 1759951767, "type": "recv", "message_id": "769766078", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1759382149]“嗯嗯嗯”*像刚拿到心爱玩具的孩子一般，这时候说什么都会点头答应的"}
{"time": 1759951825, "type": "recv", "message_id": "965788609", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“她们真的是真正的朋友吗...要是以后有机会见见她们就好了，如果她们是故意欺负姐姐的话...我不会放过她们的”"}
{"time": 1759951980, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1914614030", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=769766078]\"不过那个房间还有一位客人。\"她耸耸肩，\"不过不会出门，你也切记不要找她。\""}
{"time": 1759952036, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1984538911", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=965788609]\"好啦，什么时候到妹妹说这种话了。\"她调整好了情绪，\"我的事情我自己能处理的，毕竟诺诺之后也不会留在这边对不对?\""}
{"time": 1759952070, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1034453137", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“...不一定吧，谁知道未来的事情呢”"}
{"time": 1759952088, "type": "recv", "message_id": "813620155", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“啊……好的，我明白了”*抓着钥匙，最后道别过后就……先回餐厅吧"}
{"time": 1759952137, "type": "recv", "message_id": "889994503", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“妃花姐姐呢，你平常闲暇时候会做些什么呢...我一般会练练剑，看看故事书之类的”"}
{"time": 1759952254, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1435923336", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=889994503]\"我...\"妃花有些不知道说什么，\"我的话...个人兴趣是做一点烤薄饼...有时候逗逗小动物...\""}
{"time": 1759952284, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1388033833", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“妃花姐姐会做饭吗，好厉害”"}
{"time": 1759952292, "type": "recv", "message_id": "470482472", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=813620155]回来的时候你看见三人围在桌边，氛围倒是很融洽，妃花正在解释着什么"}
{"time": 1759952304, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1140846224", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“要是有机会可以尝尝就好了”"}
{"time": 1759952316, "type": "recv", "message_id": "624178488", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=470482472]看上去像是什么女子会?"}
{"time": 1759952354, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1396674231", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1140846224]\"啊...我也没自信能做好，都不是真的做过...\"她放下杯子摆摆手，\"不过妃花之后会试试的\""}
{"time": 1759952392, "type": "recv", "message_id": "643668334", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "*回来之后看着明显心情好了不少，坐回原位“嗯……在说什么？吃的？”"}
{"time": 1759952490, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1774607579", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我们在聊闲暇时候会做什么”"}
{"time": 1759952586, "type": "recv", "message_id": "97866559", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "几人的眼神看向伊芙，大家明显都在想同样的事情"}
{"time": 1759952732, "type": "recv", "message_id": "647321372", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“我？闲暇的时候？”*靠在椅子上“什么算闲暇呢？其实没什么特别的爱好。只是觉得毒物能用上，所以大部分时间都在研究那个”"}
{"time": 1759952817, "type": "recv", "message_id": "160306731", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“很符合我对你的感觉.. ”"}
{"time": 1759952858, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1721690149", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"伊芙...找到她了？\"妃花靠近了一些，小声询问"}
{"time": 1759952896, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1719283664", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嘛，毕竟兴趣这种事情，千奇八怪呢。\"爱璃西雅开口，\"我以前也对炼金很感兴趣，不过完全没天赋啦。\""}
{"time": 1759952911, "type": "recv", "message_id": "498995710", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1721690149]“嗯嗯，一会我们就去看她。”*点点头[CQ:at,qq=1252219916]"}
{"time": 1759952931, "type": "recv", "message_id": "429874339", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(为什么我总是会想到夜幕山庄)"}
{"time": 1759952960, "type": "recv", "message_id": "922839740", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(哎我草，有点没来由会想到泳池旁边那个上楼梯)"}
{"time": 1759952975, "type": "recv", "message_id": "579481188", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（？）"}
{"time": 1759952995, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1878061588", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“现在怎么说，去哪里呢”想到还差的两份血液，莫名的有些头疼"}
{"time": 1759952998, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1329597459", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "妃花点点头，重新坐正，小口啜饮自己的奶茶"}
{"time": 1759953045, "type": "recv", "message_id": "699882737", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1878061588]\"如果要出门的话，既然伊芙小姐回来了，那我们也该出发了。\"爱璃西雅放下杯子，\"难得的茶话会，不过就到这啦。\""}
{"time": 1759953077, "type": "recv", "message_id": "326349043", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“那个带面具的姐姐，怎么找他你真的一点头绪也没有吗”"}
{"time": 1759953208, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2065766204", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“好像……今晚，她说今晚九点，大厅等我来着”"}
{"time": 1759953249, "type": "recv", "message_id": "962807575", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“真的吗...谢谢你了”松了一口气，虽说那个姐姐不一定帮自己，但起码还是有点希望的"}
{"time": 1759953318, "type": "recv", "message_id": "528354389", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"诺诺要找他做什么?\"爱璃西雅看向诺维拉的方向开口"}
{"time": 1759953342, "type": "recv", "message_id": "623879982", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“做一些交易吧...”"}
{"time": 1759953434, "type": "recv", "message_id": "773016559", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"交易...?我总觉得不是什么好东西。\"她眯着眼，\"伊芙小姐，晚上能带我一起吗\""}
{"time": 1759953560, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1156857939", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“总之……时间地点都确定了。我也不会早到”"}
{"time": 1759953586, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1360494501", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“到时候，你们想来我也没法管”"}
{"time": 1759953589, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1742657424", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "该睡觉了"}
{"time": 1759953598, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1079206640", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（）"}
{"time": 1759953600, "type": "recv", "message_id": "656101392", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"我可要好好看看这家伙想做什么。\"她点头"}
{"time": 1759953609, "type": "recv", "message_id": "568461119", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "。log off"}
{"time": 1759978831, "type": "reply", "message_id": "1380404787", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": 2875548981, "name": "小雅"}, "message": "继续记录乐谱"}
{"time": 1759978838, "type": "recv", "message_id": "622761667", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（你也可以先去占位）"}
{"time": 1759978944, "type": "recv", "message_id": "855031263", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=656101392][CQ:at,qq=1252219916] “好了好了...我只是感觉那个姐姐身上好像一堆奇奇怪怪的东西，想看看她有没有什么特殊的血之类的的”"}
{"time": 1759979092, "type": "recv", "message_id": "764177396", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“还要特殊的血？”*抬眉“要那么多干嘛，你做吸血鬼也挑食？”"}
{"time": 1759979127, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1705207522", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“跟另一个人的交易...”"}
