{"time": 1759985587, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1309011776", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（吃个饭）"}
{"time": 1759986449, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1759646295", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(睡着了？龙神)"}
{"time": 1759986475, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2117708048", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“离九点好像也不是很远了..要不我们就在地下室消遣一会吧”"}
{"time": 1759986484, "type": "recv", "message_id": "770334080", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（？）"}
{"time": 1759986487, "type": "recv", "message_id": "753540771", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（又没我事）"}
{"time": 1759986554, "type": "recv", "message_id": "271627526", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯...我倒是没问题，那伊芙小姐和妃花小姐呢？\""}
{"time": 1759986646, "type": "recv", "message_id": "955670263", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“地下室？我打算先上去一趟，妃花想去看看的话，我就把诺亚也叫上吧”"}
{"time": 1759986748, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1160365454", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“妃花跟伊芙一起...”她牵住你的衣袖，“刚刚说要介绍给我..”"}
{"time": 1759986913, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1900221857", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“嗯，那我们先上去。”*点点头，照样把她扶起来"}
{"time": 1759987010, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1124487945", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“emmm，还是在一起行动比较好感觉，我和爱璃西雅姐姐也陪你们一起上去吧...”"}
{"time": 1759987018, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1205075241", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1900221857]\"总感觉每次都不怎么方便呢...\"她的手搭在你的肩膀上，把整个人的重量靠过来，\"...果然还是早点找个轮椅比较好吧。\""}
{"time": 1759987038, "type": "recv", "message_id": "95098675", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1124487945]\"诶...\"爱璃西雅愣了一下，\"我倒是...没什么意见\""}
{"time": 1759987245, "type": "recv", "message_id": "178149850", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1205075241]“我不知道在哪，诺亚应该找得到。”*搀扶着往升降台走"}
{"time": 1759987424, "type": "recv", "message_id": "934885477", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "跟上"}
{"time": 1759987427, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1206996942", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯...\"她走起路来有些一脚深一脚浅，\"呼...呼...\"，显得有些吃力"}
{"time": 1759987443, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1182964421", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“要不我来背着妃花姐姐吧”"}
{"time": 1759987612, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1354560662", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（首先排除问我）"}
{"time": 1759987662, "type": "recv", "message_id": "754585327", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（问妃花吧）"}
{"time": 1759987712, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1426227234", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(我感觉其实伊芙回答好一点吧。)"}
{"time": 1759987750, "type": "recv", "message_id": "301438058", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（没有那种非得我来的执念）"}
{"time": 1759987759, "type": "recv", "message_id": "392317548", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1182964421]\"呃...\"妃花侧头看向伊芙，一副等待伊芙斟酌的表情。"}
{"time": 1759987768, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1735054113", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(没事，会问你)"}
{"time": 1759987820, "type": "recv", "message_id": "207969386", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“也行”*反正之前已经试过了，不如说妃花就是她带回来的。“一会我来开门”"}
{"time": 1759987880, "type": "recv", "message_id": "523544714", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "她点点头，“会不会有些麻烦诺薇拉了...”"}
{"time": 1759987899, "type": "recv", "message_id": "583378801", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "站到妃花面前，背朝着她半蹲下来“没关系的妃花姐姐，上来吧”"}
{"time": 1759988030, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1746503644", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "她慢慢松开伊芙，一只手先搭在你的肩膀上，紧接着是另一只手，整个人的重量压在你的背上，“...”"}
{"time": 1759988271, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1943979119", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "待妃花稳定后，用手拖住她的腿缓缓起身，将她稳稳背在背上“那伊芙小姐带路吧”"}
{"time": 1759988529, "type": "recv", "message_id": "727452438", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "*走上升降台，上去之后按钥匙的门牌找房间"}
{"time": 1759988566, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1489584212", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:image,file={93E0B61F-3D46-7539-980C-6B6C104B9080}.png,sub_type=0,url=https://gchat.qpic.cn/gchatpic_new/0/0-0-93E0B61F3D467539980C6B6C104B9080/0,file_size=18385]（握草，我跑了五分钟出了一组数据）"}
{"time": 1759988569, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1975442002", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“房间里应该还有个人。龙芙小姐的原话是……别看别问，别打听”"}
{"time": 1759988573, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1456442619", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "（我要遍历750组）"}
