{"time": 1760004791, "type": "recv", "message_id": "602875347", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“...斑比..酱..已经饶我..很多次了..我..受处罚...是..应该的”"}
