{"time": 1760005069, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1381835405", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=602875347]\"我给了你足够的自由。\"她依然没有露面，声音从四面八方缠绕着你，\"你要用这份自由，背叛我?\""}
{"time": 1760005091, "type": "recv", "message_id": "859949161", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（吃个饭）"}
