{"time": 1760007699, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1256967599", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1322326816]\"呵呵...\"斑比依然是那副衣着，踏着血池用房门中踱步而出，背靠着孤灯浑身罩着阴影，在黑暗中如同猩红的月光的眸子紧盯着你，\"给我?\""}
{"time": 1760007738, "type": "recv", "message_id": "206358374", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（柯艾特）"}
