{"time": 1760024636, "type": "recv", "message_id": "33201773", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=117210555]她弯下腰抱起你的同时，斑比冷冷地开口，\"这是最后一次。\""}
{"time": 1760024837, "type": "recv", "message_id": "254852678", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“谢谢诺亚，谢谢斑比...”"}
{"time": 1760024997, "type": "recv", "message_id": "317308613", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"下一次，汝将失神灭心。\"她接着补充，血液从铺开的地面收拢回她的身上，\"从最亲之人开始。\"说完你的身心都在复述这个命令，\"现在，出去。\""}
{"time": 1760025046, "type": "recv", "message_id": "908914868", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我以后会乖乖听话的....”"}
{"time": 1760025097, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2081190493", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“走吧诺亚,拜托你了”"}
{"time": 1760025508, "type": "recv", "message_id": "747400129", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（1吗）"}
{"time": 1760025535, "type": "recv", "message_id": "412165076", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（但是一会要斗魂）"}
