{"time": 1760027669, "type": "recv", "message_id": "191034611", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "轻轻的在胳膊上咬一个口子，然后拿杯子在旁边接着"}
