{"time": 1760035073, "type": "recv", "message_id": "541075147", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "尽量快点，让妃花少受一点罪"}
{"time": 1760035129, "type": "recv", "message_id": "896117379", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "倒是没多久"}
{"time": 1760035233, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1425826105", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“谢谢...妃花姐姐”还是有一点点虚弱，但比之前感觉好多了，而且妃花的血虽然自己没有喝的意思，但或多或少还是吸收了一点点“稍微等下我吧，我等会和你们..一起，诺亚把我放下来吧，我感觉.好多了”"}
{"time": 1760035404, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1710118355", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(又给你尝到了)"}
{"time": 1760035413, "type": "recv", "message_id": "573961011", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "(又给你尝到了)"}
{"time": 1760035424, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1294912027", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "(又给我尝到了)"}
{"time": 1760035448, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1077588180", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "*把柯艾特给的糖拿一颗出来塞给妃花“这个，应该有助于恢复”"}
{"time": 1760035470, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1333686850", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "那么她的血，你浅尝辄止中品到了一丝馥郁的花香，很温暖，同时有种迷离感。"}
{"time": 1760035626, "type": "recv", "message_id": "629644782", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1077588180]妃花接过，\"诶...\"没有多想吃了下去，只是片刻身体就有些肉眼可见的发热，\"有点不舒服...\"说着话的时候身上还在散发腾腾热气，不过伤口倒是开始在愈合。"}
{"time": 1760035679, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1608012378", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "小心的从诺亚身上下来“我很快就...回来”"}
{"time": 1760035717, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1398332761", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“可能……因人而异，但是应该有效的”*握着她另一只手“没事的，没事的……”"}
{"time": 1760035782, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1804304756", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(ok)"}
