{"time": 1760081607, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1066712950", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "来到房门口敲敲门"}
{"time": 1760081652, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1417104725", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“刚刚里面发生什么事了……里头的声音听着都头皮发麻……”*靠近了诺亚些“诺亚一会还得回去吗？”"}
{"time": 1760081769, "type": "recv", "message_id": "599671187", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1066712950]\"拿到我要的东西了？\"房门没有第一时间打开，里面的声音有些模糊。"}
{"time": 1760081785, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1226301256", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“拿...拿到了”"}
{"time": 1760081910, "type": "recv", "message_id": "618163879", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1417104725]\"客人禁锢了诺薇拉的部分灵魂，至少她是这么说的。\"诺亚因为有相应的命令，所以直接开口，\"身为眷属太过忤逆，这是原话。\"随后她点头，\"我会留在房间里，这是一层保险。\""}
{"time": 1760081919, "type": "recv", "message_id": "745513488", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1226301256]\"递过来。\""}
