{"time": 1760082011, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1736566468", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "打开门，然后进去找斑比"}
{"time": 1760082034, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2069027335", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "看到她直接跪下，然后双手把血递给她"}
{"time": 1760082195, "type": "recv", "message_id": "799541821", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=618163879]“你……在里面会不会有危险？”*盯着她的眼睛“不能换个人偶来吗？”"}
{"time": 1760082256, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1170006211", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2069027335]她现在倒没有那么可怕的样子，看上去像个人畜无害的小姑娘，坐在自己的床边，低头看着你的动作，伸出一只手抵在你的唇前，\"斑比还没有尝过，眷属先偷吃了一些么?\""}
{"time": 1760082292, "type": "recv", "message_id": "265011367", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（无内鬼，来点花言巧语）"}
{"time": 1760082314, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2084204773", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=799541821]\"如果龙芙小姐允许...\"她低下头避开你的视线，\"而且，如果伊芙小姐也住进去，我更应该留在里面。\""}
{"time": 1760082345, "type": "recv", "message_id": "602759250", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我...我不是故意的，对不起...请斑比酱责罚”低下头有些不敢看她"}
{"time": 1760082368, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1210788321", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（你就不能说帮她试药的（））"}
{"time": 1760082384, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1833985047", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（这样你就能进二十四孝图）"}
