{"time": 1760082421, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1669190849", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2084204773]“要是你不在这里，我就也换个房间了……”*叹了口气"}
{"time": 1760082544, "type": "recv", "message_id": "502265100", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1833985047]（别逗我笑）"}
{"time": 1760082621, "type": "recv", "message_id": "281019001", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=602759250]\"味道如何?\"她收回手，没有直接接你手里的瓶子，而是仰面躺了下去，蓬松的裙摆和金发铺开了一床。"}
{"time": 1760082656, "type": "recv", "message_id": "270662668", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1669190849]\"...\"诺亚没有接这句话，现场一时沉默了下来。"}
{"time": 1760082718, "type": "recv", "message_id": "635193161", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"那个小女孩...原来有这么残暴的一面吗？\"爱璃西雅打破沉默，慢吞吞开口，\"我以为...挺好相处。\""}
{"time": 1760082723, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1230116112", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“有...有股花香，斑比...主人应该会喜欢的..”"}
