{"time": 1760083085, "type": "recv", "message_id": "695085135", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=635193161]“她是谁？是魔族吗？是魔族吧……”"}
{"time": 1760083102, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1613186272", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1230116112]\"放在床头。\"房间里的孤灯随之熄灭，不过能在昏暗中视物的你倒是影响不大，\"错在哪?\""}
{"time": 1760083195, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1464559906", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我应该把主人的命令放在第一位....”保持着下跪状态，慢慢移动过去，把血放在床头"}
{"time": 1760083213, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1766101106", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=695085135]\"血裔...本质上也可以算是魔族吧。\"倒是诺亚开了口，\"一直有人称他们叫血魔，但他们自己更喜欢待在人类中。\""}
