{"time": 1760083478, "type": "recv", "message_id": "620057671", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=411153165]\"真是罄竹难书，对吧？\"她坐起来，瞳孔中没有之前那种厚重的侵略感，微微散发着红光，\"斑比最讨厌不听话的仆从。\""}
{"time": 1760083605, "type": "recv", "message_id": "613897123", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“请..主人惩罚我..”"}
