{"time": 1760083736, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1593449658", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1766101106]“……”抿了抿嘴，自己终究还是太过弱小，要是能和洋荷师母……不，哪怕是有卡珊德拉那样，也不至于束手无策，患得患失"}
{"time": 1760083774, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1277469427", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“谢谢...斑比酱”"}
