{"time": 1760083900, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1822423991", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（一厢情愿是这样的）"}
{"time": 1760083906, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1590311437", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(但是这绝不是死与悲伤的故事，重复的邂逅和别离，这是爱与希望的故事)"}
{"time": 1760083928, "type": "recv", "message_id": "314161596", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我会努力去做一个让斑比喜欢的眷属的”然后小心翼翼的出去"}
{"time": 1760083952, "type": "recv", "message_id": "560281166", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "正在说着，或者沉默着，你们看见诺薇拉推开门出来。"}
{"time": 1760084012, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1924552670", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "总算可以松一口气了“诺亚，现在几点了”"}
{"time": 1760084068, "type": "recv", "message_id": "885968168", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"晚上八点。\"诺亚说完，\"那么，我继续回房间了。\""}
{"time": 1760084185, "type": "recv", "message_id": "361690853", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“……嗯，注意安全”*目送着诺亚"}
{"time": 1760084239, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1295039030", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "她回到房间，关上门。走廊沉寂下来。"}
{"time": 1760084277, "type": "recv", "message_id": "492490446", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“那我们按原计划去地下室逛逛吧..”率先开口打破沉默 然后拍拍自己身上的灰"}
{"time": 1760084438, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1715770585", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“……”*没说什么，但是自己本来就在升降台附近。call一下"}
{"time": 1760084687, "type": "recv", "message_id": "603116534", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "云台带着你们缓缓下降，一时没有人说话，直到降到了大堂里。这个点没有什么人，只有前台孤零零坐着"}
