{"time": 1760086235, "type": "recv", "message_id": "406667209", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2054943469]\"...没关系...\"妃花的发热依然没有退下来，周身的温度略高，以至于扶着她的伊芙都在不自然地出汗，语气有些虚浮"}
{"time": 1760086635, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1317319263", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（龙哥呢）"}
{"time": 1760086642, "type": "recv", "message_id": "376439587", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“妃花……我是不是给你吃错东西了？”*担忧越来越重，把她放在轮椅上“应该先试一点点的……”"}
{"time": 1760086662, "type": "recv", "message_id": "539391612", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“等下问问那个面具大姐姐吧...”"}
