{"time": 1760086985, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1064272098", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“……”*倍感头疼，于是拿出柯艾特给的小册子翻找看"}
