{"time": 1760122571, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1866708448", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"...\"她没有回应你的话，\"把手抬起来。\"妃花看上去实际上完全没有力气再抬手，\"你们帮忙。\""}
{"time": 1760122771, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1003600964", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "急忙上前 轻轻帮妃花把手抬起来"}
{"time": 1760122775, "type": "recv", "message_id": "839867565", "deleted": true, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“嗯嗯，我一定……要怎么做？”"}
{"time": 1760122782, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2020141670", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（好的）"}
{"time": 1760122824, "type": "recv", "message_id": "701122821", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“嗯嗯……”*连忙照做，抬起妃花的手臂“要到什么程度？”"}
{"time": 1760123016, "type": "recv", "message_id": "411484354", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"差不多就行。\"她看了看手里的针剂，蓝光一闪，露出了针尖，递给你们，\"你们谁，拿这个扎进她血管里。\""}
{"time": 1760123038, "type": "recv", "message_id": "348433441", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "有些晕针，看向伊芙"}
{"time": 1760123069, "type": "recv", "message_id": "249734030", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“我有经验，我来”*接过针剂"}
{"time": 1760123079, "type": "recv", "message_id": "627887785", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "*找准静脉扎下"}
{"time": 1760123103, "type": "recv", "message_id": "518401597", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "闭上眼睛"}
{"time": 1760123251, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1363417288", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"行，待会自己处理掉针剂。\"她后退了几步，\"看上去你们还有活动，我就不打扰了。\""}
{"time": 1760123294, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1938568974", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“就……可以了吗？”"}
{"time": 1760123329, "type": "recv", "message_id": "304236384", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=627887785]里面是淡色接近于无色的液体，注射的时候倒是没有什么明显的阻力，\"没那么快。\""}
{"time": 1760123335, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1976666249", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“那个大姐姐，你是炼金术士吗，那你有没有什么奇特的血液啊，我可以和你换”"}
{"time": 1760123476, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1644403203", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"这是抑制剂啦，要想现在彻底抑制掉的话。\"她看向伊芙，\"需要一点纯净的龙血。\"随后她摆摆手，\"不过抑制剂两天时间打一次，两三个月也能搞定吧。\""}
{"time": 1760123497, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1285975980", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1976666249]\"不换，你有什么值得我交易的?\""}
{"time": 1760123529, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1186310581", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我自己的血啊...应该也蛮特殊的吧”"}
{"time": 1760123557, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1309365481", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“2比1 3比1 都可以...”"}
{"time": 1760123784, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1800190650", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"...\"她回过头看向你，带着些戏谑，\"如果要‘你’的血的话，我为什么不找头上那一位?\"她尤其在你字上咬了重音"}
{"time": 1760123823, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1668506860", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“两天一次……”*抿了抿嘴“我只是……想让她快点恢复……”"}
{"time": 1760123834, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1857806366", "deleted": true, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“....不想换就算了....”"}
{"time": 1760123892, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1956254324", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“好吧....打扰你了”看她好像没有那个意思，那就算了吧"}
{"time": 1760124011, "type": "recv", "message_id": "329508113", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"如果你从中得到一些教训，那就再好不过。想到某人还要系统学习炼成，咦惹。\"她剜了一眼伊芙，\"所以慢慢等吧，她身上也不止这点小问题。\""}
{"time": 1760124082, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1367240143", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"加把劲。\"她低下头扫了一眼诺维拉，\"别想着用我的血讨好吸血鬼，我不愿意，谁也不给。\""}
{"time": 1760124132, "type": "recv", "message_id": "467635530", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“对不起...”"}
{"time": 1760124168, "type": "recv", "message_id": "94291267", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“这……这我也知道。但是我……不知道该怎么做。她身上的东西，我无从下手”"}
{"time": 1760124325, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1580544248", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"...\"她轻轻噗嗤了一声，紧接着偏过脑袋不自觉地笑了一下，\"你以为我晚上喊你下来干什么?\"她转过身往着酒店外走去，\"人太多，现在没兴趣了。\""}
{"time": 1760124585, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1103520030", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“……谢谢你，柯艾特小姐……”*说不出更别扭的话，在安顿好妃花后便朝着她的背影鞠一躬"}
{"time": 1760124617, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1689246461", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“妃花姐姐这样...要不先回去休息吧”"}
{"time": 1760124867, "type": "recv", "message_id": "325455562", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"学院明天开放的话...\"爱璃西雅抱着手臂思考。\n妃花在注射完之后动静小了很多，不过依然有些发热症状"}
{"time": 1760124940, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1944216526", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“明天你去学院的时候，我送送你吧...”"}
{"time": 1760125000, "type": "recv", "message_id": "110703703", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯...\"爱璃西雅吐出口气，\"今晚大概也没什么兴致了，回去吗？\""}
{"time": 1760125038, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1418597649", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“先把妃花姐姐送回去吧”"}
{"time": 1760125177, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1405712870", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“嗯……但是原来的房间，应该……”"}
{"time": 1760125248, "type": "recv", "message_id": "776136228", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“那来我们房间挤一挤？晚上艾璃西雅姐姐和西莉丝姐姐睡一起，你和妃花姐姐睡一起，然后我睡沙发就好了...”"}
{"time": 1760125323, "type": "recv", "message_id": "942628185", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"...\""}
{"time": 1760125480, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2099802469", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(这里应该不是我接吧？)"}
{"time": 1760125560, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1220861642", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（其实我比较好奇为什么态度转变这么大）"}
{"time": 1760125586, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1716644543", "deleted": true, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“……？你在和我说话呢？”"}
{"time": 1760125590, "type": "recv", "message_id": "149869020", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "(我之前都说了暂时不会针对你)"}
