{"time": 1760126247, "type": "recv", "message_id": "783142597", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:at,qq=1040972910] 虽然没开灯，但是你看见桌上贴着一个便签"}
{"time": 1760126268, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1636013876", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "把灯顺手打开，然后看看便签写的什么"}
{"time": 1760126400, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1252397581", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "西里斯的字迹，只有寥寥一行字，\"不用担心，今晚不回来。\""}
{"time": 1760126453, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1287295044", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（今晚就给你下毒（）"}
{"time": 1760126465, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1134573341", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（但是你现在好像毒不死）"}
{"time": 1760126521, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2016613201", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "希望西莉丝姐姐不会出事，最近感觉发生了好多危险的事情，不过自己有在西莉丝姐姐身上留印记...摇摇头，应该没什么事吧"}
{"time": 1760126563, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1475902365", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(诶嘿，要是半夜印记炸了，你没醒不是很爽)"}
{"time": 1760126611, "type": "recv", "message_id": "611323894", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "但是以防万一，要不晚上不睡好了"}
{"time": 1760126627, "type": "recv", "message_id": "88562444", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（）"}
{"time": 1760126633, "type": "recv", "message_id": "685844460", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（厉害）"}
{"time": 1760126697, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2088033321", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "一直等到西莉丝姐姐回来就好...然后时刻去感受那个印记"}
{"time": 1760126738, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1826168356", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(厉害)"}
{"time": 1760126753, "type": "recv", "message_id": "246887388", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“西里斯不回来？她的房间可以借住吗？”"}
{"time": 1760126801, "type": "recv", "message_id": "547834817", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"两个房间。\"爱璃西雅看了一眼，妃花在轮椅上已经睡了过去，\"都有配套的浴室...嗯...\"在借住房间这一点上她有些犹豫"}
{"time": 1760126866, "type": "recv", "message_id": "130368411", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“你们住艾璃西雅姐姐的房间吧...”不太想让伊芙她们睡西莉丝姐姐的房间，艾璃西雅姐姐的话倒是没有那么介意“可以吗，艾璃西雅姐姐，你去睡西莉丝姐姐的房间”"}
{"time": 1760127011, "type": "recv", "message_id": "822027088", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"我倒是没意见...\""}
{"time": 1760127146, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1807765471", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“我在哪都行”*推着妃花的轮椅“确认她没事后，说不定我就回那边了”"}
{"time": 1760127295, "type": "recv", "message_id": "830465959", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“那就这样吧，今天要不就先休息了..明早是不是还得早起来着”"}
{"time": 1760127353, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2014798207", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "那么你们分开，房间倒是没什么特别的，毕竟才住一天。"}
{"time": 1760127401, "type": "recv", "message_id": "300167298", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“艾璃西雅姐姐，我就睡外面了...”"}
{"time": 1760127438, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1433571796", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1807765471]妃花在轮椅上已经睡了过去，脑袋歪歪地靠在椅背，头发散乱在空气中，此时已经没有明显的发热迹象，不过这身衣服浸着汗水，想来有点不好处理"}
{"time": 1760127452, "type": "recv", "message_id": "733881656", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=300167298]\"咦?诺诺不跟姐姐睡吗？\""}
{"time": 1760127474, "type": "recv", "message_id": "267356321", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我害怕万一梦游咬你一口...”"}
{"time": 1760127517, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1327266324", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "*想了想，还是轻轻拍醒她“至少到床上来睡吧？”"}
{"time": 1760127658, "type": "recv", "message_id": "734949393", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=267356321]\"没事。\"她表情轻松，\"还是说，不想和姐姐一起?这可能是最后一次咯?\""}
{"time": 1760127700, "type": "recv", "message_id": "938025826", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“不会是..最后一次的...而且我还不是很困，姐姐先去睡吧”"}
{"time": 1760127741, "type": "recv", "message_id": "258752028", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1327266324]\"咕...唔唔...\"发出了几声奇怪的声音之后，她才慢慢抬起了一侧的眼皮，露出有些黯淡的翠色眸子，\"...\"下意识对着你张开双手，眼睛同时再次合上了"}
{"time": 1760127795, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1798688931", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=938025826]\"诶?\"她佯装可惜，\"那就没办法了，呜呜，原来姐姐也会被嫌弃。\""}
{"time": 1760127869, "type": "recv", "message_id": "625225768", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=258752028]“嗯，我来吧”*从正面抱起她，把她放到床上"}
{"time": 1760127875, "type": "recv", "message_id": "215623157", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我没有啦...”但是艾璃西雅姐姐说的也对，有可能甚至是最后在一起的时光了“好吧，那我晚上和姐姐睡一起...”"}
{"time": 1760128090, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1854241962", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=625225768]抱着她的时候能感觉到裙装的上摆和衬子有些潮湿，不过她也没睁开眼，安安静静地躺在床上，像是绘本里的人物"}
{"time": 1760128127, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1084646794", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=215623157]\"那快去洗漱吧？\"她推着你进了房间，鼻子尖的你还能嗅到一点西里斯身上的味道"}
{"time": 1760128209, "type": "recv", "message_id": "515196423", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1854241962]“……对不起”*躺在她旁边，用不可能听不见的音量道歉"}
{"time": 1760128213, "type": "recv", "message_id": "640146001", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“嗯...”问到这个味道感觉有些开心，总算感觉到放松了一点，然后去洗漱了"}
{"time": 1760128239, "type": "recv", "message_id": "268008029", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(怎么不帮她换衣服)"}
{"time": 1760128349, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2107179060", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=515196423]\"...\"回答你的是稳定的呼吸音，抑制剂说不定不止抑制了药效"}
{"time": 1760128363, "type": "recv", "message_id": "39847504", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（因为没有必要也换不了啊）"}
{"time": 1760128459, "type": "recv", "message_id": "367261033", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=640146001]你们交替洗漱好，被子里有着更浓郁的西里斯的味道，爱璃西雅拉开窗帘，靠着床背坐下，今天的月色很明亮，从这个角度，还能看见法师塔的点点灯火"}
{"time": 1760128471, "type": "recv", "message_id": "194256398", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=39847504](其实可以吧)"}
{"time": 1760128476, "type": "recv", "message_id": "712752346", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(你上下其手)"}
{"time": 1760128528, "type": "recv", "message_id": "624530552", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2107179060]“……”*多少也有些睡不着，但是也不好开灯。留个字条，然后轻手轻脚地拿上册子去诺亚那边"}
{"time": 1760128653, "type": "recv", "message_id": "184072269", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(你就是这么看护病人的?)"}
{"time": 1760128662, "type": "recv", "message_id": "535647404", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我会永远记着姐姐的.. ”"}
{"time": 1760128681, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1159473719", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=624530552]总之，你站在了方块门前"}
{"time": 1760128695, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1768416887", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“姐姐也不要忘了我”"}
{"time": 1760128720, "type": "recv", "message_id": "747332544", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=184072269]（嘻嘻）"}
{"time": 1760128738, "type": "recv", "message_id": "421574471", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=535647404]月光温柔地照进室内，洒在她的脸上，\"嗯...不过总感觉说出这种话会发生什么不好的事情...\""}
{"time": 1760128755, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1889896794", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（但是做都做了）"}
{"time": 1760128840, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1703027832", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "*不用敲门，直接用钥匙开门咯"}
{"time": 1760128875, "type": "recv", "message_id": "938069135", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“呸呸呸...不要说这种不吉利的话啦”"}
{"time": 1760128970, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1251555246", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1703027832]出乎意料，室内点着灯，一身洋装的金发女孩，无害地坐在沙发上摇晃着身子，诺亚坐在她旁边，手里捧着故事书，听见开门声，她转过头看向你。"}
{"time": 1760129016, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1356266285", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=938069135]\"明明是诺诺先说的吧？\"她轻轻笑了一下，\"我应该...不要紧...不过我其实也很怕啦...和她们再见面，然后...姐姐肯定会说我的\""}
{"time": 1760129097, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1986748263", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“她们...是那些“朋友”吗，果然我还是帮姐姐教训一下她们吧..”"}
{"time": 1760129124, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1045228989", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1251555246]“呃？晚上……好？”*一时有些不知道该怎么做，甚至有当场原路离开的想法，但还是硬着头皮走了进去“我以为您休息了，就没有敲门”"}
{"time": 1760129220, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1458075373", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1986748263]\"好啦好啦。\"她对着你伸出手"}
{"time": 1760129282, "type": "recv", "message_id": "891935883", "deleted": true, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "牵住她的手...."}
{"time": 1760129331, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1748462935", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1045228989]\"...\"金发的女孩头顶有着显眼的红色小翅膀，她这时才转过头，眸子猩红，\"哦，来这里做什么?\""}
{"time": 1760129342, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1728840484", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=891935883](不是把脑袋放在手下面?)"}
{"time": 1760129365, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1197176354", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嘛，我现在也算有自信了一些。\""}
{"time": 1760129371, "type": "recv", "message_id": "277781126", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "微微低下头"}
{"time": 1760129382, "type": "recv", "message_id": "259591171", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(只是没get到，都行吧)"}
{"time": 1760129407, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1219122395", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“嗯...我相信姐姐”"}
{"time": 1760129433, "type": "recv", "message_id": "419765558", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1748462935]“睡不着，所以打算找个能开灯的地方看书”*扬了扬手上的册子，凑到诺亚旁边。“还有看看诺亚”"}
{"time": 1760129456, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1280505799", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "她的手放在你的脑袋上，避开了蝙蝠耳朵，\"之后要好好跟着西里斯小姐，她很可靠。\""}
{"time": 1760129587, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1676630343", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“嗯嗯...姐姐也很可靠呢”"}
{"time": 1760129589, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1650823569", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=419765558]\"好无聊。\"虽然这么说，语气却没什么变化，她从沙发上跳下来，拍拍嘴巴，\"我睡觉了，别吵。\"她三步做两步回了自己的房间，进门的瞬间房门自动合上。"}
{"time": 1760129722, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1584356953", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "*有些心有余悸地看着她回去才松了口气，很快被故事书吸引了注意力“诺亚，之前在讲故事？”"}
{"time": 1760129750, "type": "recv", "message_id": "476777454", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "书名当然是赫赫有名的"}
{"time": 1760129776, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1331299119", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "《Dracula》"}
{"time": 1760129814, "type": "recv", "message_id": "933273647", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"国王成为吸血鬼的故事...不过斑比小姐好像很讨厌里面的猎人们。\"诺亚的声音很低"}
{"time": 1760129846, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1761423690", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1676630343]\"我一点都不可靠啦。\"她躺进被窝，\"嘻嘻...诺诺捂得很暖和呢。\""}
{"time": 1760130021, "type": "recv", "message_id": "788197602", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=933273647]“嗯……”其实完全没有在听故事，而是在盯着她那和自己发色同色的眼睛“嗯……还行……我是说真好”"}
{"time": 1760130065, "type": "recv", "message_id": "869620799", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“姐姐...”不要走好不好，但终究还是说不出口“冷的话可以抱着我，我自己也蛮暖和的”"}
{"time": 1760130136, "type": "recv", "message_id": "701917050", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=788197602]\"...\"她的瞳孔和你对视，水晶映这你的瞳孔，声音依然很低，\"我们很快就会分开，伊芙小姐，请不要在我这里耽误太多时间。\""}
{"time": 1760130204, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1697905659", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=869620799]\"不要诶，一般都是妹妹抱着姐姐吧，这样显得姐姐很可靠。\"她在被子里挪动了一下，挪到你旁边，洗完澡的身子香香软软的，\"可以抱我哦?\""}
{"time": 1760130342, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1900893235", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“好吧，那我就抱着最可靠的姐姐睡了”轻轻抱起她，同时能闻到爱莉希雅姐姐身上的香味，以及西莉丝姐姐留下的香味..很舒服“抱着姐姐睡的话，我应该就抢不了被子了”"}
{"time": 1760130434, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1898754061", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=701917050]“我知道的”*撇了撇嘴“但是知道了也可以再看几眼嘛……虽然我真的是为了要看书才过来……而且怎么算耽误？在你旁边，我会比较安心”"}
{"time": 1760130483, "type": "recv", "message_id": "285344315", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1900893235]她的发丝垂落在你的鼻尖，带着鲜花的香味，\"嗯...偶尔抢一点也可以啦...谁让我是姐姐呢...\"体温很温暖，香香软软甜甜"}
{"time": 1760130523, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1648969983", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1898754061]\"妃花小姐呢？\"诺亚收起故事书，站起身开始清理桌面"}
{"time": 1760130565, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1665695536", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“晚安，姐姐”很快便沉溺在温柔乡中，眼皮越来越重，要陷入沉眠了"}
{"time": 1760130633, "type": "recv", "message_id": "970464198", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“她暂时稳定了些，现在睡着了。”*翻动着纸页，研究着柯艾特的作品"}
{"time": 1760130699, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1171622963", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=970464198]\"伊芙不应该陪在她那里吗？\"诺亚重置了桌上的摆设，开始进一步打扫室内"}
{"time": 1760130705, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1413086516", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1665695536](诶)"}
{"time": 1760130714, "type": "recv", "message_id": "656999852", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(那如果现在，生命线挑动了会怎么样)"}
{"time": 1760130723, "type": "recv", "message_id": "237235955", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（何意？）"}
{"time": 1760130842, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1655870144", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(生命岂能安眠)"}
{"time": 1760130930, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1814517607", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1171622963]“嗯，本来大概应该是的吧。”*苦笑着摇头“但是在那里有点没法安心……因为我的疏忽，伤害到了她。所以……只是来这里避一避，晚些我还得回去守着”"}
{"time": 1760131026, "type": "recv", "message_id": "582842955", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1814517607]\"伊芙应该多注意一下妃花小姐。\"她清扫完室内，坐在你旁边，隔了一些距离，\"她身上缠着的东西，柯艾特小姐认为是置换的产物。\""}
{"time": 1760131036, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1221465818", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1665695536]过你的天选骰吧"}
{"time": 1760131130, "type": "recv", "message_id": "19907595", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1221465818]（这是什么）"}
