{"time": 1760131132, "type": "reply", "message_id": "1242401678", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": 2875548981, "name": "小雅"}, "message": "[诺薇拉]演奏出: 1D20=17"}
{"time": 1760131246, "type": "recv", "message_id": "597762481", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(可惜)"}
{"time": 1760131254, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1135411642", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“我姑且还是看得出来有东西不对劲的嘛，这不是在研究解决办法”*叹了口气“真是的，放手也不肯干脆……”"}
{"time": 1760131257, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1224508902", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "()"}
{"time": 1760131315, "type": "recv", "message_id": "573531654", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "那么你睡得挺安稳的，你感觉到她轻轻地反手抱住你，你的脑袋搭在她的肩膀旁，困意翻涌"}
{"time": 1760131342, "type": "recv", "message_id": "126510714", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "(难道不是越高越好吗)"}
{"time": 1760131397, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1508849813", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1135411642]\"嗯...\"她点头，随后不再开口，同时闭上了眼睛。"}
{"time": 1760131410, "type": "recv", "message_id": "246306827", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=126510714](对啊，就是太高了导致没出事我才可惜的)"}
{"time": 1760131556, "type": "recv", "message_id": "221208384", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1508849813]空气中流动着熏香，静寂的春夜里，室内却没有什么冷意。只剩下你翻动书页的声音。"}
{"time": 1760131654, "type": "recv", "message_id": "596019396", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（睡了，晚安）"}
