{"time": 1760267290, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1350665528", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1812085395]\"没必要...\"她的声音清晰了一些，\"做你自己想做的事，必要的时候，我会告诉你。\""}
{"time": 1760267617, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1205177484", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“行吧行吧”*揉了揉脸“妃花要不要，先洗漱一番？昨天出了那么多汗……今天打算进学院咯”"}
{"time": 1760267738, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1456252595", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1895627346]她穿着白色的睡衣从浴室出来，\"嗯?这么白的衣服吗？\""}
{"time": 1760267792, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1667582502", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“感觉蛮适合爱璃西雅姐姐的”"}
