{"time": 1760273513, "type": "recv", "message_id": "914851683", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(活了)"}
{"time": 1760273706, "type": "recv", "message_id": "826393379", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1667582502]\"诶...?\"你感觉她现在精神了不少，\"看上去很像是公主殿下会穿的呢...\""}
{"time": 1760273956, "type": "recv", "message_id": "985681810", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“姐姐就是我的公主啦”说出这句话后，希望镇的那个下午忽然又浮现在脑海里...不禁感觉有些恍惚，要是露露也在就好了...拍拍自己的脸颊，都过去了，现在自己不断向前走就好了"}
{"time": 1760273961, "type": "recv", "message_id": "765405090", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1205177484]\"唔...妃花待在酒店里就好，洗漱...\"她看向你，\"嗯嗯，伊芙不用管的，我会自己处理好。"}
{"time": 1760274192, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1170246590", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=985681810](好的，感觉渣得不行)"}
{"time": 1760274227, "type": "recv", "message_id": "725326729", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1170246590]（自从我同时喜欢西莉丝和里榭娜的时候，我就已经回不了头了）"}
{"time": 1760274259, "type": "recv", "message_id": "548457441", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=765405090]“真的，不一起去？学院里有意思的事情应该……啊，妃花是不是看过？”"}
{"time": 1760274267, "type": "recv", "message_id": "576906784", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（但是艾璃西雅 她只是我的姐姐～姐姐说白色很有韵味）"}
{"time": 1760274632, "type": "recv", "message_id": "81666363", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=985681810]\"那诺诺现在就是我的骑士?\"她轻轻笑了笑，\"不过魔宠可做不成骑士大人呢\""}
{"time": 1760274751, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1571769007", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“姐姐带个帽子？我躲你帽子里”更恍惚了，有种走马灯的感觉...急忙转移话题"}
{"time": 1760275011, "type": "recv", "message_id": "887691286", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1571769007]\"诶...诺诺有什么心事吗？\"她拿起码好的连衣裙，\"嗯...做什么头发呢?\""}
{"time": 1760275066, "type": "recv", "message_id": "122539288", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“想起了过去的一些事情..姐姐什么头发都挺好看的”"}
{"time": 1760275354, "type": "recv", "message_id": "276771993", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=548457441]\"看过...看过一些..\"她回答得很慢，\"所以..\"挤出笑容，\"伊芙赶紧去吧?我没关系的。\""}
{"time": 1760275569, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1372437069", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=122539288]\"诶，但是今天总不能不做头发吧？小诺诺有什么点子吗？\""}
{"time": 1760275578, "type": "recv", "message_id": "149820445", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“看过和亲身经历肯定不一样的吧，今天去的人会很多”*顿了顿“而且你一个人在这，多少有点担心”"}
{"time": 1760275749, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1514344707", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“就长发，然后部分盘起来？”"}
{"time": 1760276437, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1267603893", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=149820445]\"...\"她低下脑袋，\"可是...我只会添麻烦...\""}
{"time": 1760276487, "type": "recv", "message_id": "408084446", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1514344707]\"可以...可以吗？算了，总之诺诺上手试试吧。\"她拿着连衣裙，准备脱掉简单的白色睡衣开始穿"}
{"time": 1760276539, "type": "recv", "message_id": "836445727", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“那我试试...我好像还是第一次帮别人绑头发来着”"}
{"time": 1760276564, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1781023674", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "转个身，不看她换衣服"}
{"time": 1760276578, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1552390504", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“姐姐换好了说一声”"}
{"time": 1760276705, "type": "recv", "message_id": "159514341", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1267603893]“……”*不加掩饰地有些失落“好吧，好吧。听你的”"}
{"time": 1760277013, "type": "recv", "message_id": "986929817", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1552390504]衣物稀疏地落下来，紧接着被她扔到你面前的床上，\"诶...好麻烦的衣服...\"你听到衣服翻动的哗啦啦声音"}
{"time": 1760277081, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1454554956", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=159514341]\"...\"她抿了抿嘴唇，\"如果伊芙...真的想妃花也去的话...\""}
{"time": 1760277085, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1227213155", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "有一点点想看..但是自己是有原则的人，面壁思过..."}
{"time": 1760277381, "type": "recv", "message_id": "301131629", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1454554956]“……”*叹了口气，摇了摇头“没什么，都行”"}
{"time": 1760277986, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1244937087", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1227213155]\"诶...\"你听到她的脚步越来越近"}
{"time": 1760278141, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1000298913", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“姐姐衣服换好了？”"}
{"time": 1760278293, "type": "recv", "message_id": "372452244", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=301131629]\"...\"她躺了下来，给自己盖上被子，\"那，伊芙去忙吧...不用管我的，我会好好照顾自己。\""}
{"time": 1760278538, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2121703250", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1000298913]\"呃...拉链，我拉不到。\"她的脚步停在你身后，\"诺诺帮我拉一下\""}
{"time": 1760278571, "type": "recv", "message_id": "76228757", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“哦哦，好的”松一口气，转身过去帮她拉拉链"}
{"time": 1760278711, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2121146773", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=372452244]“你……真的能吗？哎……不行，我去找一趟龙芙小姐……”"}
{"time": 1760278881, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1099884026", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=76228757]她背对着你，粉色的长发下，背后的拉链一直从颈后到腰身，你可以完整看清她的纤细腰身"}
{"time": 1760278938, "type": "recv", "message_id": "534351337", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "屏住呼吸...小心的拉拉链，防止夹住肉或者头发，心无杂念 心无杂念..."}
{"time": 1760279002, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1645073401", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“好了，艾璃西雅姐姐...”"}
{"time": 1760279030, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1135144203", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“那你坐凳子上吧，我帮你绑下头发”"}
