{"time": 1760279177, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2047168481", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=534351337]拉链的缝隙中隐隐透着她细嫩的皮肤，指尖接触间，隐隐有些发热。"}
