{"time": 1760290756, "type": "recv", "message_id": "807005771", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（我之前都没姐姐吧）"}
{"time": 1760290877, "type": "recv", "message_id": "471811863", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=942146984]*表情有些僵住“……之前诺亚还说，要送我回家的”"}
{"time": 1760290988, "type": "recv", "message_id": "712080207", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1199388332]\"诶...之前没人帮诺诺编过头发吗？\"她往前走一步，牵起自己的裙摆转了一圈，粉色的头发飞舞，看上去很有公主的感觉"}
{"time": 1760291038, "type": "recv", "message_id": "698040988", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“重点是姐姐啦..我应该算..呃，独生子女”"}
{"time": 1760291044, "type": "recv", "message_id": "419906078", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=471811863]\"伊芙也知道，这座城市并不安全的现在...那位大人那里或许可以直接离开。\"她低着头不看你，\"诺亚会为你祝福\""}
{"time": 1760291279, "type": "recv", "message_id": "40399437", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=698040988]\"嗯哼?西里斯姐姐没帮你理过头发吗？\"她放下自己的裙子，\"那就坐好哦\""}
{"time": 1760291374, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1475931247", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“emmm，好像没有哎，不过我也不把西莉丝姐姐当姐姐来看，毕竟....”脸有点红，不好意思继续说下去"}
{"time": 1760291515, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2125376671", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1475931247]\"我不听不听。\"她摇着脑袋，同时双手搭在你肩膀上摇晃着你的身子，\"诶?要是诺诺是变成蝙蝠跟着我，那有必要穿衣服或者编头发吗\""}
{"time": 1760291561, "type": "recv", "message_id": "962935661", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“有吧..万一我不小心变回去的话，我可不想太丢脸....”"}
{"time": 1760291584, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1318958531", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“……我……我不是那么需要安全，我已经习惯冒险了，我……”*攥着拳头“我不会把这当成最后一面的”"}
{"time": 1760291618, "type": "recv", "message_id": "436301874", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=962935661]\"变身的时候本来也没有衣服吧？\"她眨眨眼"}
{"time": 1760291649, "type": "recv", "message_id": "264050843", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“不一样啦..变身之后不是毛茸茸的么，那也算衣服啦”"}
{"time": 1760291670, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1197539712", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1318958531]\"你是不是还有不得不见的人?有吧?伊芙也说过。\"她轻轻摇头，\"有必须回去的地方。\""}
{"time": 1760291681, "type": "recv", "message_id": "526033688", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=264050843](我虽然觉得不算)"}
