{"time": 1760292688, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1181920147", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=249162892]\"你也听到人偶的话了吧？\"卡珊德拉的声音幽幽传到你耳边，\"你抱着绝对能回来的信心吗？\""}
{"time": 1760292804, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1708312860", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "等待编好头发"}
{"time": 1760292936, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1628805479", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1708312860]\"唔..\"她抓起你的头发，手指灵巧地绕来绕去，不过还是一边询问，\"待会要变成蝙蝠吗？\""}
{"time": 1760292983, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1224541471", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“嗯..我想多陪姐姐一段时间，变成蝙蝠应该更方便些”"}
{"time": 1760293015, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1206864027", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1181920147]“……我早就该知道的，她都离不开房间，还怎么送我……”*低着头，看自己的鞋子“但都骗了我一回……就不能骗到底么？”"}
{"time": 1760293188, "type": "recv", "message_id": "781763279", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1206864027]\"除了她之外。\"你的右手指着自己的右腿，\"你知道我的意思的。\""}
{"time": 1760293253, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1738219035", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1224541471]她松了手，\"噗...那我不是白忙活?\"说完她摘下你头发上的皮筋，\"那就，现在跟我一起出门吧？\""}
{"time": 1760293307, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1877397893", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“等我一小下”"}
