{"time": 1760293396, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1200494319", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "去卫生间脱下自己的衣服，然后尝试用血模拟那套衣服"}
