{"time": 1760293815, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1441963359", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1547952561]“开心就……为什么不走呢？我……”*在台子上直挺挺地站着“她自己拒绝的。我已经问过她了”"}
{"time": 1760293933, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1679533812", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "居然意外的感觉蛮简单的，不过感觉好神奇，明明是血做的，摸起来却是布的质感，小心的折叠好衣服原件，然后带着出去，放进衣柜里"}
{"time": 1760293952, "type": "recv", "message_id": "826211719", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“艾璃西雅姐姐，我的两把剑你可以帮我带上吗”"}
{"time": 1760294094, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1751201867", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（主要是，前两天才被诺薇菈追着喂饭）"}
{"time": 1760294109, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1616114784", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（现在对一厢情愿的做法没有好感）"}
{"time": 1760294178, "type": "recv", "message_id": "667176058", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1441963359]\"带上她吧，不回来的话，她要等到什么时候。\"你的右手摆弄着胸针，\"那孩子不想麻烦到别人，不过，都到这种时候了...\"她随手抛起胸针上那枚华贵的蓝宝石，\"落地之前，你还可以思考。\""}
{"time": 1760294213, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1970956465", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=826211719]\"好吧...\"她有些无语地提起来，\"我们又不是去找茬，这也要带吗\""}
{"time": 1760294293, "type": "recv", "message_id": "171223893", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "写个纸条“西莉丝姐姐，我陪艾璃西雅姐姐去学院了..如果你退房的话，帮我把衣柜里的那件送我的衣服带走.. 联系我的话可以用那个印记—最最最喜欢你的诺诺”"}
{"time": 1760294348, "type": "recv", "message_id": "990385213", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“这两把剑对我很重要啦，不想和它们分开，谢谢你啦，姐姐”wink"}
{"time": 1760294365, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1872066929", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "然后变成小蝙蝠，趴到她的头顶"}
{"time": 1760294400, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1482180329", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=667176058]“喂太快……我……”*下意识去接那胸针"}
{"time": 1760294459, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1099633630", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=171223893]\"那么，我们就出发吧。\""}
{"time": 1760294480, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1969614401", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“姐姐带个帽子...我不想被太阳晒死”"}
{"time": 1760294526, "type": "recv", "message_id": "168659659", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1482180329]胸针高悬于空，离落地只剩下或被你接住大概还要一两秒，\"...\"她此刻也没有说话"}
{"time": 1760294596, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1154077549", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1969614401]\"呃...\"她翻找出一顶装饰着蓝色蝴蝶结的草帽，\"那就这样?\""}
{"time": 1760294644, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1892677890", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（那我能怎么办呢，拍上行键吗）"}
{"time": 1760294660, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1385318059", "deleted": true, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“嗯嗯...我们出发吧”飞到她的头顶趴下"}
{"time": 1760294678, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1186987924", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“嗯嗯...我们出发吧”"}
{"time": 1760294709, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2003124770", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "掀起一个小小的缝，然后小声说话“姐姐能听到我的声音吗”"}
{"time": 1760294845, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1787387667", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=168659659]“啊真是的，去就去嘛！”"}
