{"time": 1760295040, "type": "recv", "message_id": "209735596", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(干嘛，情节到这了)"}
{"time": 1760295060, "type": "recv", "message_id": "435021251", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(难道卡珊德拉是i人吗)"}
{"time": 1760295076, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1425578174", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2003124770]她点点脑袋，你跟着摇晃起来"}
{"time": 1760295103, "type": "recv", "message_id": "239600370", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“那出发吧”依旧小声"}
{"time": 1760295145, "type": "recv", "message_id": "400029638", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1787387667]*重新按下上行的按钮"}
{"time": 1760295312, "type": "recv", "message_id": "757964802", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1787387667]你听见自己的一声轻笑，胸针稳稳地落在自己不知何时伸出的左手，\"不要让自己后悔。\""}
{"time": 1760295325, "type": "recv", "message_id": "289682747", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(你接着动吧)"}
{"time": 1760295350, "type": "recv", "message_id": "787633089", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=239600370]她带着你出了门，到了客厅，\"嗯...我们要去叫一下妃花小姐和伊芙小姐吗？\""}
{"time": 1760295404, "type": "recv", "message_id": "719577765", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“emmm，那就去吧，正好看看妃花小姐恢复的怎么样了”"}
{"time": 1760295410, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1674472290", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=757964802]“这话你该去对她说才对……”*等回到四楼，去开房间门"}
{"time": 1760295520, "type": "recv", "message_id": "329723877", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(哪个房间)"}
{"time": 1760295542, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1810819754", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（在住的）"}
{"time": 1760295571, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1044216680", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "你推开门，看见正独自站在客厅的爱璃西雅"}
{"time": 1760295627, "type": "recv", "message_id": "702460234", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“哦，醒了，准备出门？”*并没有等回答的打算，说实话也不能算在提问，直接拐进自己的房间"}
{"time": 1760295701, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1119778999", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“好像不用我们叫了”"}
{"time": 1760295747, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1380686295", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "爱璃西雅看了看她，也没有接话，只是轻轻点点头，\"我们走吧。\""}
{"time": 1760295779, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2147462783", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“走吧，上学去咯”"}
{"time": 1760295799, "type": "recv", "message_id": "862303415", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=702460234]房间里还是离开时的样子，没有拉开窗帘，室内有些昏暗，被子里蜷缩着一个人大小的包"}
{"time": 1760295870, "type": "recv", "message_id": "748688456", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "*先把窗帘拉开，然后拉开衣柜，挑选一下衣服，故意弄出不小的动静"}
{"time": 1760296026, "type": "recv", "message_id": "844955309", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=748688456]\"...\"被子里轻轻咳了咳，微微抖动了几下"}
{"time": 1760296061, "type": "recv", "message_id": "746050822", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2147462783]窗外阳光明媚，离正午时分还差一会，草帽有些透光，不过勉强可以忍受"}
{"time": 1760296150, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1247420948", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=844955309]“妃花今天想穿什么？”*给自己挑一身白色的罩袍，装作不经意地开口"}
{"time": 1760296328, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1021621951", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1247420948]\"不出门的话...\"她冒出脑袋，像是只小兔子，\"什么都可以...伊芙怎么回来了...\""}
{"time": 1760296403, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1610097234", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=746050822][CQ:at,qq=1252219916] “艾璃西雅姐姐心情怎么样”"}
{"time": 1760296455, "type": "recv", "message_id": "512875186", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“稍微打扮一下……我也是第一次去这种场合。”*顿了顿“妃花见过几次，应该比我有经验些？”"}
{"time": 1760296558, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1561590322", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1610097234]\"早上不是都说过了?\"她微微扣住草帽，沿着广场的路前往学院，今天路上人依然不怎么多"}
{"time": 1760296630, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1223686160", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“明明上次去学院就是前两天的事情，但感觉发生了好多好多事情”"}
{"time": 1760296742, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1916761157", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=512875186]\"没有啦...那种都是在梦里。\"她好像重新缩了回去，声音闷闷的"}
{"time": 1760296789, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1161496001", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1223686160]\"嗯...不过真的会这么平静吗...\"她皱起眉看向倒塌的法师塔，\"有些奇怪。\""}
{"time": 1760296851, "type": "recv", "message_id": "660553156", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“怎么了...艾璃西雅姐姐发现了什么吗”"}
{"time": 1760296974, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1974257281", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1916761157]“明明现在亲身经历的机会就在眼前？”*坐到床边“如果是之前那样，你能借用我的身体也就算了”"}
{"time": 1760297003, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1623342351", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1974257281]\"但是...\"她的话哽住，你也知道她想说什么"}
{"time": 1760297025, "type": "recv", "message_id": "985895259", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=660553156]\"没...只是在想...宣扬暴力的那一位，去哪了?\""}
{"time": 1760297066, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1364672110", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“也许在她的领地待着，酝酿什么巨大的阴谋？”"}
