{"time": 1760299313, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1461915132", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2130248162]\"很好看...妃花可以穿这么好的衣服吗...\"她的声音有些不自信，\"而且...好难穿...\""}
{"time": 1760299421, "type": "recv", "message_id": "131096975", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“姐姐很棒哎，不过那个学姐人看起来还不错的样子...姐姐怎么这么害怕，难道姐姐是社恐吗？但姐姐一开始看到我感觉很热情么...”"}
{"time": 1760299436, "type": "recv", "message_id": "144483485", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1461915132]“喔，我都好久没想过这个问题了，房费好像还是西里斯小姐垫的。嘛，之后再找机会还就是了。”*摇摇头“不管了，妃花之前洗漱好了吗？”"}
{"time": 1760299502, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1193114184", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=131096975]\"学姐...学长...都是很厉害的人...我不行的啦。\"她的声音抖抖的"}
{"time": 1760299527, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1317449766", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“哎，姐姐觉得我不厉害吗”"}
{"time": 1760299540, "type": "recv", "message_id": "747710979", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(嘻嘻)"}
{"time": 1760299582, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2137667682", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=144483485]\"没...\""}
{"time": 1760299620, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1073700302", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1317449766]\"不...不是啦...只是诺诺毕竟不是学院的人吧...不会魔法...不不，我不是这个意思。\"她看上去有些混乱"}
{"time": 1760299628, "type": "recv", "message_id": "391715351", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“姐姐也很厉害啦..而且我现在是姐姐的魔宠，现在也就是姐姐的力量”"}
{"time": 1760299730, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2031606890", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2137667682]“嗯……怎么也得洗一下吧，虽然不会有怪味道，但是身上总会不舒服吧？”*出房间看看这个房间的人偶在不在"}
{"time": 1760299800, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1658014508", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2031606890]在的在的"}
{"time": 1760299847, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1061034178", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=391715351]\"...不行不行...\"她捂着自己的肩膀，还是不敢看其他人，\"大家不会喜欢我的...\""}
{"time": 1760299907, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1563887079", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“为什么，姐姐是很有魅力的人啊，我就很喜欢姐姐”在她头上滚滚就像抚摸一样"}
{"time": 1760299929, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1735058505", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:image,file=D2F4A4A00CF5BAA1660B26872A39BC01.jpg,sub_type=0,url=https://multimedia.nt.qq.com.cn/download?appid=1407&amp;fileid=EhTOaFce8CuvYdPuC2PM0L3FaQEz9BisiBIg_woo_dafn7yfkAMyBHByb2RQgL2jAVoQU_nfZU8oh8Y2POvvTe5YaXoCO5KCAQJneg&amp;rkey=CAQSMJzXt0YC2Yri0h-HO5qjbxrscEhSwUADPOojnaLSItVvWYp49QRuBraCaJYNB2JYcQ,file_size=295980]"}
