{"time": 1760300022, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1366531336", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1658014508]“那个……人偶小姐是多少号？能来帮个忙？”"}
{"time": 1760300038, "type": "recv", "message_id": "643544774", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1563887079]\"哪..哪有?我明明只剩...软弱了。\"她蹲下身，即使穿着公主般的服饰，归根到底，\"我又不是公主。\""}
{"time": 1760300072, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1462275859", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1366531336]\"68号，尊贵的客人。\"她回答到，随后跟着你进了屋，\"请问要我帮什么。\""}
{"time": 1760300116, "type": "recv", "message_id": "123291414", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“姐姐很有勇气啊...面对斑比酱，你都敢站出来，很厉害啊”"}
{"time": 1760300169, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1375870572", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“不管别人怎么看，姐姐在我心目中就是很厉害”"}
