{"time": 1760300240, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1794835497", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"诶...为什么不是伊芙帮我...\"她的声音弱弱是"}
{"time": 1760300392, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1737737280", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“因为我有点介意……肌肤接触什么的，有点……而且我力气也不够大”"}
