{"time": 1760405595, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1469371014", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "蓝色的薄膜静滞在大门中镂空的空间里，如同分隔开世界两段一般"}
{"time": 1760405646, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1809590176", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我们走吧？”"}
{"time": 1760405693, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1375127091", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“这是……还没开吗？”*看着那薄膜，看看其他人有没有进去的打算"}
{"time": 1760406060, "type": "recv", "message_id": "724277963", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "旁边的人群有些躁动，这并非正常，你们能听见学生们在交谈，\"发生什么了？\"\"丽芙学姐?为什么门没开?\"\"啊?假的吧...\"之类的议论"}
{"time": 1760406170, "type": "recv", "message_id": "767960773", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“？不会是陷阱吧，姐姐小心点”"}
{"time": 1760406202, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1994539189", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "*总感觉有种被打窝了的既视感。和艾丽西娅打个招呼“我们往后退一点”之后就拖着妃花回到之前的阴处"}
{"time": 1760406392, "type": "recv", "message_id": "363465601", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"在怕什么?\"你们后退的时候，旁边走上前两个人影，戴着黑色尖帽子的金发的人类和尖耳朵的绿头发精灵很是显眼。出口的是桃乐丝，她一边伸着懒腰一边开口，\"既然来了，我就不想走了。\"她指了指门前的门，\"这路不是很明显吗？\""}
{"time": 1760406485, "type": "recv", "message_id": "84918549", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“是这两个姐姐..”见到她们有些惊喜“她们挺厉害的,艾璃西雅姐姐跟着她们吧”"}
{"time": 1760406637, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1231767412", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“很明显吗？”*用左眼看看"}
{"time": 1760406706, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1416613917", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"不过，这后面是不是马纳利亚的学院就不清楚咯?\"在你的视野下，整个蓝色的光膜透出魔力的波动，旋转，宛若漩涡"}
{"time": 1760406766, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1742636790", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"传送阵。\"卡珊德拉压着声音，说了一句话就没再吱声。"}
{"time": 1760406796, "type": "recv", "message_id": "642244438", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=84918549]\"诶?诺诺认识吗？\"爱璃西雅闻言停下后退的脚步，看了看她们又看了看伊芙"}
{"time": 1760406831, "type": "recv", "message_id": "847720917", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“之前和她们同行过一段时间，都是很厉害的人”"}
{"time": 1760407007, "type": "recv", "message_id": "882535520", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“我不想当出头鸟”*摇摇头“这城还在不知道谁的掌控下”"}
{"time": 1760407042, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1768286266", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“不过眼下先静观其变吧”"}
{"time": 1760407281, "type": "recv", "message_id": "890108184", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"对方都借着伊瑟尔的名头给我发邀请一叙，阿桃哪来不接受的道理?\"她勾起嘴角，\"真是，有一些生气啊。\"\n旁边的卡诗黛尔难得没说什么，静静站着。"}
{"time": 1760407372, "type": "recv", "message_id": "254498532", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "说完她们一同向着门内走去，\"可以跟上。\"卡珊德拉在你心中说话，\"虽然不知道帷幕那边是什么，比起一成不变的死水，这更有趣不是么？\""}
{"time": 1760407434, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1596996542", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1768286266]爱璃西雅点点头，\"嗯...她们要进去了。\""}
{"time": 1760407446, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1907733491", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“emmm，我们也跟上？”"}
{"time": 1760407517, "type": "recv", "message_id": "507947606", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“先不说我，难道你是为了有趣才来的？”*在心中吐槽卡珊德拉"}
{"time": 1760407644, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1478902291", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=507947606]\"我当然有崇高的原因。\"她停顿了一下，\"而且，中环越来越危险了。你感觉到了异常吗？\""}
{"time": 1760407848, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1466300194", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“或许？这两天我都没怎么出门”"}
{"time": 1760407983, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1367245521", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"我真是勤勉。\"你都能看见她翻白眼的样子了，\"人可是越来越少了，哪怕是陷阱，不赶紧离开的话。\""}
{"time": 1760407990, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1973899717", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“……我倒是觉得从第一天开始就不安全”"}
{"time": 1760408215, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1576694700", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "感受一下西莉丝身上的印记"}
{"time": 1760408252, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1862640066", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1576694700]至少没感觉出什么特别的"}
{"time": 1760408305, "type": "recv", "message_id": "722613668", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“艾璃西雅姐姐怎么看”"}
{"time": 1760408306, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1706505933", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“从蒸笼里往油锅跳吗？真是……要是我会放使魔就好了。你会吗？”"}
{"time": 1760408483, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2054535259", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=722613668]\"呃...我倒是...怎样都好...\""}
{"time": 1760408524, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1054022897", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（她在中环又没家眷.jpg）"}
{"time": 1760408600, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1291279332", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1706505933]\"我看像是马上要爆炸的高压锅。\"她的语气有些笃定，\"那个王的实验失败了。秩序已然被替代，货币从始至终不见其人，剩下的只有...\""}
{"time": 1760408652, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1875716965", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（那我要问了，现在有高压锅吗）"}
{"time": 1760408756, "type": "recv", "message_id": "850851331", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“没差，在我看来其实都差不多”*摇摇头“好吧，至少诺亚应该轮不到我来担心。”"}
{"time": 1760408825, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1036018965", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(高压锅不是技术简单)"}
{"time": 1760408830, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1525130858", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“妃花，今天可能等不到宴会了。会失望吗？”*手从轮椅把手上放开，搭在妃花肩膀上。实际上是出于自己内心的不安"}
{"time": 1760408832, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1170817417", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(我不管我是kp我说了算)"}
{"time": 1760408998, "type": "recv", "message_id": "736797652", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（我没意见）"}
{"time": 1760409183, "type": "recv", "message_id": "345946776", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "一时也拿不定主意，不知道该怎么办"}
{"time": 1760409184, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1042635945", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1525130858]她轻轻地握住你的手，\"伊芙，不要怕。\"随后展颜露出令人可以安心下来的笑容，\"我会一直陪着你，说好的...妃花会送伊芙回家。\""}
{"time": 1760409363, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1706915062", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2054535259][CQ:at,qq=1252219916] “要不我们等西莉丝姐姐回来吧..”"}
{"time": 1760409491, "type": "recv", "message_id": "898568609", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"诶...现在回酒店吗？\"爱璃西雅轻声回答"}
{"time": 1760409526, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1839101935", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我也不太清楚...怎么做才是最好的”"}
{"time": 1760409684, "type": "recv", "message_id": "825762472", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“我没……好吧我是有点怕。到了这里之后体验的东西有一大半都是落差。”*叹了口气“起码现在我做好最坏的打算了”"}
{"time": 1760410105, "type": "recv", "message_id": "879033391", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=825762472]她的手心覆盖在你的手掌上，虽然微弱但是持续不断地给予你温暖，\"嗯...\"卡珊德拉不合时宜地插进来，你之前不断褪回紫色的银发再次复原，\"那就走吧，去帷幕那一边。\""}
{"time": 1760410140, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1438466293", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1839101935]这个时候桃乐丝和卡诗黛尔已经走到了门边，回头看了一眼你们，径直穿了过去，消失在原地。"}
{"time": 1760410438, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2007133505", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“那我们也走吧。”*重新握住握把，推着跑起来“跟上那两个，应该安全些吧。”"}
{"time": 1760410470, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1788128802", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1839101935]你们看见伊芙推着妃花也跟了上去。"}
{"time": 1760410521, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1084690521", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“艾璃西雅姐姐，你来做决定吧”"}
{"time": 1760410539, "type": "recv", "message_id": "983686519", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "聚在一起的学生们在丽芙带领下也挪动了脚步，周围零散的人反而还在犹豫"}
