{"time": 1760466602, "type": "recv", "message_id": "261300459", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（有些模糊是何意）"}
{"time": 1760466633, "type": "recv", "message_id": "37304236", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“师……师母……”*有点哑然，更多的是哽咽。想到这些天经历的事情，突然无比怀念在城堡绕着跑的日子……但是自己好像还是……卡珊德拉的样子"}
{"time": 1760466676, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1276737944", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“嘶...我也不太清楚西莉丝姐姐的具体位置”"}
{"time": 1760466687, "type": "recv", "message_id": "783818234", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1600587696][CQ:at,qq=1252219916] 距离能感知到吗"}
{"time": 1760467149, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2092219065", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1276737944](就是只知道在中环)"}
{"time": 1760467158, "type": "recv", "message_id": "675059049", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(不知道具体的位置)"}
{"time": 1760467183, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1743689429", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“姐姐要不还是先走吧...我自己慢慢找好了”"}
{"time": 1760467252, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1679958662", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=37304236]\"到底听没听我说话啦?就算上次处理好了边境的袭击事件，这几天又冒出头了诶?\"她们说着话从你旁边路过，爱莲娜看你在看她们，稍微点点头，洋荷则是没理会。"}
{"time": 1760467274, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1149394399", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1743689429]\"我都说要跟你一起了。\""}
{"time": 1760467295, "type": "recv", "message_id": "336448151", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“谢谢姐姐...”"}
{"time": 1760467307, "type": "recv", "message_id": "123810830", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "有些感动"}
{"time": 1760467323, "type": "recv", "message_id": "700645128", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1679958662]不过爱莲娜看到妃花的时候停了下来，\"新生?这个同学怎么了?\"她走到你旁边开口。"}
{"time": 1760467359, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1780300283", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“那我们把中环逛一圈吧...也许离西莉丝姐姐近了，我就能感知到她的位置了”"}
{"time": 1760467592, "type": "recv", "message_id": "434674062", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=700645128]“她……”*自己终究是没被认出来……不过根据和卡珊德拉的约定，她借用的是身份……倒也在意料之内。至少现在安心得多，她老人家看起来也没什么事“她最近有些虚弱，又吃了不该吃的。刚刚穿过传送门，有些不适”"}
{"time": 1760467623, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1504489280", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1780300283]声音越来越小，自己确实没有什么底气"}
{"time": 1760467722, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1584718386", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=434674062]\"传送门?\"艾莲娜看了看四周，\"最近出了远门吗？\"她看向你上下打量，\"新生应该不用做那种课题才对?\"就连洋荷都投来了视线，还是那双熟悉的瞳孔。"}
{"time": 1760467732, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1336039177", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1504489280]\"可以...先去哪\""}
{"time": 1760467889, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1869728870", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“emmm..要不先去宾森特那边看看”"}
{"time": 1760467920, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1067800486", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“姐姐说那边的人被代替了，也许她是过去调查什么了”"}
{"time": 1760467974, "type": "recv", "message_id": "356129347", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"呃...代替?\"她咀嚼着词汇，\"既然这么说...我们去看看吧...\"她带着你往那边移动"}
{"time": 1760468037, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1772733184", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1584718386]“呃？就是刚刚……从校门进来”*有些奇怪“就是中环的那个门”"}
{"time": 1760468369, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2063436241", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1772733184]\"那不是一扇普通的门吗？\"爱莲娜担忧地看了看你，\"坐传送门可不轻松。\"她低头看着妃花，\"有些错乱也是正常的，我还有事，洋荷，你送她们去一趟医务室吧？\"洋荷点了点头，不过没开口。"}
{"time": 1760468425, "type": "recv", "message_id": "901238947", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=356129347]越靠近法师塔脚下的小径，周围的温度越低，不止是你，只穿着单白裙的爱璃西雅很快就不由得抱紧自己的手臂，\"嘶...\"呼出了白气"}
{"time": 1760468462, "type": "recv", "message_id": "728302086", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“怎么...这么冷”看看周围有没有什么人"}
{"time": 1760468518, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1765753844", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2063436241]“抱歉……谢谢老师”*暗暗窃喜，忍不住多看看许久未见的洋荷“麻烦您了”"}
{"time": 1760468676, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1487611818", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=728302086]理所当然没有人，不过凭借蝙蝠的回声，你能感觉到一些形似人类的东西躺在街巷的暗处"}
{"time": 1760468735, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1051009106", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1765753844]\"...\"她点头，领着你往前走，爱莲娜往另一个方向去了。你推着妃花的轮椅，不知何时，你才发现自己的衣服变成了正经的校服，领口别着绿色的领带，你知道这象征一年级的身份。"}
{"time": 1760468747, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2087529568", "deleted": true, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“姐姐我出来吧...”"}
{"time": 1760468913, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1530803524", "deleted": true, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "从帽子里飞出来，然后用血做一件比较厚的外套“姐姐你把这个穿上吧”然后在趴回去"}
{"time": 1760468946, "type": "recv", "message_id": "822893845", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(?血就好比你的外皮)"}
{"time": 1760468950, "type": "recv", "message_id": "566542834", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(你要扒皮吗)"}
{"time": 1760468967, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1923363791", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（血应该挺多的吧）"}
{"time": 1760468996, "type": "recv", "message_id": "300736794", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（不可以就算了）"}
{"time": 1760469015, "type": "recv", "message_id": "846453388", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1051009106]“那个……最近中环里发生的事……”*犹豫了一阵，开口道“老师您了解过吗？导致学院封闭的事……”"}
{"time": 1760469070, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1055518746", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1487611818]继续感知印记“姐姐小心一点...前面好像有什么东西”和记忆中对比一下，是之前在监狱看到的东西吗"}
{"time": 1760469200, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1019704588", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=846453388]洋荷回头看了你一眼，停下脚步，\"不重要。\"态度轻描淡写，说话也很简短，说完继续沿着林间小径带着你走，不多时到了一个标致的白墙红砖的教堂样式的建筑"}
{"time": 1760469243, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1906701464", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1055518746]回声告诉你是类似人的形状，\"诶?\"本来爱璃西雅就已经在发抖了，这下连牙齿都在打战"}
{"time": 1760469297, "type": "recv", "message_id": "302480606", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1019704588]“还是和以前一样呢……”*暗暗腹诽，有种回到舒适区，昨日重现一般的安心感“妃花现在感觉怎么样？”"}
{"time": 1760469425, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1926880978", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“好..诡异的天气，先回酒店吧..至少换一套衣服”"}
{"time": 1760469536, "type": "recv", "message_id": "371671202", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=302480606]\"...\"妃花头靠着轮椅背，闭着眼睛，看上去脸色依然不太好，至少没回答你的话，呼吸依然在喘。"}
{"time": 1760469554, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2137568780", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1926880978]\"嗯...有感觉到西里斯姐姐在哪里吗？\""}
{"time": 1760469572, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1146468879", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“好像没有...”"}
{"time": 1760469596, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1818243539", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“不应该啊，怎么会这么模糊”"}
{"time": 1760469647, "type": "recv", "message_id": "442525596", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=371671202]“抱歉……马上就到了吧，应该……”*看着教堂样式的建筑，心里还盘算着应该准备什么礼物好……不过身上完全没钱"}
{"time": 1760469804, "type": "recv", "message_id": "718760543", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“先回去吧...”"}
