{"time": 1760492799, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1160446761", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1917911822]“谢谢……老师您，最近还好吗？学院现在是安全的吧？”"}
