{"time": 1760492931, "type": "recv", "message_id": "327480226", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "(运气这么好，能直接碰到西莉丝吗)"}
{"time": 1760492983, "type": "recv", "message_id": "105501896", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1160446761]“学院里并没有什么事。”她盯着你看了一会，“你认识我？”"}
{"time": 1760493063, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2125927786", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（感觉龙哥又入幻境了）"}
