{"time": 1760525791, "type": "recv", "message_id": "851159649", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1980960300]纵使对魔法领域知之甚少，你依然感觉到她此刻绝对不轻松，就像在同时进行多个线程的精密操作，汗珠从额头一滴一滴滴落，但她没空去管。\n与此同时，你感觉妃花的心跳有些不稳定，一会快一会慢，她传来了一些不安的情绪"}
{"time": 1760525931, "type": "recv", "message_id": "761865546", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "*在心中想象握住她的手，反复安抚着她“没事的……会好起来的”"}
{"time": 1760526496, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1926272338", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2037913082]显然她们并不在，埃尔低着头没有回你"}
{"time": 1760526585, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1657221744", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=761865546]仿佛是听到了你的话，她的心跳逐渐平稳，淡淡的安心感传到你的心中，耶拉的表情也同时舒缓下来。"}
{"time": 1760526627, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1245674832", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“艾尔前辈？艾尔姐姐？”靠过去看看，有点迷茫"}
{"time": 1760526936, "type": "recv", "message_id": "188092297", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1245674832]\"...\"她抬起眸子，看向你，\"...\"她倒也没有对你为什么在这发出疑问，\"不要带她做危险的事。\"她简截了当地开口"}
{"time": 1760527044, "type": "recv", "message_id": "323585096", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我....我..对不起...我会努力保护艾璃西雅姐姐的，等我回去了”"}
{"time": 1760527052, "type": "recv", "message_id": "29866680", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我就带她回学院...”"}
{"time": 1760527236, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1407173560", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1657221744]*在耶拉发话前，还是先不出声了。身上汗出得有些发粘，于是扯扯领口"}
{"time": 1760527575, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1157939957", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“但是...为什么，我在这里？”还是有点迷茫"}
{"time": 1760528268, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2099676995", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1407173560]绿色的领带被你拉松，这款校服穿在身上倒也不突兀，裁剪得很好的同时，透气也做得很好。"}
{"time": 1760528284, "type": "recv", "message_id": "288924606", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1157939957]\"...你误入了我的领地，仅此而已。\""}
{"time": 1760528460, "type": "recv", "message_id": "367201353", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“对..对不起”"}
{"time": 1760528472, "type": "recv", "message_id": "962780503", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2099676995]*扶着椅背站起来，这样方便看清妃花的情况"}
{"time": 1760528526, "type": "recv", "message_id": "61366362", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“那个..前辈..可以问您一件事吗，中环到底发生了什么..是幻境吗？”"}
{"time": 1760528723, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1173769273", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=962780503]妃花的情况肉眼可见地好转，面色重归红润，耶拉也放松下来，羽翼的嗡鸣声渐渐降频，\"呼....\"她长舒一口气，汗水早已遍布额头。"}
{"time": 1760528808, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1853325727", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=61366362]\"没有理解吗？\"下一瞬，她的桌上出现了整个中环的立体地图，\"你身边不是早有人推测是蜘蛛做的?\""}
{"time": 1760528880, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1288048960", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“嗯....主要是比较好奇原理，想知道有没有什么解决的办法”"}
{"time": 1760529021, "type": "recv", "message_id": "796181134", "deleted": true, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1173769273]“好……好了呢？”*小心翼翼开口"}
{"time": 1760529100, "type": "recv", "message_id": "258096515", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1173769273]“好……好了吗？”*小心翼翼开口"}
{"time": 1760531189, "type": "recv", "message_id": "717639862", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1288048960]\"将自己的权能分散在自己的蛛丝中，最后将编织的梦境融入现实，就是这样。\"她点了点面前的地图上的几个点，\"我在自己的世界中被剔除她编织的梦境。\""}
{"time": 1760531227, "type": "recv", "message_id": "466991094", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "看看那几个点是哪些位置"}
{"time": 1760531631, "type": "recv", "message_id": "894816992", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=258096515]\"之后只需要静养，不要有大的情绪波动。\"她拿出手帕抹干净自己的脸颊，\"你跟我过来，我们要仔细谈谈。\""}
{"time": 1760531791, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1757151381", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=894816992]“好”*一瘸一拐，有些心虚地跟着"}
{"time": 1760531869, "type": "recv", "message_id": "93381628", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“所以我去那几个点把蛛网破坏就可以解除幻境了吗...”"}
