{"time": 1760535708, "type": "recv", "message_id": "353702718", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=696723082]\"她?\"耶拉呼出口气，\"这姑娘倒是没什么大碍，也不知道是幸运还是不幸。\""}
