{"time": 1760549407, "type": "recv", "message_id": "567106320", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1312714912]\"什么乱七八糟的。\"她的声音不耐烦，\"没事别打扰斑比睡觉。\""}
{"time": 1760549492, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1471948416", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“等下斑比酱...我真的回不去了，你应该也知道中环现在都是莎木纳克雅的幻境吧，我好像被她赶出去了”"}
{"time": 1760549528, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1773719466", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我回去的时候会给斑比带血的”"}
{"time": 1760549547, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1917459967", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "(?"}
{"time": 1760549571, "type": "recv", "message_id": "392986328", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1773719466]（又来？）"}
{"time": 1760549590, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1665462291", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（这是她唯一感兴趣的东西了吧（）"}
{"time": 1760549641, "type": "recv", "message_id": "535314841", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1765950657]\"应该说，就算那是陷阱，你也自己走进去了?\"耶拉扶着额头，\"你们这些新生，一天到晚在想些什么?学生会又在干嘛，也不管管。\""}
{"time": 1760549699, "type": "recv", "message_id": "783456735", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“……就当是我欠她的。我没法放着不管。”*摇摇头“现在怎么办？逃跑有用吗……”"}
{"time": 1760549703, "type": "recv", "message_id": "819677004", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1773719466]\"不要，我很缺血吗？\"她的声音带着乏味，\"斑比酱和你要血，只是一时兴起，现在没兴趣了。\""}
{"time": 1760549776, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1337628711", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“那...斑比酱也不想见到我了吗.....我很想见斑比”"}
{"time": 1760550033, "type": "recv", "message_id": "370962430", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=783456735]\"吊着呗，反正死不了。\"她拿起前台的杯子，咕噜噜喝起来，看起来显然是渴坏了"}
{"time": 1760550081, "type": "recv", "message_id": "499552534", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1337628711]\"不听话的眷属，见你干什么?\"你听见她打着哈欠，\"我要睡了。\""}
{"time": 1760550205, "type": "recv", "message_id": "578283980", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=370962430]“……好吧”*看起来倒是很快就接受了“……会一直痛？”"}
{"time": 1760550221, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1405829684", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我会听话的...斑比酱不要讨厌我...”但这样的话只会让斑比更生气吧，最后还是放弃了“好吧...斑比酱再见”"}
{"time": 1760550315, "type": "recv", "message_id": "340835512", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1405829684]她没有回复你，血管里不再有声音。"}
{"time": 1760550354, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1467162300", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“艾尔前辈，我之前遇见了一件奇怪的事情，不知道跟当下的处境有没有关联....当时在幻境内有一所名为收敛办事处的建筑,但不知道为什么我忽然意识到了那个建筑从未存在过，之后我就完全看不见那个建筑了...在其他人的视角里，我甚至可以穿墙”"}
{"time": 1760550400, "type": "recv", "message_id": "654829488", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=578283980]\"会一直痛，不过到后面也就习惯了吧。哦——\"她拖长音，\"对了，还不能完全不管，现在的情况来看，最多一个月，你会被完全拖入安息之中。\""}
{"time": 1760550410, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1468666274", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(原来是渐冻症)"}
{"time": 1760550539, "type": "recv", "message_id": "447395545", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（你怎么不说是失熵症）"}
{"time": 1760550618, "type": "recv", "message_id": "883766166", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“……有办法解决吗？肯定有办法解决的吧”*有点底气不足“我不想死……”"}
{"time": 1760550655, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1143311182", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1467162300]\"...\"她重新呼出地图，\"在哪?\""}
{"time": 1760550672, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1584138452", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "为她指明那个地点"}
{"time": 1760550859, "type": "recv", "message_id": "104252399", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=883766166]\"也不算死吧？\"她放下水杯，观察着你的表情，\"只是会做一场醒不来的梦。\""}
{"time": 1760550931, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1725192934", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“那和死了也没什么区别”*低下头“……醒不来的梦，就不叫梦了”"}
{"time": 1760550940, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1385437278", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1584138452]你不巧正好点在了一处节点上，她看见后一时没有开口，\"从那个时候，就开始了吗？我说，你当时是不是被什么东西缠上了。\""}
{"time": 1760551243, "type": "recv", "message_id": "432101220", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“什么意思....”"}
{"time": 1760551267, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1096672456", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“第一次进入那个建筑的事情...我好像记得不是很清楚了”"}
{"time": 1760551319, "type": "recv", "message_id": "521492464", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1725192934]\"好了。\"她拍拍手，\"自然是有办法的，我这里有三个方案，上中下，你想听哪一个?\""}
{"time": 1760551342, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1894048479", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“不能都听吗……？”"}
{"time": 1760551429, "type": "recv", "message_id": "263457283", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1096672456]\"算了，和我没关系。\"她抹掉桌上的地图模型，端起凭空出现的茶杯，\"遗留着的某样东西，让你偶尔能游离到世界之外。那必然是和构成蜘蛛的世界，本质极为相似的东西。\""}
{"time": 1760551596, "type": "recv", "message_id": "774111722", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我想想....”"}
{"time": 1760551600, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1526471605", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1894048479]\"上策是我现在帮你彻底抹掉这条腿，一了百了。中策嘛，每个星期来我这里做一次理疗，可以保你三年左右无碍。下策的话，去找到不戮或者安息，之后。\"她停下话头，\"当然啦，如果有什么能凌驾于诅咒之上，也可以试试。\""}
{"time": 1760551665, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1079586281", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（龙哥帮我想想我身上有什么道具）"}
{"time": 1760551751, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1129112320", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“对了前辈，蜘蛛在灾杰里对应的是哪一条条例”"}
{"time": 1760551848, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1291298957", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“……你有什么头绪吗”*心里问问卡珊德拉"}
{"time": 1760551861, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2029299838", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1079586281]（你知道的，我不知道（）"}
{"time": 1760552038, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1188968411", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1129112320]\"开海之人曾言十诫。\"埃尔看了你一眼，\"唯一，破坏，沉默，安息，侮蔑，不戮，爱欲，掠夺，真实和饥饿。\"她停了下来，\"蜘蛛会对应哪一条?\""}
{"time": 1760552067, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1010165297", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“真实？”"}
