{"time": 1760587993, "type": "recv", "message_id": "891527822", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1355329405]\"...\"房间里沉默下来，过了一会，她才语气坚定地开口，\"那...伊芙要答应我，千万不能勉强自己，好吗？\""}
{"time": 1760588144, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1509515125", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“当然当然，我很怕痛的”*点点头“说起来，妃花差不多好了的话，就该走了？答应了耶拉小姐不能过夜的”"}
{"time": 1760588145, "type": "recv", "message_id": "601888461", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=504687973]珊栏门推开，步出的时候。世界在你面前流转开来，随后...你再次睁开眼，自己躺在一个套房客厅的沙发上。"}
{"time": 1760588160, "type": "recv", "message_id": "448115923", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（是不是该两级反转了）"}
{"time": 1760588168, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1909891430", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（自己坐轮椅了该）"}
{"time": 1760588224, "type": "recv", "message_id": "814965880", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我这是...回来了吗”四处找找艾璃西雅和西莉丝"}
{"time": 1760588374, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1131274822", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1509515125]\"我们去哪...\"妃花松了一口气，然后点点头，\"嗯...伊芙什么时候换了这身衣服?\""}
{"time": 1760588396, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1216175514", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=814965880]都不在这个客厅的样子。"}
{"time": 1760588430, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2008604436", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "这个客厅是之前住的那个套房吗"}
{"time": 1760588436, "type": "recv", "message_id": "12347126", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "看看68在不在"}
{"time": 1760588497, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1461071981", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1131274822]“大概是卡珊德拉干的吧，她很怀念校园生活的样子”*耸耸肩“去找找密会的通知，要是没找到……我们就去生命科看看好了”"}
{"time": 1760588680, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1352461719", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2008604436]人偶也不在，客厅里空空荡荡"}
{"time": 1760588696, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1026057375", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "去卧室里看看了"}
{"time": 1760588731, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1465485888", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1461071981]\"嗯...都听伊芙的。\"她的目光看向床边的轮椅，随后对着你眨眨眼。"}
{"time": 1760588969, "type": "recv", "message_id": "750511434", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“喔，轮到我了。”*嘟了嘟嘴“还好啦，现在暂时还没痛到那个地步”*话虽这么说，还是在轮椅上坐下"}
{"time": 1760589067, "type": "recv", "message_id": "947229192", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1026057375]你推开一个卧室门，只看见粉色头发的女孩安静地躺在床上。"}
{"time": 1760589114, "type": "recv", "message_id": "482538506", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "让她在睡一会吧，轻轻关起门，再看看另一个房间"}
{"time": 1760589152, "type": "recv", "message_id": "419161610", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=750511434]妃花从床上坐起来，很是花了一些时间才慢吞吞地站起身，\"...\"试着走了两步，\"嗯...身体，感觉很好...\""}
{"time": 1760589494, "type": "recv", "message_id": "519444959", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“嗯哼，是时候享受生活了”"}
{"time": 1760589645, "type": "recv", "message_id": "637419537", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=482538506]当然是西里斯，不过人偶在这里，坐在床边的椅子上，似乎是在看护。西里斯身上的伤口都被仔细处理过，不过显然没有醒。"}
{"time": 1760589673, "type": "recv", "message_id": "187231774", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（吃个饭）"}
{"time": 1760589916, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1940299833", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=519444959]她推着你出门，路过依然坐在前台的耶拉时停了下来，\"谢谢您。\"她郑重开口。"}
{"time": 1760590513, "type": "recv", "message_id": "104625379", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(龙神也睡了？)"}
{"time": 1760590524, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1175035701", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（也没我事啊（）"}
{"time": 1760590659, "type": "recv", "message_id": "792108927", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1940299833]\"没关系，谁让我今天在这里值班呢。\"耶拉耸耸肩，\"新生就不要老是想着到处冒险了，一不留神二不留神，一个个地添加我的工作量。\""}
{"time": 1760590692, "type": "recv", "message_id": "245114826", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=637419537][CQ:at,qq=1252219916] 松了一口气，找把椅子在旁边坐着，准备等西莉丝姐姐醒来"}
{"time": 1760590745, "type": "recv", "message_id": "354450995", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=792108927]“嗯……”*有些无奈“只是中环最近……有点身不由己”"}
{"time": 1760590972, "type": "recv", "message_id": "883937032", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=354450995]\"好好，我知道了。\"她推推手，\"去吧去吧，如果今晚没有再次出现在我的病房上，我就谢天谢地了。\""}
{"time": 1760591044, "type": "recv", "message_id": "493725675", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“我尽量。”*点点头“谢谢您，再……呃，不在这里见”"}
{"time": 1760591158, "type": "recv", "message_id": "854429154", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=245114826]\"...\"人偶看了你一眼，倒也没说什么，继续把视线转回床上的人。"}
{"time": 1760591178, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2073919354", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“谢谢....”"}
{"time": 1760591239, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1027370071", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=493725675]妃花推着轮椅，走出教堂，久违的新鲜阳光洒在你们脸上，空气中带着春天独有的芳香。\"往哪边走?伊芙。\"妃花的情绪明显好了一些。"}
{"time": 1760591273, "type": "recv", "message_id": "987216186", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（该睡了）"}
{"time": 1760591277, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1000685038", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（午安）"}
{"time": 1760591604, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1728778298", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2073919354](多想有一双没有视力的眼睛。)"}
{"time": 1760592744, "type": "recv", "message_id": "935912747", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1728778298]（怎么了）"}
{"time": 1760596356, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2033906144", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1027370071]“我也不熟这里的路，你认识的话，食堂？”"}
{"time": 1760596648, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1096865807", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2073919354]（谢谢之后呢？）"}
