{"time": 1760607227, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1157984108", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2033906144]\"我也不懂啦...\"妃花推着你在教堂前的空地上转了转，虽然一直有在控制表情，不过还是难掩轻轻勾起的嘴角。"}
{"time": 1760607332, "type": "recv", "message_id": "162860805", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=804022588]一直到晚饭时间，西里斯还是没有醒来的迹象，不过爱璃西雅倒是醒了，她拖着散开的长发轻轻推开了房门，\"唔...\""}
{"time": 1760607359, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1228400623", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“你醒了啊，艾璃西雅姐姐..正好我有事要告诉你”"}
{"time": 1760607492, "type": "recv", "message_id": "144578164", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我之前昏迷之后见到了艾尔哦，她很担心你...”"}
{"time": 1760607823, "type": "recv", "message_id": "839269874", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=144578164]\"埃尔...\"她愣住了，眼睛回避开你的视线，\"我不信...\"语气弱弱的，没什么说服力。"}
{"time": 1760607862, "type": "recv", "message_id": "485914621", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“真的，我什么时候骗过姐姐你，她想让你回去...”"}
{"time": 1760607920, "type": "recv", "message_id": "542529187", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1157984108]“哎呀……可是时间不早了呐，今天都没怎么吃东西”*轻咳一声“不过我倒是知道个风景不错的地方”"}
{"time": 1760607939, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1228756311", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“艾尔前辈说只要你催动你的无色戒指，就可以离开了....”"}
{"time": 1760607971, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2046588852", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（说起来你为什么没问艾尔对艾璃西亚的态度）"}
{"time": 1760607989, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1628189578", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（艾尔很在意艾璃西雅啊（）"}
{"time": 1760607995, "type": "recv", "message_id": "876722522", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（感觉她一直在视奸）"}
{"time": 1760608106, "type": "recv", "message_id": "949337556", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（对啊）"}
