{"time": 1760609569, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1268078623", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1351701713]\"诶...\"她转过身，迈步准备离开，\"不知道啦...和我没关系吧...\""}
{"time": 1760609666, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1865838663", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“艾尔姐姐，想要让你回去，她能维持与你的联系好像没有多长时间了，这里真的很危险....”"}
{"time": 1760609730, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1660207649", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "上前拽住她..."}
{"time": 1760609751, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2069749163", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（你看，所以，为什么不问呢）"}
{"time": 1760609756, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1098584856", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“姐姐之前不是也想离开么...等我处理完中环的事情之后，会去找你的”"}
{"time": 1760609821, "type": "recv", "message_id": "70918922", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=201575579]路过的学生给你大致指了指方位，\"不过马上下课了，人应该不少诶。\""}
{"time": 1760610068, "type": "recv", "message_id": "894263413", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1098584856]\"埃尔...想让我回去?\"她停下脚步，回过头对着你笑了笑，笑容中藏着些落寞，\"不可能的了...这么久了都...怎么可能..\""}
{"time": 1760610166, "type": "recv", "message_id": "246321978", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=70918922]“人多也……”*叹了口气，拿出糖罐自己挑一粒吃“我可能还能再撑会。妃花你呢？”"}
{"time": 1760610181, "type": "recv", "message_id": "685187416", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“真的...我之前和艾尔聊了，她似乎一直在默默的注视着姐姐，姐姐身边发生的事情很多她都知道...而且之前姐姐背西莉丝姐姐回来的时候，我看见了一个很像艾尔的身影...然后姐姐忽然就健步如飞了”"}
{"time": 1760610212, "type": "recv", "message_id": "644102328", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“艾尔不想姐姐再身陷险境了，她真的很关心姐姐...”"}
{"time": 1760610265, "type": "recv", "message_id": "967376166", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（原来是鼬帮佐助搓千鸟）"}
{"time": 1760610352, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1902719420", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(?)"}
