{"time": 1760614206, "type": "recv", "message_id": "810804547", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "又搞砸了,为什么自己什么都做不好，坐在一旁的椅子上懊恼"}
