{"time": 1760640435, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2010179507", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "*等妃花把自己推走.jpg"}
{"time": 1760640656, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1522190051", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1333375610]\"...爱璃西雅。\"埃尔蹲下来，轻轻摸着爱璃西雅的脑袋，\"对不起，姐姐错了。\"你感觉怀里的爱璃西雅顿时身体一僵，只低低地抽着鼻子。"}
{"time": 1760640734, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1730595181", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2010179507]妃花看你半天没有开口，对方显然也没有交谈的兴致，\"好吧。\"妃花耸耸肩，推着你进了图书馆的大门。"}
{"time": 1760640878, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1436164603", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“嗯……到了这里……”*进入错综复杂的内部，犹豫了一下，打算站起来“停一下，你看，我的腿现在还好好的。在这里面推来推去不方便吧？”"}
{"time": 1760640931, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1145712607", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“艾尔前辈真的很在意艾璃西雅姐姐的，对吧”看向艾尔，示意她多说一点"}
{"time": 1760641081, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1156932566", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1436164603]\"不行啦。\"她按住你，\"伊芙要好好听我的话呢。怎么能让伤员乱走?\"紧接着开口，\"不过既然认识，刚刚问一问也没什么不好吧？接下来去哪\""}
{"time": 1760641169, "type": "recv", "message_id": "66328954", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“现在还不是……我的意思是，你可以去看自己感兴趣的。”*摇了摇头“我要去了解一下精灵……而已”"}
{"time": 1760641416, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1164779801", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1145712607]\"...\"埃尔的手轻轻抚开爱璃西雅的前额碎发，\"我联系不上你...不是不理你了...对不起，那一天，凶了你...\""}
{"time": 1760641443, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1840736883", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=66328954]\"诶，那我们一起。\""}
{"time": 1760641540, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1626346383", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1840736883]\"反正我也没什么想看的，感兴趣的也几乎没有。\"她露出笑容，\"妃花的话，带伊芙过去就好了。\""}
{"time": 1760641563, "type": "recv", "message_id": "936041355", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1840736883]“明明我还没有到不能自理的程度？”*歪了歪头，看看种族学或者社会学的部分在哪里"}
{"time": 1760641571, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1223989238", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“艾璃西雅姐姐..你也有很多话想对艾尔说吧...都说出来吧，不要在一个人承担了...”拍拍她的背"}
{"time": 1760641810, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1787738516", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1223989238]“没有...没有。”不过你感觉爱璃西雅的肩膀很明显放松了下来，不再紧绷，“只是说这种话，不能弥补我这些天的...这些天的...”她一时语塞，“总之不行，我不原谅的。”"}
{"time": 1760641836, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1832917066", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（嘻嘻，我最喜欢的左右互搏怀旧）"}
{"time": 1760641839, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1532405667", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（环节）"}
{"time": 1760641918, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1491879567", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=936041355]似乎在树冠附近，有一个专门的种族收录厅，具体的位置就在那一天曾和卡珊德拉去的顶层下面一点。"}
{"time": 1760641933, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1298149144", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "感觉自己在这里其实有一点点尴尬...不知道说什么比较合适，不对不对...看一眼艾璃西雅身上还有没有那种阴影"}
{"time": 1760641974, "type": "recv", "message_id": "314171997", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1491879567]“在很上面的地方啊……嗯……从这边上去”"}
{"time": 1760641981, "type": "recv", "message_id": "209387119", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1298149144]埃尔都没有提起，在进入这里的时候就被抹掉了"}
{"time": 1760642078, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1396867198", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=314171997](路上可以过个幸运)"}
{"time": 1760642094, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1797126876", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "松了一口气，不过等会要询问一下艾尔前辈那到底是什么，现在还是先努力解决姐妹之间的矛盾吧“艾尔前辈抱抱艾璃西雅？”"}
{"time": 1760642107, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1764962635", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "。rd+1"}
{"time": 1760642107, "type": "reply", "message_id": "1764962635", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": 2875548981, "name": "小雅"}, "message": "[伊芙]演奏出: 1D20+1={6}+1=7"}
{"time": 1760642352, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1244024492", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1797126876]\"...\"埃尔似乎有些愣住，\"我...\"她看了看爱璃西雅的表情，随后果断伸出手抱住了爱璃西雅，稍微用力把人从你怀中抱了出来"}
{"time": 1760642448, "type": "recv", "message_id": "263576647", "deleted": true, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "松开手，感觉这种场合，自己待在这好像不太合适，悄悄向后退去，去找鹿玩了"}
{"time": 1760642464, "type": "recv", "message_id": "977291953", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=314171997]走了很一会，你们才堪堪到了顶层的树冠，从这里往上是树顶，向左是种族收录厅，往右似乎是观景台"}
{"time": 1760642468, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2040229465", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "松开手，感觉这种场合，自己待在这好像不太合适，悄悄向后退去，做到鹿旁边，摸一摸它"}
{"time": 1760642516, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1962672150", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=977291953]“向左……不对，到了这里，我自己推轮子就可以了。那边的观景台，妃花可以去看看？”"}
{"time": 1760642521, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1943899117", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（忽然想到一段好变态的rp,致敬爱情公寓 鹿..鹿...露露!然后回忆过往）"}
{"time": 1760642565, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1125364562", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(?)"}
{"time": 1760642576, "type": "recv", "message_id": "354690349", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（？）"}
{"time": 1760642589, "type": "recv", "message_id": "739774464", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（你在中国吗你就🦌）"}
{"time": 1760642617, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1608016767", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（还真是）"}
{"time": 1760642653, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1337382704", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1962672150]\"诶...\"她随后点点头，\"好吧，那我就去那边看看啦?\"她看向右边，\"这边是不是有点奇怪，总感觉会是什么怪谈会出现的地方。嗯...伊芙听说过什么图书馆的传言吗？\""}
{"time": 1760642710, "type": "recv", "message_id": "10234475", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“有倒是有……图书馆里的幽灵公主什么的。感觉只要是和魔法书库有关的故事里都会有这么个桃金娘”"}
{"time": 1760642711, "type": "recv", "message_id": "456337896", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2040229465]小鹿呦呦鸣叫，舔了舔你的手心"}
{"time": 1760642778, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1162652654", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "拔一点草，喂给它吃，久违的感觉到了..安心？"}
{"time": 1760642862, "type": "recv", "message_id": "504576478", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=10234475]\"诶...那我倒是很有兴趣，嗯...\"她停下来，微微弯腰背起手，\"那我可要去会一会这个幽灵公主——\"她拖个长音，蹦蹦跳跳地往右边走去。"}
{"time": 1760642939, "type": "recv", "message_id": "383326792", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "心中又有些焦急，觉得不是做这些事的时候..但是不忍打扰姐妹相续，如果自己还能见到家人的话..怎么可能，自嘲般的摇摇头，还是在一旁静静的等着吧，等会和艾璃西雅姐姐告个别，顺便问问艾尔黑色液体的事情...摸摸小鹿的头，缓解一下略微有些焦躁的心情"}
{"time": 1760642975, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1726254560", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=504576478]“虽然我也觉得应该真的有吧……不过我没有什么和灵魂交流的办法。总之，注意安全”*自己推着轮子进左侧的收录馆了"}
{"time": 1760643160, "type": "recv", "message_id": "824741652", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=383326792]姐妹两在庭院另一侧，爱璃西雅似乎再难以绷住自己的心情，在埃尔的怀中默默哭泣，埃尔只是一直拍拍她的背，不过总算是放松下来。"}
{"time": 1760643224, "type": "recv", "message_id": "424265529", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "真好啊，为艾璃西雅姐姐感到开心...希望她以后也可以多自信一点就好了"}
{"time": 1760643298, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1198850943", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1726254560]收录馆的样子与其说是图书室，不如说是博览馆，占据了很大的空间。每一个物种都有单独的可动画像"}
{"time": 1760643322, "type": "recv", "message_id": "27627607", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "*那么，自然要先找到“精灵”"}
{"time": 1760643490, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2115995006", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "精灵的画像位居种族的前列，其标志性的尖耳朵和极其出众的样貌让你不由得多看了一眼。不过似乎没有什么藏书陈列在其下。"}
{"time": 1760643553, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1391705574", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=424265529]过了良久，爱璃西雅才从她怀里起身，她和埃尔一同看向你，\"诺诺...你要回去吗？\""}
{"time": 1760643563, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1684104691", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“是不是太神秘了点……明明看着也没有遮遮掩掩的”*在为数不多的一点里翻看"}
{"time": 1760643672, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1635977154", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“嗯...先不谈西莉丝姐姐和斑比还在那里，而且蜘蛛害了那么多人，我不想让她的计划如愿以偿..我一定要阻止她.”握紧拳头“艾尔前辈可以告诉我，那黑色阴影是什么，该如何化解吗...”"}
{"time": 1760643932, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2061695011", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1684104691]仅有的几行记叙如下，精灵并非单纯的“森林住民”，而是与神族关系最深、也因此背负着沉重宿命的古老种族。\n精灵是最初被神族选中，作为其在人间的代行者与管理者而创造的种族。他们曾沐浴在纯粹的神恩之下，拥有接近神族的魔法亲和力与漫长的寿命，负责维护世界的秩序与平衡。相传，她们如今还留有传说中的世界之树。"}
{"time": 1760644058, "type": "recv", "message_id": "83245397", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2061695011]“嗯……完全没提到喜好……”*有些无奈地合上“不过和神族有关……之后说不定可以问问师母”"}
{"time": 1760644105, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2082287405", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1635977154]\"那是...吉尔内莉莎的权能。\"埃尔看向你，不咸不淡地开口，\"安息借用她的权能渗透了那里。\"\n爱璃西雅挽着埃尔的手臂，似乎在斟酌什么。"}
{"time": 1760644204, "type": "recv", "message_id": "673328825", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“有什么...预防的手段吗”"}
{"time": 1760644254, "type": "recv", "message_id": "415809473", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=83245397]你阅读完这些记叙，突然听到了熟悉的声音从你身后响起，“这位同学？你也对精灵感兴趣吗？”"}
{"time": 1760644331, "type": "recv", "message_id": "494159768", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=673328825]“很简单，情绪稳定之人，不会被她找上。”埃尔侧过头看着爱璃西雅，“情绪是饥饿的信息素。”"}
{"time": 1760644380, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1226224939", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“那假如已经被缠上了...该怎么办”"}
{"time": 1760644450, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1479038655", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=415809473]“嗯？”*回头看看是谁"}
{"time": 1760644559, "type": "recv", "message_id": "513977786", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1226224939]\"...\"她停了一会没开口，最后说出四个字，\"心怀希望。\""}
{"time": 1760644575, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2096409003", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（sb）"}
{"time": 1760644646, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1410121507", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“谢谢艾尔前辈....那关于破坏蜘蛛网的事情，可以也告诉我吗..我不太想碰运气去找人”"}
{"time": 1760644679, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1064938445", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1479038655]白色短发，异色瞳的眼睛一蓝一金，你似乎有点印象?但和外表不同，她的声音你听过太多，曾在你心中响起了无数次，也曾面对面交谈过。"}
{"time": 1760644740, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1532751958", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“卡……”*声音卡在喉头，内心的真实想法是……见鬼了“学姐……？”"}
{"time": 1760644740, "type": "recv", "message_id": "389014672", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:image,file=A0AE09400B03B04109505D2459D8F2DE.jpg,sub_type=0,url=https://multimedia.nt.qq.com.cn/download?appid=1407&amp;fileid=EhQLt4cCdJL0ckpjtYgS-6Mx6TDZyhjU1wog_wooqb6k4sCpkAMyBHByb2RQgL2jAVoQUwzTTXjPrQRU_hNeNvsoaHoCh9yCAQJneg&amp;rkey=CAESMM8cj11FyE0Z-9zBN1WBcnxxC4uBvHNUqmBM5jb3w2epx7BgJP75OXRP_pO8f5mrYg,file_size=175060]"}
