{"time": 1760648875, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1115291923", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“？斑比？”"}
{"time": 1760648959, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1320158190", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1520705051]\"密会当然还没开始啊，中环的事情解决了吗？\"她扶着额头，\"当时桃乐丝那个麻烦的家伙也说过吧？就算知道是陷阱，她也奉陪这种话。\"她叹口气，\"队伍不好带啊，两个笨蛋。算了，你想去哪?\""}
{"time": 1760649025, "type": "recv", "message_id": "223952258", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1115291923]\"再次见面?\"血液中传出低沉的含着怒气声音，\"你要去哪?\""}
{"time": 1760649067, "type": "recv", "message_id": "826290707", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我要去阻止莎木纳克雅...破坏掉这个梦境”"}
{"time": 1760649091, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1111789368", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1320158190]“大概是……去食堂。你不饿吗？之后还要看看能不能找到阿丽娅小姐……”"}
{"time": 1760649148, "type": "recv", "message_id": "108675302", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“任凭她继续搞下去，中环的人会全部死掉的...”"}
{"time": 1760649235, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2017255900", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=108675302]（那不是正好.jpg）"}
{"time": 1760649238, "type": "recv", "message_id": "538895507", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“不过万一我被她抓住，大概会十死无生吧，所以来和斑比告个别，希望还能在看斑比一眼...”"}
{"time": 1760649367, "type": "recv", "message_id": "711732614", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1111789368]\"我和你们一样吗？\"她翻了个好看的白眼，\"你拜托我不就好了，只是这么点事。阿丽娅在这个时间点可不在马纳利亚。\""}
{"time": 1760649395, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1146631137", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=538895507]血液将你越缠越紧，\"我允许了吗？\""}
{"time": 1760649405, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1033967857", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（感觉又要和你签契约了（）"}
{"time": 1760649478, "type": "recv", "message_id": "714330979", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=711732614]“喔——那你之前在哪呢？”*翻个白眼“还是说现在的马纳利亚里你吃瘪太多，所以不得不消失？”"}
{"time": 1760649490, "type": "recv", "message_id": "568856347", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“斑比是..在担心我吗...”有些喘不过气"}
{"time": 1760649615, "type": "recv", "message_id": "88480699", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我肯定不会轻易的被蜘蛛抓住的...我其实..也蛮惜命的....”"}
{"time": 1760649671, "type": "recv", "message_id": "463438662", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=714330979]\"...我可是很辛苦的，见到我不高兴?\"她没好气地驳回来，\"一群麻烦的家伙蠢蠢欲动，妃花和我都是高危人群诶。\""}
{"time": 1760649757, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1604976395", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“希望斑比可以允许我前去...”"}
{"time": 1760649772, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1750270343", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=88480699]\"担心?\"血液发出一声嗤笑，\"你这样的眷属，为什么值得斑比担心?\"紧接着血液上行到你脖子上，\"真是...不快，严重不快。\""}
{"time": 1760649782, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1500899118", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=463438662]“你经历过一次了的话，找人帮忙不就好了。”*坐回轮椅上“……只有我真的是想来度假的吗？”"}
{"time": 1760649856, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1175648882", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“对不起...我应该是个很烂的眷属吧...”"}
{"time": 1760649858, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1076248113", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（我怎么还没睡）"}
{"time": 1760649982, "type": "recv", "message_id": "661404420", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1500899118]\"为什么会是经历过一次。\"她推着你出了门，\"在百年后的密会这件事上，我和你知道的东西差不多，而且，我也没什么可以找的人了。\"不知为何，说出来这话的时候总感觉她有些落寞。"}
{"time": 1760650004, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1013923101", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我一直都在惹斑比酱生气...也不知道怎么让斑比酱开心..斑比讨厌我也很正常...”"}
{"time": 1760650043, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1352707224", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1175648882]\"作为眷属，裹挟身为主人的斑比。\"她的声音越发清晰，\"我直接杀了你，好不好?\""}
