{"time": 1760651031, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1390734552", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=148534829]\"不过，既然我是主角，伊芙妹妹当然也，跑不掉呢。\"她咯咯笑出声，\"这次还能拉你垫背，心情大好。\""}
{"time": 1760651031, "type": "recv", "message_id": "538412505", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“斑比酱想要我怎么做,我会尽全力去做的...”"}
